<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Satawalese</book>
  <para style="h">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fangkenio We Foatogiaen Luke</para>
  <para style="mt">Fangkenio We Foatogiaen Luke</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Fangkenio we Foatogiaen Luke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Aerhaengerhaeng Theophilus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Aeremas towunap re oarhorho pwe repwe foatogi kkepesaen meeta kka a wewwen me neeimaem. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Iir ra foatogi meeta kka e itto ngaeniir me reer rhooakka ra fasiun weri minikkeei me nee rhaepetaen nge ra aepesa iiy kkepas mwamwaai we. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Iwe een pwonno iga iya wori firhiy oanongaen minikkeei saengi pweoneotaen, iya niuwaennei pwe epwe mwamwaai pwe ipwe foatogi wunuunun aetettaeniin ngaeniug. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Iya feeori minneei pwe een wopwe giuneei gacchiuw minna wenewenen oanongaen meeta kkewe ra kapwiung ngaeniug.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kkepesaen Wupwutiwen John Baptist</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Noan oatowe Erotes eno pwe <char style="tl">king</char>aaen Judea, eno erhai patere itan Zechariah, iiy e tapweei tettaenin patereen Abijah. Itaen rhooapwut na rhooan ngaenneyan nge Elizabeth; nge iiy epwan itto saengi eew faminiin patere. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Iir me riiurhai nge e igin mwamwaai noan meneweer faaen mesaen Deus nge re tapweei gacchiuw oanongaen aaen Soamwoon anniug me akkiuneo. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Iir esooar naiiur pwe Elizabeth ese mmwenen nainai, nge igina mwo nge ra igin tugufaeyi.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Eraaen nge Zechariah a itinong feeori aan engaang noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, pwe a toori oaton ginigin we aan epwe engaang noan raaenin we. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Noan peigin aaen engaang patere, nge iiy minne ra fini pwe epwe fifi oappwongesaen wooan antar. Iwe a toonong noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we aaen Soamwoon, <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>nge rhooa towunap kkewe reno niugiun pwe re maeipin reen oatowe iiy e fifi oappwongas kkewe. <verse eid="LUK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Angkenus we naiun Soamwoon a pwae ngaeni, nge e iu peig mwaaenen antar we igiwe oappwongas we eno ee. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Oatowe Zechariah a weri mwaaen we, a riu nge a mesag tae. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Angkenus we a aengaeni pwe, “Wosoapw mesag, Zechariah! Deus a rongorong oamw maeipin, iwe Elizabeth we reemw epwene naini erhai aetemwaaen. Wopwe aeitae ngaeni pwe John. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Epwene ifa mwo oamw wenepwu me pwapwa, iwe me aar aaemweoi wenepwu reen aan supwutiw. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>John epwene igin taegias me faaen mesaen Deus. Esoapw iun <char style="tl">wine</char> me aerhi. Saengi rhag aan wupwutiw epwene sseog reen Espritu Santus, <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>nge iiy epwene pwigiir towunepeer re Israel ngaeni Soamwoon we aar Deus. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Iiy epwe gommw me weni mmwaei Soamwoon, pwe e mamaaw pwe taeppen rhag profeta we Elijah. Epwe aesefaaeni fengaenniir saam me naai pwe repwe eew rhag; iiy epwe wegiti sefaaeniir rhooa serong feon ngaeni niunniuwaen mwamwaai; nge epwe oamoannaar tae aeremas weni mmwaei Soamwoon.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Zechariah a aengaeni angkenus we pwe, “Epwe ifa wusun nge iya giuneei pwe ennet minneei? Ngaang iya tugufaeyi, nge manna pwiuniuwaei nge a pwan tugufaeyi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>“Ngaang Gabriel,” mwaeniaen angkenus we. “Ngaang iyiu weni mmwaen Deus, iwe iiy minne efang ngaang pwe ipwe pwigito kkepas mwamwaai een reemw. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Nge een wose niugiuniug ngaeni mwaeniaei, nge minneei epwe noa pwaetae minna wenewenen noan oaton naan. Iwe nge iga wose niugiuniug, een wosoapw mmwenen kkepas no; wopwene anniug noa rhag toori aan itto iiy raaenin na iya fasiun ppwoneei ngaeniug.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Noan oateei nge aeremas re wewweti Zechariah nge ra niunniuwaennei aere meeta a igin itinong pwongiy noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we reen. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Enoa toowow, nge esa mmwenen kkepas ngaeniir no, nge ra giuneei pwe eyor minne a itinong weri me noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we. Igiwe esa mmwenen kkepas no, iwe a taenepom ngaeniir rhag.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Oatowe a moanno noa engaang we aan noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, Zechariah a sefaaen noa nee iimw. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Enoa eew oaton nge Elizabeth a pwoopwo nge a no rhag nee iimw noan nimowu meram. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>“Ennaen igina minne Deus a tipaengiaei,” mwaeniaen niewe. “A arhiuwa saengiaei aessaewaei me neeiir rhooanap!”<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kkepesaen Wupwutiwen Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Noan oawonowuwaen meremaen Elizabeth Deus a fangetiw angkenus we Gabriel noan eew aepinoamwon Galilee itan Nazareth. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>Eyor eew aan kkepesaen oarong ngaeni erhai rhooapwut a kkefoat ngaeni mwaaen we itan Joseph, iwe itto saengi teeo we aan <char style="tl">king</char> David. Itan nge Maria. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Angkenus we a itto reen niewe nge a iura pwe, “Oapoas epwe no reemw! Soamwoon eno reemw nge a aewenepwuwoag.”<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Maria a gin riutae reen miniwe mwaeniaen angkenus we, nge a niuwaennei meeta faan iiy kkepas kkewe. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Angkenus we a aengaeni niewe pwe, “Wosoapw mesag, Maria; pwe Deus minne e igin mwamwaai ngaeniug. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Wopwene pwoopwo nge wa nainitiw erhai aetemwaaen, nge wa aeitae ngaeni pwe Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Epwe igin taegias nge epwe ffai pwe iiy naiun Deus na oarosaen taegias. Soamwoon Deus epwene feeori pwe iiy <char style="tl">king</char> taeppen rhag David we aan rhaepeto, <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>nge epwe no pwe <char style="tl">king</char> reen teeo we aaen Jacob oanongaen oat; minna mweoiun ina esooar aigiugiun!”<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Maria a aengaeni angkenus we pwe, “Ngaang erhai piirgo. Epwe ifa wusun rhag nge a mmwen minneei?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Angkenus we a iura pwe, “Espritu Santus epwene ittiw woamw, nge minna kkaeinen Deus ina oarosaen taegias a no woamw. Nge faaen minneei nge aetena esooar epwene ffai pwe Naiun Deus. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Wo maengiy rhag Elizabeth we re pwugusoamw? Iwe re iura pwe esoapw mmwenen nainai no, nge igina nge a wonowu mereman, inamwo iga a igin tugufaeyi. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Pwe esooar eew meeta ne Deus esoapw mmwenen feeori.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>“Ngaang erhai naiun Soamwoon rhooan akkiuneo,” aaen Maria iura. “Nigiti pwe epwe wen ngaeniaei petenaen kkepas mwu wa iura.” Iwe angkenus we a siusaengi niewe.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maria a Noa Emwaeri Elizabeth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Ese mmwaei mwo me weni mwirin nge Maria a oamoannatae epwe mwekkaei noa reen eew aepinoamw eno neeiin rhugun Judea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>A noa reen imwaen Zechariah pwe epwe noa koapwong ngaeni Elizabeth. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Igiwe Elizabeth a rongorong aaen Maria koapwong nge aetewe naiun a mwagiut me noan upwan. Elizabeth a sseog reen Espritu Santus <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>iwe a aekkepwas faeregit tae nge a iura pwe, “Een minne wa oarosaen wenepwu me neeiir rhooapwut, nge epwan wenepwu aetena wopwe naini! <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Meeta ppweoniun aaen min mwamwaai eei aan epwe itto wen ngaeniaei, iye nie inaen soamwoon a itto sengaeriaei? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Pwe igiwe rhag i rongorong oamw koapwong, iwe nge aete noan upwaei a mwagiut reen aaen kker. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Ifa mwo oamw kker pwe wa niugiuw pwe kkepas we aaen Soamwoon ngaeniug nge epwe nnet noa!”<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aaen Maria Keoniun Aepingeping</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Maria a iura pwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">“Nee tipaei a aepingepinga Soamwoon;<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>ngeoniuy apwapwa pwe aegin Deus iiy aaei Rhooan Aemenaw,<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>pwe iya maengiaei ngaang naiun rhooan akkiuneo man sessoan!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Saengi igina oanongeer aeremas nge repwene faingiaei pwe ngaang wenepwu,<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>pwe reen min mwamwaai kka Deus na oarosaen kkeman a feeori ngaeniaei.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">Minna itan ina essoar;<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>saengi eew me eew saaer e pwaeri aan ffayeo ngaeniir rhooan oassoara.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>A aeiti noa paiun na e kkeman</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">nge e oamwotoraar noa rhooana re namanam taegias noan aar niunniuwaen.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>A oatoraar tiw <char style="tl">king</char> kka re mamaaw me wooan nenien mooatoor,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">nge e saeregiir tae ikka re sessoan.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>A oamwongoor rhooa pecchai ngaeni min mwamwaai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">nge a aefengaar noa rhooa pisaegisaeg nge esooar oawton paiiur.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54-55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54-55"/>Iiy e ammwarhiuto rhag ppwon we aan ngaeniir rhooawe rhaepetorh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54-55">nge a itto pwe epwe fang tipaengieer rhooawe re Israel iwe naiun rhooan akkiuneo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54-55">Iiy e maengiy rhag pwe epwe pwaeri ffaayeo we aan ngaeni Abraham</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54-55">me oanongeer rhooan teowe aan iwe esooar iaenin!”<verse eid="LUK 1:54-55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Epwe enuuw meram aaen Maria no aegini reen Elizabeth nge a sefaaeniti pwugusan.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wupwutiwen John Baptist</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Enoa tooto oatowe Elizabeth epwene nainai, nge a timenewaegini erhai aetemwaaen. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Rhooan weni oaron me rhooa kkewe repwugusan ra rongorong ifa mwo aaen soamwoon mwamwaai ngaeni, iwe iir ra maegin tapweei reen aan pwapwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Igiwe aetewe a eew <char style="tl">week</char> aan no, ra itto repwe <char style="tl">circumcise</char> aegini, nge repwene aeitae ngaeni pwe Zechariah, aeiteitaen mwaaen we seman. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Nge rhooapwut we inan a iura pwe, “Aapw! Epwe itaeni John.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Nge ra aengaeni niewe pwe, “Aetae esooar re pwugusoamw ne e ina itan!” <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Nge iir ra taenepom ngaeni mwaaen we seman, meeta e mwerhaen pwe aetewe epwe itaeni.<verse eid="LUK 1:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Zechariah a tingoar eew pwapwior nge a foatogitiw pwe, “Itan nge John.” Ifa mwo aar riutae rhooawe! <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Reen oatonaan rhag nge Zechariah a mmwenen kkepas, a rhaepetae aan aepingepinga Deus. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Rhooan no oaroor ra igin mesag, nge kkepesaen minikkeei a rheeoi noa wooan rhugun aepinoamwon Judea. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Rhooan rongorong kkepas we ra gaen niunniuwaennei nge ra aeiyeg pwe, “Meeta aeteei epwene no pwe iiy?” Pwe igiwe epwae noa pwe maemaewaen Soamwoon eno wooan.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aaen Zechariah Woowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Zechariah we semaen John a sseog noa reen Espritu Santus, nge a aepesa wow kkepesaen oarongorong we aaen Deus:<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>“Sipwe aepingepinga Soamwoon iwe aaen Israel Deus!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">A itto epwe fang tipaengiaen naiun aeremas nge aessaenetaegiir noa.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>A fang ngaenigirh naiurh rhooan aemenaw e igin kkeman,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">rhooan teowe aaen David iwe naiun rhooan akkiuneo.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>A ppwon ngaeniir profeta kkewe mweoiwe<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>pwe iiy epwe aemenewaegirh saengiir rhooan kkoapwut ngaenigirh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">saengi maemaeweer rhooakkena re aeni giirh aeffaeioapwut.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>E iura pwe epwe pwaeri ngaeniir rhooakkena rhaepetorh ffaiyeo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">iwe me e maengiy ppwon ssoar we aan.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73-74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73-74"/>Noan aan aekkepan ngaeni Abraham we rhaepetorh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:73-74">iiy eppwon pwe epwe aemenewaegirh saengiir rhooan oapwutaegirh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:73-74">iwe nge e nigiti ngaenigirh pwe sisoapw mesag noan aarh engaang ngaeni,<verse eid="LUK 1:73-74"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>pwonno giirh sipwe ssoar nge si mwamwaai me weni mmwan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:75">noan oanongaen raaenin aarh menaw.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>“Een naeyi, wopwene ffai pwe profeta we naiun Deus na oarosaen taegias.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">Een wopwene mmweei Soamwoon wopwene oamoannatae ennepan,<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>wopwe aengaeniir naiun aeremas repwene menaw igine emwus noa monofitiir.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Naiurh Deus ina e sseogiun ffayeo nge etip mererhaeg.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">Epwe feeori pwe seremaen menaw epwe ttinitiw wooarh<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>nge seremaen wooan naaeng epwe ttin noa wooar rhooa no noan rorhappiungiun maenoa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">pwe epwe aeitiiti mesaen gupworh noan ennepaen oapoas.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Iwe a temoag tae aetewe iwe a mamaaw noa oanongan me ngeoniun. Iwe a no noan <char style="tl">desert</char> we e toori noan raaenin we a pwae ngaeniir re Israel.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Wupwutiwen Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1.18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Noan oatonaan nge Soamwoonin Rome we Augustus a akkiuneo pwe epwe yor paaepaen fainaaw noan oanongaen faniuw kka nemaeniaen Rome. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Reen igiwe aeyewaen paaepae a rhaepetae nge Quirinius minne eno pwe <char style="tl">governor</char> reen Syria. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Erhai me erhai nge enoa foatogi itan reen aan taeninimw.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Joseph a noa saengi Nazareth noan Galilee a noa ngaeni Bethlehem noan Judea, igiwe esiupwutiw <char style="tl">king</char> David me ee. Joseph a noa igiwe pwe igiwe iiy teoteeon David. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>A noa pwe enoa foatogi iteer me Maria, rhooapwut we a no pwe kkefoaton. Niewe a pwoopwo, <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>oatowe reno Bethlehem, a toori oaton aan supw aetewe naiun. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Niewe a timenewaegini aetemwaaen we mesaemmwaei naiun, nge a tiugiumi nong noan mengaag nge e oana nong noan miniwe nenien anan maan, pwe igiwe esooar no nenieer me noan imwaen waseona we.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rhooan Neginegin <char style="tl">Sheep</char> me Angkenus Kkewe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Eyor aekkaerhai rhooan neginegin <char style="tl">sheep</char> reno wooan menaai nee pwoong re aefaenniir naiiur maan.<figure style="fig" alt=". . ." file="LB00013B.tif" size="span" loc=". . ." copy=". . ." ref="Luke 2.8"/> <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Erhai naiun Soamwoon angkenus a pwae ngaeniir, nge nningen Soamwoon a ttinitiw wooar. Ra igin mesag, <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>nge angkenus we a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawsoapw mesag! Ngaang iya pwigito eew kkepas mwamwaai reemi, kkepas een epwe pwigito eew kker temoag ngaeniir oanongeer aeremas. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Raaenin eei noan aepinoamw we aepinoamwon David rhooan aemenaw we aaemi a supw — Kristus we Soamwoon! <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Ieen minne epwe aniugiuniugiuw ngaenigaemi: oawpwe noa rhuungi erhai wonigaet e tiugiutiug noan mengaag nge ewon noan nenien anan maan.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Ese mmwaei mwo nge eew mwirhaen angkenus a pwae noa me oaron angkenus we erhai, ra aepingepinga Deus noan aar keon:<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>“Sia fang ssoar ngaeni Deus na eno wooai naaeng,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">nge oapoas enoa ngaeniir rhooakkena e mwamwaai nee tipan wooar!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Oatowe angkenus kkewe ra nigitiir ra sefaaen noa naaeng, rhooan neginegin <char style="tl">sheep</char> kkewe ra kkepas fengaen nee fineer pwe, “Sa noa Bethlehem sipwe noa weri meeta minne a wen, minne Soamwoon a aengaenigirh.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Iwe ra siu mwetekkaei noa me igiwe, nge ra noa weri Maria me Joseph iwe nge reweri wonigaet we ewon noan nenien anan maan. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Oatowe ra weri aetewe, nge ra aengaeniir rhooawe meeta we angkenus e iura reen aetewe. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Oanongeer iyo kkewe re rongorong miniwe nge ra mwaar reen miniwe mwaenieer rhooawe rhooan neginegin <char style="tl">sheep</char> kkewe. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Maria a maeng ngaeni oanongaen minikkeei nge a niuwaennei nong rhag nee tipan. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Rhooan neginegin <char style="tl">sheep</char> ra sefaaen, nge ra aepingepinga Deus reen igiwe meeta kkewe ra rongorong nge ra weri; nge taeppen rhag miniwe angkenus we a aengaeniir.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ra Aeita Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Enoa eew <char style="tl">week</char> weni mwirin, reen oatowe aetewe epwene <char style="tl">circumcise</char>, ra aeita ngaeni pwe Jesus, itiwe angkenus a fasiun ngaenneer weni mmwaen aan supw.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ra Pwigi Noa Jesus Noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>A toori oatowe Joseph me Maria repwe feeori eew pwaengepwaengin aenimenim, pwe ina miniwe oasoapwosoapw we aaen Moses e aepesa. Iwe ra pwigi noa aetewe Jerusalem pwe repwe noa pwaeri ngaeni Soamwoon, <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>pwe ina miniwe effoat noan oasoapwosoapw we aaen Soamwoon pwe, “Oanongaen mesaemmwaei naiiur aetemwaaen nge repwe aeyimweoiiur ngaeni Soamwoon.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Ra pwai noa pwe repwe noa aeni maenigaech riiurhai <char style="tl">dove</char> aere riiurhai aeppaen <char style="tl">pigeons</char>, pwe ina miniwe e fasiun no noan oasoapwosoapw we aaen Soamwoon.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Noan oatonaan nge eno erhai mwaaen itan Simeon eno noan Jerusalem. Iiy erhai mwaaen reepiy nge e mwamwaai noan menewan nge e wewweti oatona epwe cchipw Israel. Espritu Santus a teeotiw wooan <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>nge a aniugiuniugiuw ngaeni pwe iiy esoapw mae weni mmwaen epwe weri Kristus we Soamwoon e ppwoneei. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Espritu Santus a paeni Simeon a itinong noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we. Oatowe rhooawe inan me seman ra pwigito goagoa we noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we pwe repwe feeori ngaeni meeta we oasoapwosoapw e iura, <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simeon a ammwarhiu aetewe noan paiun nge a fang aerhigerhig ngaeni Deus:<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>“Igina Soamwoon, een wa iseni ppwon we oamw,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">nge wa mwiuti ngaeni noawumw rhooan akkiuneo pwe epwe noa noan oapoas.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Iya weri ngaeni mesaei oamw engaengaen menaw,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>iwe een wa oamoannatae me weni mmweer oanongeer aeremas:<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>eew seram epwe pwaeri ngaeniir re Gentiles mwerhaen na oamw</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">iwe me pwigito nning ngaeniir noawumw re Israel.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Rhooawe inan me seman aetewe ra mwaar reen meeta kkewe Simeon e iura reen aetewe. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Simeon a aepiniir nge a aengaeni Maria, iwe inaen aetewe, “Aeteei a ffin tae me reen Deus pwe epwe oatoaropa nge e aemenewaer towunepaen re Israel. Iiy epwe no pwe eew aeginn me reen Deus pwe towunepaen aeremas repwe appaniuwaeni noan aar kkepas, <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>iwe a pwaeritae noan niunniuwaen mwoanomwoan kena aar. Nge niemaam eweei kaengin saeitan, epwe fereei pwunnomw.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36-37"/>Eno erhai profeta tugufaeyi itan Anna nge a mae noa pwiuniuwan. Nge iiy naiun Phanuel saengi aeinang we aaen Asher. Fisuuw raeg aan pwiuppwiuniuw nge emae noa pwiuniuwan. Nge igina a waniig me faawu raegin. Iiy ese nigiti <char style="tl">Temple</char> we; pwoong me raaen nge e aesirowu noa rhag Deus, e aecchigipin nge e memmaeipin. <verse eid="LUK 2:36-37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Noan rhag awa we e tooto nge a fang aerhigerhig ngaeni Deus nge a fioangei mmwenen aetewe ngaeniir oanongeer rhooa kkewe re iya wetiwet ngaeni Deus pwe epwe saeneti noa Jerusalem.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ra Sefaaen Ngaeni Nazareth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Igiwe Joseph me Maria ra moannon feeori minikkewe eno noan anniug we aaen Soamwoon, nge ra sefaaen ngaeni miniwe aepinoamwoor iwe Nazareth me noan Galilee. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>A tootae aetewe nge amamaaw noa, nge a sseog noan reepiy nge Deus a no wooan.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aet we Jesus me Noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Oanongaen raeg nge rhooawe inaen me seman Jesus ra noa Jerusalem pwe repwe noa tapweei gupwunon <char style="tl">Passover</char> we. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Oatowe a seig me ruwowu raegin Jesus nge ra noa tapweei gupwun we taeppen rhag miniwe regaen feoffeeori. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Enoa moanno noa gupwun we, rhooawe ra sefaaen noa nee pwuguseer, nge Jesus a notiw noan Jerusalem. Rhooawe inan me seman rese giuneei minneei; <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>iir re niuwaennei pwe eno reer rhooanap we, iwe eraaen nniuw aar nennoa nge a rhaepetae aar kiukkiutta fetaeneei aetewe me neeiir aei oaroor me maereyaereer. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Nge iir rese weri, iwe ra sefaaen noa giutta me Jerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Wooan ayeoniuraenin aar giut nge ra noa weri me noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, emooat neeiir sinsein Jews kkewe, e aiussaening ngaeniir nge e kekkepas aeiineo ngaeniir. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Oanongeer rhooa kkewe re rongorong mwaenian nge remwaar noa reen aesefaaenin kkepas aeiyeg kkewe aan. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Rhooawe inan me seman re riutae reen igiwe ra noa weri, iwe nge rhooapwut we inan a aengaeni pwe, “Naeyi, meeta wa feeori ngaenigemaem minneei reen? Pwe ngaang me mwaaen e semoamw aeiya gin noanineeng reen aemaem giutta fetaeneog.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Nge iya paniuwaeniir nge a iura pwe, “Meeta aaemi oawnoa giutta fetaeneaei reen? Oawse giuneei pwe ngaang ipwe no noan imwaen minna Semaei?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Nge iir rese metaf reen miniwe e iura.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Iwe Jesus a tapweei sefaaeniir noa Nazareth, nge a noa aiussaening ngaeniir. Miniwe inaan a iseni nong rhag oanongan nee tipan. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Jesus a temoag tae wooan oanongan me aan reepiy me temoagon rhaengiin me reen Deus me aeremas.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Aaen John Baptist Fenai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mark 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">John 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Noan miniwe seig me nimowu raeg aan Soamwoonin Rome we Tiberius nemenem, nge Pontius Pilate minne <char style="tl">governor</char> reen Judea, nge Erotes minne soamwoonin Galilee, iwe nge Philip we pwiin minne soamwoonin faniuwaen Iturea me Trachonitis; iwe nge Lysanias minne soamwoonin Abilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>iwe nge Annas me Caiaphas minikka Patere taegias — noan oatonaan nge Deus a fang to kkepas reen John iwe naiun Zechariah me noan <char style="tl">desert</char> we. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Iwe John a noa fenai fetaen noan faniuwaen rhan pwupwu na Jordan, “Toagun saengi monofitimi nge oawpwe paptismus, ina nge Deus epwe saeneti noa monofitimi.” <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Miniwe effoat noan pwapwior we aaen profeta Isaiah pwe:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">“Erhai aeremas e iyaekkepwas me noan <char style="tl">desert</char> we nge e iura pwe:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Oawpwe oamoannatae ennepaen Soamwoon;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">oawpwe awenecchera eew aan pwe epwe faaeraeg wooan!<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Oanongaen mwoattotiw nepetaen rhug nge sipwe oawutaeni tae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">oanongaen taeiit me rhug nge epwe soan eew noa rhag.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">Oanongaen aan pwoar nge epwe aewwen noa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">oanongaen aan toarumwrumw nge epwe arhannenoa.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Oanongeer aeremas nge repwe weri menaw na Deus epwene fangetiw!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Aeremas towunap ra maeg wow reen John pwe epwe noa paptismus aeginiir. Nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Aaemi sowufaeng! Iyo e aengaenigaemi pwe oawpwe mmwenen kkewaeg saengi aaen Deus aegaeregaer iga epwe aefengato? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Oaw ssiuweniy wegitaegimi pwe epwe pwaeri noa pwe oawwa toagun saengi monofitimi. Oawsoapw niunniuwaennei pwe oawwa taaw saengi aaen Deus aegaeregaer reen aaemi aepesa pwe Abraham minne rhaepetomi. Ngaang ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe Deus emmwenen feeori faai kaan pwe tettaenin Abraham! <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Eew soapaen a oamoannatae pwe epwe gopiy tiw waniwan saengi waeran. Oanongaen waniwan kka ese gacch uwaan nge epwe gopogop tiw nge e aekkaerh nong noan aengaet.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Aeremas ra aeiineow pwe, “Meeta minne aeipwe feeori?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>A paniuwaeniir pwe, “Iyo na riiuwapeo mengaagiun nge epwe fangenoa epeo pwe mengaagiun manna esooar mengaagiun, iwe nge iyo na eyor mwongo reen nge epwe fang ngaeniir aaemweoi.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Aaemweoi rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> re itto pwe repwe paptismus, iwe nge ra aeiineow pwe, “Sinsei, meeta aemaem aeipwe feeori?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Nge iiy a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawsoapw iyoiy <char style="tl">tax</char> temoag saengi minna eno noan oasoapwosoapw.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Aaemweoi sonotaw ra pwan aeiineow pwe, “Iwe nge aemaem? Meeta aemaem aeipwe feeori?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawsoapw pweipwog senaapiy saengiir aeremas noan amamaaw ngaere oatupwutupw tae kkepas wooan erhai. Oawsoapw tipinap saengi minikkena paniuwaemi noan engaang.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Aar aepiniugiuniug aeremas a tettemoag noa reen miniwe mwaenian, iwe nge a rhaepetae aar niunniuwaennei ngaere teorh maeni pwe John minne Kristus. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>John a aengaeniir oanongeer noa pwe, “Ngaang iya paptismusaegaemi reen rhaan, iwe nge erhai ina epwe itto nge e taegias me mmwaei. Ngaang mwo nge ese fin ipwe pwaeisi geeogeeon nokkaan. Iiy epwe paptismusaegaemi ngaeni Espritu Santus me aengaet. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>A kkemwarh aan sepwin pwe epwe aeyimweoiuw fesaenngiy faiun saengi peeon. Iwe, epwe ioni fengaenniy faiun nge a iseni nong noan aan imwaen iseis, nge peeon epwe oatoranong noan aengaet we ese mmwenen gunnoa.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>E towunap mesemesaen aaen John fenaiuw Kkepas Mwamwaai we ngaeniir aeremas nge e aemaemaewa ngaeniir pwe repwe ssiuweniy meneweer. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Iwe nge John a soong ngaeni <char style="tl">Governor</char> Erotes, pwe igiwe e rhooan ngaenne aeni Herodias, iwe rhooan ngaenneyaen mwaaen we pwiin, iwe me igiwe e towunap min aenneew kkewe efeeori. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Iwe egius mwo nge Erotes a faer gin feeori aenneewa noa pwe a iseni nong John noan kanepwus.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aaen Jesus Paptismus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mark 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Mwirin aar oanongeer aeremas paptismus, Jesus a pwan paptismus. Nugunupaen aan maeipin nge a susu noa naaeng, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>iwe nge Espritu Santus a ittiw wooan eweei rhag erhai <char style="tl">dove</char>. Iwe nge eew mangiungiu a ittiw me noan naaeng nge a aepesa pwe, “Een naeyi mwaaen aerhaengerhaeng. Iye efin tipaei reen.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rhaepeto Kkewe Aaen Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Oatowe Jesus a rhaepetae aan engaang, nge a eniig raegin. Aeremas re niuwaennei pwe iiy naiun Joseph, iwe naiun Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>iwe naiun Matthat, iwe naiun Levi, iwe naiun Melchi, iwe naiun Jannai, iwe naiun Joseph, <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Iwe naiun Mattathias, iwe naiun Amos, iwe naiun Nahum, iwe naiun Esli, iwe naiun Naggai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>iwe naiun Maath, iwe naiun Mattathias, iwe naiun Semein, iwe naiun Josech, iwe naiun Joda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>iwe naiun Joanan, iwe naiun Rhesa, iwe naiun Zerubbabel, iwe naiun Shealtiel, iwe naiun Neri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>iwe naiun Melchi, iwe naiun Addi, iwe naiun Cosam, iwe naiun Elmadam, iwe naiun Er, <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>iwe naiun Joshua, iwe naiun Eliezer, iwe naiun Jorim, iwe naiun Matthat, iwe naiun Levi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>iwe naiun Simeon, iwe naiun Judah, iwe naiun Joseph, iwe naiun Jonam, iwe naiun Eliakim, <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>iwe naiun Melea, iwe naiun Menna, iwe naiun Mattatha, iwe naiun Nathan, iwe naiun David, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>iwe naiun Jesse, iwe naiun Obed, iwe naiun Boaz, iwe naiun Salmon, iwe naiun Nahshon, <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>iwe naiun Amminadab, iwe naiun Admin, iwe naiun Arni, iwe naiun Hezron, iwe naiun Perez, iwe naiun Judah, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>iwe naiun Jacob, iwe naiun Isaac, iwe naiun Abraham, iwe naiun Terah, iwe naiun Nahor, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>iwe naiun Serug, iwe naiun Reu, iwe naiun Peleg, iwe naiun Eber, iwe naiun Shelah, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>iwe naiun Cainan, iwe naiun Arphaxad, iwe naiun Shem, iwe naiun Noah, iwe naiun Lamech, <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>iwe naiun Methuselah, iwe naiun Enoch, iwe naiun Jared, iwe naiun Mahalaleel, iwe naiun Kenan, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>iwe naiun Enosh, iwe naiun Seth, iwe naiun Adam, iwe naiun Deus.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Sessoaton Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mark 1.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Enoa sefaaeneto Jesus me reen pwupwu we Jordan nge a sseog noa reen Espritu Santus iwe nge Espritu Santus a paeninoa noan <char style="tl">desert</char>, <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>nge Saetan a noa soatoni me ee noan faaeig raaen. Noan oanongaen raaenin kkewe nge ese mwongo, ina miniwe a meyaefi pecchai reen.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Saetan a aengaeni pwe, “Ngaere een Naiun Deus, wopwe aengaeniir faai kaan pwe repwe ssiuwen ngaeni fenoawa.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Pwapwior we e Santus e aepesa pwe, ‘Saapw fenoawa rhag minne aeremas repwe menaw reen.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Iwe Saetan a pwigitae weei naaeng nge a noa pwaeri ngaeni reen rhag eew oat oanongaen mweoi me noan faeinaengiy. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Saetan a aengaeni pwe, “Ipwe ngaenneog oanongaen mamaaw kkeei me oanongaen mmwen kkeei. Oanongaen nge nemaeniaei, nge ipwe fang ngaeni iyo iye tipaei ipwe ngaenneei. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Oanongaen minikkeei nge epwe no pwe oamw igine wopwe oassotupw ngaeniaei.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Pwapwior we e Santus e aepesa pwe, ‘Wopwe oassotupw ngaeni Deus na oamw Soamwoon nge iiy rhag wopwe engaang ngaeni. ’”<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Iwe Saetan a pwigi noa Jerusalem nge a noa iseni tae pwiuneoi we oarosaen taegias me reen <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, nge a aengaeni pwe, “Ngaere een Naiun Deus nge wa oatoroagotiw me igeei. <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>Pwe iwe Pwapwior we e Santus e aepesa pwe, ‘Deus epwe akkiuneeor naiun angkenus repwe aemmwenoag.’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Nge epwan aepesa pwe, ‘Repwe ammwarhiug tae noan paiiur pwe pirhemw mwo nge ete woas ngaeni faai.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Iwe nge Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Pwapwior we e Santus e aepesa pwe, ‘Wosoapw soatoni Deus na oamw Soamwoon.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Weni mwirin aaen Saetan soatoni Jesus, iwe nge a nigiti noa mwo.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Rhaepeta Aan Engaang me Noan Galilee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mark 1.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Iwe Jesus a sefaaen ngaeni Galilee, iwe nge miniwe maemaewaen Espritu Santus eno reen. Miniwe fioangon a rheeoi fetaen wooan oanongan noa faniuw we. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>A fenai fetaen noan wutteer Jews nge oanongaen aeremas ra mwaar reen.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rhooan Nazareth Rese Aetiwa Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mark 6.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Jesus a noa Nazareth, igiwe effooan me ee, nge wooan Sabbath a noa noan wutteer Jews we taeppen rhag miniwe egaen feeori. A iutae pwe epwene aeraegi Pwapwior we e Santus, <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>nge ra ngaenneei pwapwior we aaen profeta Isaiah. A suginoa pwapwior we nge a weri pwiuneoi we effoat me ee,<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>“Kkemenaen Soamwoon a no wooai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">pwe iya ffin tae ipwe pwigito Kkepas Mwamwaai eei reer rhooa affayeo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Iya fangenoa ngaang ipwe oaronga ngaeniir rhooan kanepwus pwe iir ra saenetaeg</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">nge i aecchipwaar rhooa parh pwe repwe ffat noa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">me pwan aengesaar noa rhooa waeiraes<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>iwe me ipwe oaronga ngaeniir aeremas pwe a toori oatowe Soamwoon epwe aemenewaar naiun aeremas.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Jesus a oawunnu noa pwapwior we, a ateeow sefaaeniy ngaeni aeremas we e tipaengi, iwe nge a mooat tiw. Oanongeer aeremas kkewe noan wutteer Jews we nge a meseer ngaeni rhag, <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Iwe nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Soapwon kkepas e noan Pwapwior we e Santus iye igina nge a pwae noa pwe ennet, iye oawwa rongorong ngaeni.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Ra piungiun mwaar reen nge ra maengi noannei nong mwamwaaiun ititin aan kkepas. Ra iura pwe, “Saapw iiy mwaaen we naiun Joseph?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>A aengaeniir pwe, “I giuneei firhiy pwe oawpwe aengaeni sefaaeniaei kkepas een, ‘Toagota, aecchipwa oanongoamw.’ Oawpwe akkiuneowaei pwe ipwe feeori me nee pwugusaei minikkewe oaw rongorong pwe i fasiun gaen feeori me noan Capernaum.” <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Jesus a iura pwe, “Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe profeta nge ese gacch aar aewenimmwaar me noan pwuguseer. <verse eid="LUK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>Aiussaening ngaeniaei: regin towunap rhooapwut kka ra mae rhooan ngaenneyeer me wooan Israel noan oatowe oaton Elijah, oatowe esooar worhow noan enuuw me esoapw raeg iwe a itto eew naengeta gin oarosaen temoag wooan oanongaen faniuw we. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Inamwo nge esooar erhai ne re fangenoa Elijah reen me wooan Israel, pwe aeggaen erhai rhag rhooapwut a mae rhooan ngaenneyan eno wooan Zarephath me wooan faniuw na Sidon. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Iwe nge ra gin ssow rhooa affayeo reen kaenepaai kka reno wooan Israel reen oatowe oaton Elisha; nge inamwo nge erhai mwo me neeiir nge ese cchipw, pwe aeggaen Naaman we erhai re Syria.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Igiwe aeremas kkewe reno noan wutteer Jews we ra rongorong miniwe nge a gin teeo ngaeniir aar soong. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Ra iutae rhag, iuriutepa wow Jesus me noan aepinoamw we, nge ra pwigitae wooan wungaen rhug we eno miniwe aepinoamwoor wooan. Re menaen pwe repwe aerheei noa me wooan rhug we, <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>iwe nge iiy etowow rhag me nugunupaen pwuwa we nge a faaeraeg noa.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaaen we Eyor Aniu Aenneew Wooan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mark 1.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Iwe Jesus a noa wooan Capernaum, eew aepinoamwon Galilee, a noa fenai ngaeniir aeremas wooan Sabbath. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Ra mwaar reen aan fenai, pwe igiwe eyor kkemenaen aan fenai. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Noan wutteer Jews we nge eyor erhai mwaaen eyor aniu aenneew wooan; a gin aekkepwas temoag tae, <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>“Ah! Meeta oamw mwerhaen ngaenigemaem, Jesus re Nazareth? Wa itto igeei pwe wopwe oatoaropagemaem? Ngaang i giuneei een iyo: een mwaaenessoar we rhooan pweipwogin kkepas we aaen Deus!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Jesus a anniugiu ngaeni aniuwe pwe, “Wopwe anniug noa nge wa siunoa me wooan mwaaen na!” Iwe nge aniu aenneew we a aerheei tiw mwaaen we weni mmweer rhooawe nge a teeowow me wooan, nge esooar minne e oawoasu ngaeni.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Aeremas ra piungiun mwaar nge ra kkepas fengaen wooar pwe, “Meeta taeppen kkepas kkeei? Eyor kkemenaen me maemaewaen aaen mwaaen een kkepas ngaeniir aniu aenneew nge ra siu!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Iwe miniwe fioangon Jesus a rheeoi fetaen wooan faniuw we.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwa Towunepaen Aeremas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mark 1.29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Jesus a siusaengi wutteer Jews we iwe a noa reen miniwe pwugusaen Simon. Niewe inaen pwiuniuwaen Simon e semwaai pwe egin pwerhikkar ginin, iwe ra kkepas ngaeni Jesus reen mmwenen. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>A noa iwe a noa iu oaron niewe iwe nge a aengaeni pwerhikkar we pwe epwe siusaengi niewe. Iwe rhag nge esaer noa miniwe pwerhin niewe, iwe niewe a rhimwitae pwe a ittae feor fetaen minne epwe tipaengi ngaeniir.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Enoa mwirin tupwunoan aenet nge oanongeer rhooawe eyor rhooa semwaai reer nge ra pwigiir to reen Jesus. E iseni tae paiun wooar oanongeer nge a aecchipwaar tae. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Mwuniaan mwo nge re piungiun teeowow me wooar rhooa towunap we nge ra itiwow aekkepwas pwe, “Een mwaaen we Naiun Deus!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Jesus a kkepas sseor ngaeniir aniu aenneew kkewe pwe resoapw kkepas, pwe igiwe re giuneei pwe iiy miniwe Kristus.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Fenai Noan Wutteer Jews Kkewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mark 1.35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Weni mmwaei raaen Jesus a nigiti aepinoamw we iwe a noa eew pwiuneoi ne iiy noa rhag. Aeremas a rhaepetae aar giutta fetaeneei, iwe nge renoa weri, nge ra aegina aar ammwarhiu tiw pwe ete rhiuwen siunoa. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Iwe nge iya aengaeniir pwe, “Ngaang ipwan noa fenaiuw Kkepas Mwamwaai we reen Mweoiun Deus me noan aepinoamw kena aekkaew, pwe ina minne Deus efang ngaang pwe ipwe noa feeori.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Iwe a noa fenaiuw noan oanongan noa wutteer Jews me wooan faniuw we.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Faingiir Rhooawe Mesaemmwaen Rhooan Kkayeo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mark 1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Eraaen nge Jesus e iu reen meoneoiniun we Gennesaret nipwaen aar aeremas aekkaetemaegin to pwe repwe itto rongorong miniwe kkepesaen Deus. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>A weri riiufoarh pwoot pwe ra iuriiur tae weni ppiy: nge rhooan fita kkewe ra nigiti pwe ra noa wupwuuw noa wuug kkewe naiiur.<figure style="fig" alt=". . ." file="HK00207B.tif" size="span" loc=". . ." copy=". . ." ref="Luke 5.2"/> <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Jesus a toonong noan efoarh pwoot kkewe — pwoot we waen Simon — nge a tingoareei ngaere epwe mmwenen amman saengi egius mwoarhoisaet. Jesus a mooat noan pwoot we nge a fenai ngaeniir rhooa towunap we.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Enoa moann aan mwaenieniy, nge a aengaeni Simon pwe, “Ammaan ffoarh wow igina e nennoan ee, nge een me rhooa kkomwu rhinoamw oawwa aerheei tiw wuug mwu naimi pwe oawpwe fita.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simon a paniuwaeni pwe, “Soamwoon, efoarh ngaeni nee pwoong we aemaem fita nge esooar iig e aei nipaeni. Iwe ngaere ina minimwu wo iura, ina nge iya iseni tiw wuug kka naimaem.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Ra iseni tiw wuug kkewe nge ra igin niyap iig nge aetae epwene ffeir wuug kkewe. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Iwe nge ra taenepom ngaeniir rhooa kkewe rhoaniuwaar wooan pwoot we efoarh pwe repwe itto tipaengiir. Re itto iwe ra itto oawuta pwoot kkewe waar e sseogtae reen iig aetae pwoot kkewe repwene mweoius. <verse eid="LUK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Oatowe Simon Peter a weri miniwe a wen, a foatotiw weni mmwaen Jesus nge a iura pwe, “Siu saengiaei Soamwoon! Ngaang erhai mwaaen monofit!”<verse eid="LUK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Iiy me rhooa kkewe ra riutae reen towunepaen iig kkewe ra nipaeni. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Pwan ina rhag miniwe ewen ngaeniir James me John, mwaaen kkewe naiun Zebedee. Jesus a aengaeni Simon pwe, “Wosoapw mesag: saengi igina a noa een wopwene niyap aeremas.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Ra iuriutae pwoot kkewe waar weni ppiy, nigititiw oanongaen aegiaeg, nge ra tapweei noa Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwa Erhai Mwaaen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mark 1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Eew oat nge Jesus eno noan eew aepinoamw igiwe erhai mwaaen eweri eew kaenepaai eno ee. Igiwe eweri Jesus, a foatotiw wooan ppweon nge a aeffaenipirhe ngaeni pwe, “Menap, aere wo mwerhaen, wa aecchipwanoa aaei semwaai!”<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Jesus e angenoa nge a geotteopa mwaaen we, nge a paniuwaeni pwe, “Ngaang i mwerhaen, wone cchipw noa!” Reen rhag oatowe nge kaenepaai we a rhiuw saengi mwaaen we. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Jesus a ammwir ngaeni pwe, “Esooar ne wopwe aengaeni minneei, nge faaeraeg uwen noa reen patere pwe epwe weriug. Iwe nge a feeori oasoar we Moses e akkiuneo, pwe epwe pwaeri ngaeniir aeremas pwe wa nimegacch noa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Miniwe kkepesaen Jesus a rheeoi fetaen, iwe pwuwaen aeremas ra maegeto repwe itto aiussaening ngaeni nge e aecchipwa aar semwaai. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Iwe nge egaen noa pwiuneoi e esooar aeremas ee, nge a noa maeipin ee.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwa Erhai Mwaaen Maemerhoar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mark 2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Eraaen nge Jesus e fenai, nge aaemweoi Pharisees me sinsein anniug remooat igiwe, nge re itto me wooan aepinoamwon Galilee me Judea me Jerusalem. Kkeman we aaen Soamwoon eno wooan Jesus pwe epwe mmwenen aecchipwaar rhooa semwaai. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Aaemweoi mwaaen re pwigito erhai mwaaen e maemerhoar wooan eew giegiy, re aegina pwe repwe pwigi nong noan iimw we nge ra oawnatiw weni mmwaen Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Pwonno reen pwuwaen aeremas we, iwe rese mmwenen repwe toori Jesus. Iwe ra teeotae wooan iimw we, ra feingi noa aekkaew oason iimw we, nge re atairaetiw mwaaen we noan giegiy we nugunupaen pwuwa we me weni mmwaen Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Igiwe Jesus a weri nepaen aar niugiuniug rhooawe, a aengaeni mwaaen we pwe, “Naeyi, monofitimw a mwusunoa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Sinsein anniug kkewe me Pharisees kkewe a rhaepetae aar niuwaennei fengaen wooar pwe, “Iyo mwaaen e aepesa aenneewa Deus! Deus rhag minne emmwen epwe oamwusa noa monofit!”<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Jesus e giuneei niunniuwaen kkewe aar nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Meeta oaw niuwaennei minikkena e aenneew reen? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>E mererhaeg pwe sipwe aepesa pwe, ‘Monofitimw a mwusunoa,’ aere sipwe aepesa pwe, ‘Iutae wa faaeraeg noa’? <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Ipwe pwaeri ngaenigaemi pwe mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas eyor maemaewan wooan soanop pwe epwe oamwusa noa monofit.” Iwe a aengaeni mwaaen maemerhoar we pwe, “Ipwe aengaeniug, iutae, pwigi giemw wa noa noan imwoamw!”<verse eid="LUK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Iwe rhag mwaaen we a iutae me weni mmweer rhooawe, a pwigi miniwe gien iwe ewon wooan, a noa nee pwugusan, a noa aepingepinga Deus. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Oanongeer rhooawe ra gin riutae reen aar mesag, nge ra aepingepinga Deus nge ra iura pwe, “A inamwo aemwaeraeran minikka sa weri noan raaeneei!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Faingi Levi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mark 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Mwirin minneei, Jesus a noa weri erhai rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> itan Levi, emooat noan aan <char style="tl">office</char>. Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Itto tapweaei.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Iwe Levi a iutae nigiti oanongaen aegiaeg nge a tapweei noa mwirin.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Oatona nge Levi a feeori eew gupwun gin temoag me reen iimw na imwan pwe aaen Jesus, iwe nge neeiir rhooan itto tapweei gupwun we nge regin ssow rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> me pwan aaemweoi aeremas. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Aaemweoi Pharisees me sinsein anniug re appaniuwaen ngaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun Jesus re iura pwe, “Meeta oaw iun nge oaw mwongo ngaeniir rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> me rhooa aenneew wegitaegiir kkomwun reen?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir a iura pwe, “Rhooakka rese semwaai rese noa reer toagota, pwe rhooakka refaer semwaai. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Ngaang ise itto pwe ipwe faingiir rhooa mwamwaai, pwe faer rhooa monofit pwe repwe toagun saengi monofitiir.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kkepas Aeiineon Aecchigipin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mark 2.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Aekkaaemweoi aeremas re aengaeni Jesus pwe, “Rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun John regaen aecchigipin ffoarh noa rhag nge re maeipin ffoarh, pwan ina rhag rhooan akkiuneo kka naiiur Pharisees; nge rhooan kkayeo kkomwu noawumw re mwongo noa rhag me re iun noa rhag.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Oaw niuwaennei pwe epwe mmwen oawsoapw oamwongoor aeremas kkewe re itto reen gupwunon appwiuniupai igiwe <char style="tl">bridegroom</char> we e rhiuwen no reer? Aapw! <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Nge epwe itto raaenin na repwe pwigi saengiir <char style="tl">bridegroom</char> we, nge ina oatona repwene aecchigipin noa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Jesus a pwan aengaeniir fioangon awewe een: “Oawsoapw taeringa eew mengaag ffeo pwe oawpwe pinisa ngaeni eew mengaag maerhiy. Esooar ipitan oawpwe feeori. Iwe ngaere epwe ina, oawwa taeringa mwaenenei noa mengaag ffeo we pwe ikka mengaag ffeo we ese aeffitaeg ngaeni mengaag maerhiy we. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Oawsoapw pwan aenianong <char style="tl">wine</char> ffeo noan nenien <char style="tl">wine</char> maerhiy, pwonno <char style="tl">wine</char> ffeo we epwe taeringatiw nenien <char style="tl">wine</char> maerhiy we, iwe a nipi noa <char style="tl">wine</char> we nge nenien <char style="tl">wine</char> we a ffeir noa. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/><char style="tl">Wine</char> ffeo ina oawpwan ngoannong rhag noan nenien <char style="tl">wine</char> ffeo! <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Nge esooar erhai ne epwe iun <char style="tl">wine</char> maerhiy nge epwe pwan rhiuwen iun <char style="tl">wine</char> ffeo. Pwe e iura pwe, ‘<char style="tl">Wine</char> kka e ssiunaei minne enneo.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Kkepas Aeiineon Sabbath</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mark 2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Jesus a feffaaeraeg noa neeiin maetaen <char style="tl">wheat</char> wooan raaenin Sabbath. Rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra ginigin iuwoapwon <char style="tl">wheat</char> kkewe, ra mwunuti fetaeneei noan paiiur, nge re angi minikkewe faiun. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Aekkaerhai Pharisee kkewe ra aeiineow pwe, “Meeta oawwa feeori miniwe oasoapwosoapw we aarh e iura pwe oawsoapw feeori wooan Sabbath reen?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Oawse aeraegi mwo miniwe David efeeori noan oaton we iiy me rhooa kkewe naiun ra pecchai? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Iwe etonong noan imwaen Deus, nge a pwigi fenoawa kkewe re aeni oasoar ngaeni Deus, nge a angi nge a pwan ngaenneer mwaaen kkewe rhoaniuwan. Miniwe nge e aenneew ngaeni aarh oasoapwosoapw pwe aeremas repwe angi pwe aeggaen patere rhag.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Iwe nge Jesus a soapwei noa pwe, “Minna Naiun Aeremas minne Soamwoonin Sabbath.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Erhai Mwaaen Mae Paiun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mark 3.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Wooan eew noa raaenin Sabbath nge Jesus a noa noan wutteer Jews a noa fenai. Erhai mwaaen eno ee nge e maemerhoar pai mwaaenen. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Aaemweoi sinsein anniug me aaemweoi Pharisees re giutta aekkaew rhaepin minikka repwe oaturu Jesus wooan, iwe ina faan ra pipiiy gacchiuw Jesus aere epwe aecchipwaar aeremas wooan Sabbath. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Nge Jesus e giuneei niunniuwaen kkewe aar nge a aengaeni mwaaen we pwe, “Iutae nge wa itto iu weni mmwan.” Mwaaen we a iutae nge a itto iu igiwe. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Iwe nge Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Ipwe aeiineogaemi: meeta aarh anniug e aengaenigirh sipwe mmwenen feeori noan raaenin Sabbath? Meeta aarh anniug e aengaenigirh sipwe mmwenen feeori noan raaenin Sabbath? Sipwe tipaengi aeremas ngaere sipwe oawoasuur? Sipwe aemenewaar, aere sipwe niir noa?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>A fan fetaen neeiir oanongeer, iwe nge a aengaeni mwaaen we pwe, “Aeitiwow poawumw.” Iwe mwaaen we a aeitiwow paiun, iwe a mamaaw sefaaen.<verse eid="LUK 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>A gin teoteeo aar soong rhooa kkewe iwe ra pwiungiuwwoar meeta e repwene feeori ngaeni Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Finiir Seig me Riiurhai Oapostonus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mark 3.13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Oatonaan nge Jesus a ittae wooan eew taeiit epwe ittae maeipin, iwe a ittae no aegini noa epwoong reen aan ittae maeipin ngaeni Deus. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Enoa raaen tae, a faingiir rhooan kkayeo kkewe nge a finiir seig me riiurhai me neeiir, nge a aeita ngaeniir pwe oapostonus: <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Simon (iwe a aeita ngaeni pwe Peter) iwe nge Andrew we pwiin; James me John, Philip me Bartholomew, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Matthew me Thomas, James we naiun Alphaeus, iwe me Simon (iwe regaen iura pwe man menat),<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">man menat: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">erhai mwaaen e fiiow ngaeniir sonotawaen Rome faaen itaen faniuwan.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Judas we naiun James, iwe me Judas Iscariot, iwe e fangenoa tinnimaen Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Fenai Nge e Aecchipwaar Aeremas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Igiwe Jesus enoa ittiw me wooan taeiit we iiy me oapostonus kkewe, a ittiw iunoa nefenapi reen eew mweoiuyaen rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun. Eew pwuwaen aeremas temoag a no ee, nge re maegeto me Judea me Jerusalem me aepinoamw kkewe wenepeigin faniuwaen Tyre me Sidon; <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>re maegeto repwe itto aiussaening ngaeni me repwe itto aecchipwa aar semwaai. Oanongeer rhooakka eteeotae mwuniaan wooar nge re maegeto nge a aecchipwaar. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Oanongeer aeremas nge re aetemaegin repwe geotteopa, pwe miniwe kkemenan e itiwow me wooan nge a aecchipwaar noa oanongeer.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kker me Niemaam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Jesus a toagun ngaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun nge a iura pwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">“Oaw wenepwu aaemi rhooa mwaenene;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">pwe minna Mweoiun Deus a no pwe aaemi!<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Oaw wenepwu aaemi rhooa pecchai igina;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">pwe aaemi oawpwene faeyemwaai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Oaw wenepwu aaemi rhooa nee tip cchoaw;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">pwe aaemi oawpwene kekkaei!<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>“Oaw wenepwu aaemi igine re aeserhoawuna gaemi, asiugaemi, aessaewa gaemi, aepesa gaemi pwe oaw aenneew, pwe faaen ngaeni mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas! <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>Oawkker igine a wen minna ngaenigaemi nge oaw ittae maan fetaen reen aaemi mesaeig, pwe a yor paniuwaemi ina e igin faeregit me naaeng. Pwe rhooa kkewe rhaepetoor repwan feeori taeppen minneei ngaeniir profeta kkewe.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>Nge ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi aaemi rhooamwu oawwiin igina;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">oawwa gaen aemmererhaeg rhag igina!<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi rhooamwu oawwa igin faeyemwaai igina;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">oawpwene pecchai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi rhooamwu oaw aemweireyiir fetaen igina;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">oawpwene nee tip cchoaw me saeng!<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>“Ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi igine oanongeer aeremas repwe aepesa gacchiumi; pwe rhooawe rhaepetoor ina rhag miniwe repwan aepesa reer profeta oatupwutupw kkewe.<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aerhaengiir Rhooan Kkoapwut</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5.38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7.12</ref>a)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>“Nge ipwe aengaenigaemi aaemi rhooan aiussaening ngaeniaei: aerhaengiir rhooa oapwutaegaemi, ffeeor mwamwaai ngaeniir rhooa aeserhoawuna gaemi, <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>oaw aewenepwuwaar rhooan soong ngaenigaemi, nge oaw maeipinaar rhooa feoffeeor aenneew ngaenigaemi. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Ngaere erhai e pigiri epeig ne oawusupoamw, wa wegeti ngaeni peig na epeig pwe epwe pwan pigiri; ngaere erhai e pwigi noa mengaagiumw, wa pwan ngaenneei pwan epeo. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Ngaenneer iyo kena rhooan tingoareog aegiaeg, me ngaere erhai e pwigi pisaegimw nge wosoapw rhiuwen tingoar sefaaen no. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Oawpwe feeori ngaeniir aeremas taeppen meeta na aaemi oaw mwerhaen pwe repwe feeori ngaenigaemi.<verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>“Aere oaw aerhaengiir rhag rhooa na re aerhaengigaemi, meeta faaen aaemi oawpwe pwigi eew wenepwu? Rhooa kkewe mwo rhooa monofit nge repwan aerhaengiir rhooa kkewe re aerhaengiir! <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Ngaere igine oawffeeor mwamwaai ngaeniir rhag rhooakkena reffeeor mwamwaai ngaenigaemi, meeta faaen aaemi oawpwe pwigi eew wenepwu? Rhooa monofit kkewe mwo nge repwan feeori taeppen rhag! <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Ngaere oawfang pisaegimi ngaeniir rhag rhooakkena oaw niunniuwaennei pwe repwe aesefaaeni niuwenin, meeta faaen aaemi oawpwe pwigi eew wenepwu? Rhooa monofit mwo nge repwan mmwoon ngaeniir rhag rhooa monofit, pwe repwe pwan pwigi rhag nepaen miniwe refang! <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Aapw! Aerhaengiir rhooan oapwutaegaemi me ffeeor mwamwaai ngaeniir; oawfang ngaeniir pisaegimi nge oawsoapw niunniuwaennen repwe aesefaaenin. Ina nge minna wenepwuwaemi epwe temoag noa, nge oawpwe no pwe aaemi naiun Deus na oarosaen taegias. Pwe iiy nge e mwamwaai ngaeniir rhooa kkewe re sonap me aeremas aenneew. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Oawpwe faayeow taeppen rhag aaen Semaemi faayeow ngaenigaemi.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kapwiungiiur Aaemweoi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>“Oawsoapw apwiungiu aeremas, nge ina nge Deus esoapw pwan apwiungiugaemi; oawsoapw oamonofitiir aaemweoi, nge ina nge Deus esoapw pwan oamonofitigaemi; oaw oamwusaar noa aaemweoi, nge ina nge Deus epwe pwan oamwusagaemi. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Oawpwe fang ngaeniir aaemweoi, pwe ina nge Deus epwe pwan fang ngaenigaemi. Ewaer, pwe ammwenemi ina epwene igin towunap, ina esoapw faer noan paimi iga oawpwe ammwarhiu fengaenniy. Nepaen minna oaw aeyae ngaeniir aaemweoi, nge ina nepaen minne Deus epwe pwan aeyae ngaenigaemi.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeniir eew fioangon awewe: “Erhai mwaaen parh mesan esoapw mmwenen wummwuw erhai ne epwan parh. Ngaere e wummwuw, nge repwe ppiung nong ne niipw iir me riiurhai. <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Esooar erhai aeteei suguun epwe taegias saengi aan sinsei; pwe oanongeer aeteei suguun nge epwe noa moann ngaeniir aar suguun nge repwe naaen aeffitaeg ngaeniir aar sinsei.<verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>“Meeta wa weri peipei na noan mesaen pwiimw, nge wose weri soapwon irae mwu noan mesoamw? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Epwe ifa wusun oamw aengaeni pwiimw, ‘Moawwerh pwiiy, itto ipwe tipwei wow peipei mwu noan mesoamw,’ nge wose weri soapwon irae mwu noan mesoamw een? Een erhai man oatupwutupw! Mmwaen tipwei wow soapwon irae mwu noan mesoamw, nge wopwe naaen weri gacchiuw oamw tipwei wow peipei na noan mesaen ina pwiimw.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Efoarh Waniwan me Uwaan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>“Efoarh waniwan mwamwaai esoapw uwa aenneew, nge efoarh waniwan aenneew esoapw uwa mwamwaai. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Oanongaen mesemesaen waniwan nge si giuneei reen minikkena uwaan; wosoapw mmwenen gin <char style="tl">fig</char> me reen irae towfanfan ngaere gin <char style="tl">grape</char> saengi fetin towfanfan. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Erhai aeremas gacch epwe oatowowuw mini gacch saengi gacchiun noan tipan, nge erhai aeremas aenneew epwe oatowowuw mini aenneew saengi aenneewaen noan tipan. Pwe iga aaw aepesa meeta kena esseog noan pwunn.<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Riiurhai Rhooan Kaiu Iimw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>“Meeta faan oaw faingi ngaeniaei pwe, ‘Soamwoon, Soamwoon,’ nge oawse feeori minne i aengaenigaemi reen? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Erhai ne e itto reei nge e aiussaening minikka mwaeniaei nge e tapweei — ngaang ipwe pwaeri ngaenigaemi meeta na iiy eweei. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Iiy eweei erhai mwaaen e aiuwtae imwan, e genengitiw nipwan taeyifan iimw we imwan nge enoa ssaenitae me wooan porow. Iwe enoa itto pwur we itto parengi iimw we nge ese ffeir iimw we, pwe igiwe egin mamaaw kaiun. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Nge erhai ne e rongorong mwaeniaei nge ese tapweei, ina nge iiy epwe weei rhag mwaaen we e aiuwtae imwan nge ese ffeeor taeyifan; iwe enoa itto pwur we itto parengi iimw we iwe toarop noa, ifa mwo nepaen aan ffeir noa!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwa Rhooan Engaang we Naiun Soamwoonin Sonotawaen Rome</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8.5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Oatowe Jesus a moannon aepesa oanongaen minikkeei ngaeniir aeremas kkewe, nge a noa Capernaum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Erhai soamwoonin sonotawaen Rome eno erhai naiun rhooan engaang ne egin aerhaengi; nge rhooan engaang we naiun a gin semwaai nge epwene oaropaen mae. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Oatowe soamwoonin sonotaw we a rongorong wunuunun Jesus, a aefengaar noa mwaaen kkewe aar re Jews repwe noa faingito Jesus pwe epwe itto aecchipwa tae rhooan engaang we naiun. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Ra noa reen Jesus nge ra noa aeffaenipirhe ngaeni, “Mwaaen een nge yor ipitan wopwe tipaengi. <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Egin ffayeo ngaeniir aeremesarh nge iiy wooan oanongan a aiuwtae eew wutteer Jews pwe aarh.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Iwe Jesus a tapweer noa rhooawe. Ese taaw saengi iimw we igiwe soamwoonin sonotaw we a aefengaar noa rhooawe maereyaeren pwe repwe noa aengaeni pwe, “Soamwoon, wosoapw aewwaeiraesiug. Pwe saapw ngaang erhai aeremas yor ipitan reen oamw wopwe itto toonong reei noan imwaei, <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>nge saapw ngaang erhai aeremas yor ipitan reen aaei ipwe itto ngaeniug. Wopwe aepesa rhag epat kkepas nge rhooan engaang e naeyi epwe mamaaw tae. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Ngaang mwo nge pwan ngaang erhai mwaaen ino faaen nemaeniaen erhai e soamwoon saengiaei, nge epwan yor sonotaw kka reno faaen nemaeniaei. Ipwe aengaeni inaan pwe, ‘Wopwe noa!’ iwe a noa; iya aengaeni inaan pwe, ‘Wopwe itto!’ iwe a itto; iwe iya aengaeni rhooan akkiuneo, ‘Feeori minneen!’ iwe a feeori.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Jesus a mwaar oatowe e rongorong minneen; a saep sefaaen ngaeniir mwirhaen aeremas we rettapw to mwirin nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe, noan mwo Israel nge isaaen weri mwo taeppen niugiuniug een me ee!”<verse eid="LUK 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Iwe rhooawe maereyaeren soamwoonin sonotaw we ra sefaaen noa reen miniwe imwan nge ra noa weri pwe rhooan engaang we naiun a mamaaw noa.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aemenewa Sefaaen Tae Mwaaen we Naiun Rhooapwut we a Mae Pwiuniuwan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Weni mwirin rhag oatowe nge Jesus a noa reen eew aepinoamw itan Nain, nge rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun me eew pwuwaen aeremas re tapweto mwirin. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Iwe oatowe a tooto reen wororaen aepinoamw we, nge ra pwigiwow erhai manimae. Mwaaen we emae i rhag naiun erhai rhooapwut iwe a mae pwiuniuwan, towunepaen aeremesaen aepinoamw we re tapweei niewe. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Igiwe Soamwoon Jesus a weri niewe, iwe a gin faayeow, nge a aengaeni pwe, “Wosoapw saeng.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Iwe a faaeraeg noa a noa geotteopa kakoonaen manimae we, iwe mwaaen kkewe re pwigi ra iug noa. Jesus a iura pwe, “Anian een! Rhimwitae!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Iwe manimae we a mooat tae iwe a ittae kkepas fetaen, iwe Jesus a fang sefaaen ngaeni niewe inan.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Iwe oanongeer noa ra igin mesag nge ra aepingepinga Deus. Iwe ra iura pwe, “Erhai profeta taegias iye a pwae me neeirh igina! Deus a itto epwe aemenewa naiun aeremas!”<verse eid="LUK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Iwe miniwe kkepesaen Jesus a rheeoi fetaen noan oanongaen Judea me pwiuneoi kkewe oaron.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rhooa Kkewe John Baptist Efang Noa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11.2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun John Baptist ra itto reen John nge ra aengaeni oanongaen minikkewe, iwe e faingiir riiurhai me neeiir <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>nge a aefengaar noa reen Soamwoon pwe repwe noa aeiyegiy pwe, “Een miniwe re iura pwe epwe itto, aere aeipwe wewweti erhai?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Oatowe ra itto reen Jesus, nge ra iura pwe, “John Baptist e aefengagemaem to reemw pwe aeipwe itto aeiyegiug aere een miniwe re iura epwe itto, aere aeipwe wewweti erhai?”<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Faer oatowe rhag Jesus a aecchipwaar towunepaen aeremas saengi mesemesaen aar semwaai, nge epwan oatowowuur aniu aenneew me wooar, nge e aeffetaar noa rhooa masparh. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>A paniuwaeniir pwe, “Oaw sefaaen noa oawwa aengaeni John meeta kka oawwa weri me rongorong: rhooa masparh ra ffatenoa, rhooa pirhemae ra faaeraeg, rhooa kaenepaai ra gacch noa, rhooa saeningapiung ra rongorong, rhooa mae ra menawtae, nge Kkepas Mwamwaai we a fenai ngaeniir rhooa affayeo. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Ifa mwo wenepwuweer rhooa se tip mwaramwar reei!”<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Weni mwirin aar rhooan pweipwogin kkepas kkewe naiun John ra noa, Jesus a kkepas ngaeniir aeremas kkewe reen wunuunun John: “Igine oawwa noa reen John noan <char style="tl">desert</char> we, meeta minne oaw niuwaennei pwe oawpwe noa weri? Efoarh fetin e mwoaroro reen aaeng? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Meeta minne oawnoa pwe oawpwe weri? Erhai mwaaen kka e memmengaag tae mengaag nning? Rhooa kkomwu re memmengaag tae taeppen minikkena imwu reno rhag noan imwaen <char style="tl">king</char>! <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Aengaeniaei, meeta oawnoa pwe oawpwe weri? Erhai profeta? Ooa, ennetaen, oawwa weri erhai e taegias saengi erhai profeta. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>Pwe John miniwe Pwapwior we e Santus e iura pwe, ‘Deus a kkepas, ngaang ipwene fangetiw naeyi rhooan pweipwogin kkepas me weni mmwoamw pwe epwe noa maeneti ennepoamw.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe John ina e taegias saengiir aeremas towunap kka reno wooan soanop. Iwe nge manna oarosaen git me noan minna Mweoiun Deus ina e taegias saengi John.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Oanongeer aeremas nge re rongorong miniwe; iir me rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> kkewe re rongorong minikka mwaeniaen Deus nge e wenewen, iwe oanongeer noa ra noa paptismus reen John. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Iwe nge Pharisees me sinsein anniug kkewe rese tipaeni aaen Deus oatoat ngaeniir, iwe ina minne rese tipaeni no repwe paptismus reen John reen.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Jesus a pwan iura pwe, “Iwe, meeta ipwe aweweei ngaeniir aeremesaen mweoi e igina? E ifa wunuunuur? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Ra aeffitaeg ngaeniir rhag wonigaet kkewe remooat noan nenien chuwaai. Eew mwiirh nge re iyaekkepwas ngaeniir aaemweoi, ‘Aemaem aeiya pwai kker ngaenigaemi nge aaemi oawse maan! Aemaem aeiya arhiuwerhiuw, nge aaemi oawse saeng!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>John Baptist a itto, e aecchigipin nge ese pwan iun <char style="tl">wine</char>, nge aaemi oaw iura pwe, ‘Iiy eyor aniu aenneew wooan!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>A itto Naiun Aeremas, e mwommwongo nge e iun nge oaw iura pwe, ‘Oaw pipiiy mwaaen een! Iiy erhai mwaaen mwongonap me iun <char style="tl">wine</char>, nge maereyaereer rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> me rhooa monofit!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Iwe nge minna repiaen Deus a pwae noa pwe ennet reer aeremas kka re tapweei.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus me Reen Imwaen Pharisee we Simon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Erhai Pharisee e tengaeg Jesus epwe noa mwongoon faaef reen, iwe Jesus a noa reen iimw we imwan a noa mooat tiw pwe repwene mwongo. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Noan aepinoamw we eno erhai rhooapwut monofit ee. Niewe e rongorong pwe Jesus e mwongo reen iimw we imwaen Pharisee we, iwe a pwigito eew neoningas, <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>iwe a noa iu mwirin Jesus oaron pirheen nge a saeng nge e oasopwutiw rhaniun mesan wooan pirheen Jesus. Iwe a aepaena ngaeni aennirhimwen nge a faeisongei miniwe pirheen Jesus, iwe a aepiti ngaeni neoningas. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Igiwe Pharisee we a weri miniwe nge a kkepastiw rhag wooan nge a iura pwe, “Ngaere igine ennet pwe erhai profeta, mwaaeneei nge epwe pwae ngaeni iyo rhooapwut een me meeta taeppen aeremas iye e itto geotteopa; pwe rhooapwut een iye erhai maan monofit!”<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Jesus a kkepas nge a iura pwe, “Simon, eyor minne ipwe aengaeniug mwo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Simon a iura pwe, “Ooa wo sinsei, aengaeniaei?”<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Jesus a rhaepetae aan fioang, “Riiurhai mwaaen re monofit senaapiy me reen erhai rhooan fang senaapiy. Erhai e monofiti nimapwiugiuw faifayiun senaapiy <char style="tl">silver</char>, nge iwe erhai nimeig. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Esooar erhai rhooawe e e rhiuwen mmwenen aera minikkiwe monofitiir, iwe mwaaen we a oamoaw noa minikkewe monofitiir. Iwe ifa erhai neeiir ne epwe temoag aan aerhaengi mwaaen we?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simon a paniuwaeni pwe, “I maengi nge epwe mwaaen na e temoag minna e aar me reen monofitin.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Jesus a iura pwe, “Ennet reemw.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Iwe a toagun ngaeni rhooapwut we nge a mwaenieniy ngaeni Simon, “Woweri rhooapwut een? Ngaang itto noan minne imwoamw, nge esooar rhaan e wo ngoatto pwe toatoan pirheei, nge iya faer toafi pirheei reen rhaniun mesan nge e aepaena ngaeni aennirhimwen. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Wose faeisongei aei reen oamw aewenimmwaeyaei, nge iiy iye esaaen iug noa mwo reen aan faeisongei pirheei saengi rhag oatowe i tooto. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Esooar tiikka e wofang pwe aepitaen rhimwei, nge iiy a faer aepiti ngaeni pirheei neoningas. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Iwe ina minne ipwe aengaeniug pwe, aerhaengerhaeng temoag e a pwaeri noa, ina a tiwegin pwe oanongaen minikkiwe monofitin nge a saenetaeg noa. Iwe nge iyo na e egius rhag monofit na e aessaenetaegiy nge ina e egius rhag aan aerhaengerhaeng.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeni rhooapwut pwe, “A saenetaeg noa monofitimw.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Rhooa kkewe aaemweoi iwe remooat reen <char style="tl">table</char> we ra iura fengaenni pwe, “Iyo minne epwan gaen aessaenetaegiy aar aeremas monofit?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Nge Jesus a aengaeni rhooapwut we pwe, “Wa menaw reen oamw niugiuniug; wone noa noan oapoas.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Rhooapwut Kkewe re Tapweei Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Enoa faeiyegius noa Jesus a noa fetaen noan aepinoamw me pwugos kkewe, reen aan fenaiuw fetaeneei Kkepas Mwamwaai we reen Mweoiun Deus. Rhooan kkayeo kkewe seig me riiurhai re tapweei, <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>iwe me pwan aekkaerhai rhooapwut kkewe ra cchipw saengi aniu aenneew me mesemesaen semwaai: Maria (we pwan itan Magdalene), niewe Jesus e oatowowuw fiusiuman aniu aenneew me wooan; <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Joanna we rhooan ngaenneyaen Chuza we e nemaeni minikkiwe pisaegin Erotes; me Susanna, me pwan towunepeer rhooapwut kkewe regaen pwan tipaengi fetaeneei Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioangon Awewe Erhai Rhooan Aeperes Faiun Foat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mark 4.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Aeremas ra maegeto reen Jesus saengi eew me eew aepinoamw; iwe enoa mweoiuto eew pwuwa temoag nge Jesus a fioangei ngaeniir eew fioangon awewe:<verse eid="LUK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>“Eno erhai mwaaen a noa pwe epwe noa aeperes faiun foat. Igiwe e aeperes fetaen foat kkewe, aekkaefai faiun ra ppiungiutiw wenepeigin aan we, nge repwuriir noa, nge man aeniaen epwan anginoa. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Aekkaefai ra ppiungtiw wooan kaenefai, renoa pwaech tae nge reppwass noa pwe ese patapat ppweoniun. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Aekkaefai ra ppiungiutiw neeiin irae towfanfan. Iwe irae towfanfan kkewe ra menawtae nge ra fittitae wooar iwe ra maenoa. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Nge aekkaefai ra ppiungiutiw wooan ppweon mwamwaai, iwe ra menaw tae nge ra uwa, nge efoarh nge epwe epwiugiuw uwaan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Iwe Jesus a soapwei noa, “Iyo eyor saeningan, epwe rongorong!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faaen Aaen Jesus Kkepesaen Fioangon Awewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mark 4.10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra aeiineow Jesus meeta faaen fioang we. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Iwe a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Deus a fang ngaenigaemi pwe oawpwe giuneei kkepas mwoanomwoanon minna Mweoiun Deus, nge iga aaemweoi ina epwe toowow noan fioangon awewe, pwe ina repwene pipiiy nge resoapw weri, nge ina repwene aiussaening nge resoapw metaf reen.<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aemmetefa Fioangon Awewen Rhooan Foat we</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mark 4.13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>“Ieen faaen fioang we: faiun foat we ina kkepesaen Deus. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Faiun kkewe re ppiungiutiw wenepeigin aan, ra aeffitaeg ngaeni rhooawe re rongorong kkepesaen Deus, nge e itto rhag Saetan nge e itto pwigi noa miniwe kkepesaen Deus me reer, pwe rese niugiuniug iwe ra menaw. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Nge faiun kkewe re ppiungiutiw wooan kaenefai, ra aeffitaeg ngaeni rhooawe re rongorong kkepas we nge ra kker aegini. Nge ina rhag ese itinong nee tipeer; pwe egiufet rhag aar niugiuniug, pwe e itto rhag oaton sessoat nge ra mwetekkaein fangetae. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Nge faiun kkewe re ppiungiutiw neeiin irae towfanfan, ra aeffitaeg ngaeni rhooawe re rongorong; nge aiunaeng me naiwiis me aemmesaeigaen wooan feoniufan a fittiir noa iwe ese mmarh minikkewe uwaan. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Nge faiun kkewe re ppiungiutiw noan ppweon mwamwaai, ra aeffitaeg ngaeni rhooa kkewe re rongorong minna kkepesaen Deus; nge ra aeiseisa nong noan ennetin me mwamwaaiun pwunnoor, nge ra aetemaegin rhag toori aar uwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eew Oappwun Eno Faaen Saepiy</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mark 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>“Esooar ne egaen fifi oappwun nge a iseni nong faaen saepiy ngaere ngoanoa faaen pooa. Pwe refaer pwigi ngaettae wooan nenien oappwun pwe aeremas repwe seram igine ra toonong.<verse eid="LUK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>“Oanongaen meeta ewop noa epwene pwae noa, nge oanongaen meeta e pwanipwan nge epwe pwae noa noan seram.<verse eid="LUK 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>“Oawpwe aefaennigaemi reen wunuunun aaemi aiussaening; pwe iyo a yor meeta aan nge repwe pwan fang ngaeni, nge iyo kena esooar nge refaer pwigi saengiir mwo nge giufetin minikkena re maengiy pwe eno reer.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rhooapwut we Inaen Jesus me Mwaaen Kkewe Pwiin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mark 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Rhooapwut we inaen Jesus me mwaaen kkewe pwiin re itto reen, nge rese mmwenen rhungaeni pwonno rhooanap we. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Nge erhai a aengaeni Jesus pwe, “Niewe inoamw me mwaaen kkewe pwiimw ikka reno niugiun, nge re mwerhaen repwe rhuungiug.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Jesus a aengaeniir oanongeer pwe, “Maan na inaei me mwaaen kena pwiiy ina rhooakka re rongorong kkepesaen Deus nge re tapweei.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Oapoassaetiw Eew Aaeng Cchoaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mark 4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Eraaen Jesus a teeotae wooan efoarh pwoot Iiy me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw sipwe noa epeig meoneoiniun eei.” Iwe ra noa. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Igiwe ra sesseraeg noa nge Jesus a maiur noa. Ese mmwaei mwo nge a noa itto eew aaeng cchoaw noan meoneoiniun we, iwe pwoot we a mweomweoyius nge rhooa kkewe ra no noan oawoas. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra noa reen Jesus ra noa faingitae, ra iura pwe, “Soamwoon, Soamwoon! Sipwene mae!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Jesus a mmasetae a kkepas sseor ngaeni aaeng we me noa we pwe repwe poas noa; iwe ra iug noa, nge a igin rhoaraeg noa. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Iwe a aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe pwe, “Eno iya aaemi niugiuniug?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Rhooawe ra riutae nge ra mesag, nge ra iura fengaenni wooar pwe, “Iyo mwaaeneei? E mwaenieniy ngaeni aaeng me noa, nge re tapweei mwaenian!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwa Erhai Mwaaen Eyor Aniu Aenneew Wooan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mark 5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra saei saengi Galilee nge ra noa Gerasa, iwe eno peigin meoneoiniun we me eotiw. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Igiwe Jesus a tiwegitae ppiy, nge a noa rhuungi erhai mwaaenin aepinoamw we nge eyor aniu aenneew wooan. A ssiunaei aaen mwaaen een se memmengaag nge ese pwan nonotiw no noan imwan, pwe a noa no fetaen rhag noan paeyi kkewe. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Iwe oatowe eweri Jesus, nge a igin eor noa, nge a foatotiw me weni mmwaen Jesus nge a aepwesaegini pwe, “Jesus, mwaaen na Naiun Deus na oarosaen taegias! Meeta minne wo tipaeni me reei? Iya aeffaenipirheog pwe wosoapw aewwaeiraesiaei!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>E iura minneei pwe iga Jesus a oatowowuw mwuniaan aenneew we me wooan. Towunepaen oatokka epwe kkaein ngaeni, nge inamwo iga e geeogeeo paiun me pirheen ngaeni <char style="tl">ccheen</char> nge egaen mweoiti, iwe mwuniaan we a pwigi noa noan <char style="tl">desert</char>.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Jesus a aeiineow pwe, “Meeta itoamw?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Mwaaen we a paniuwaeni pwe, “Itaei nge Cchon, ” pwonno iga a towunap mwuniaan wartae wooan. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Mwuniaan kkewe ra aeffaenipirheei Jesus pwe esoapw fangenoa iir noan niipw we e igin nennoan.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Eew cchon sino re mwongo fetaen wooan eew taeiit. Iwe mwuniaan kkewe ra aeffaenipirhe ngaeni Jesus pwe epwe aeweraar tae wooar sino kkewe, iwe a aeweraar tae wooar. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Iwe aniu kkewe ra toowow me wooan mwaaen we nge ra wartae wooar sino kkewe. Cchon sino we ra fattapw tiw rhag me wenepeigin rhug we ittiw noan meoneoiniun we itinong moapw noa.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Mwaaen kkewe rhooan ffooanon sino reweri meeta we a wen, iwe ra fattapw noa arheoiuwa fetaeneei noan aepinoamw we me menaai kkewe. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Aeremas ra maeg wow pipiiy miniwe a wen, nge renoa itto reen Jesus ra itto rhuungi mwaaen we retowow mwuniaan me wooan, pwe emooat wenepeigin pirheen Jesus, nge e memmengaag nge iiy man reepiy; iwe rhooa kkewe ra igin mesag. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Rhooawe reweri miniwe ra fioangei ngaeniir aeremas wunuunun aar aniu aenneew kkewe toowow me wooan mwaaen we. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Iwe rhag nge oanongeer aeremesaen pwiuneoi we ra tingoareei Jesus epwe nigitiir, pwe igiwe ra igin mesag. Iwe Jesus a teeotae wooan pwoot we a noa. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Mwaaen we etowow aniu kkewe me wooan a aeffaenipirhe ngaeni Jesus epwe tapweei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Nge Jesus a aefenganoa, nge a aengaeni pwe, <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>“Sefaaen noa nee pwugusoamw nge wa noa fioangei meeta e Deus a feeori ngaeniug.” Iwe mwaaen we a noa fetaen noan aepinoamw we a noa fioangei fetaeneei meeta we Jesus a feeori ngaeni.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rhooapwut we Naiun Jairus me Rhooapwut we e Geotteopa Mengaagiun Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mark 5.21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Oatowe Jesus enoa sefaaeniti peigin meoneoiniun we epeig, aeremas ra itto aetiwa, pwe igiwe ra wetiwet noa rhag iiy. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Erhai mwaaen itan Jairus a noa itto; iiy erhai soamwoonin wutteer Jews. A itto foatotiw weni mmwaen pirheen Jesus a aeffaenipirhe ngaeni epwe tapweei noa reen iimw na imwan, <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>pwe igiwe rhooapwut we naiun iwe enaaen seig me ruwowu raegin a oaropaen mae.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Igiwe Jesus a tapweei noa nge aeremas ra igin itto aetietiy ngaeni. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Eno erhai rhooapwut neeiir eseiug aan peitaeg noa noan seig me ruwowu raeg, nge esooar erhai ne emmwenen aecchipwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Rhooapwut we a itto me niugiusagiuriun Jesus a itto geotteopa soapwon mengaagiun, iwe rhag nge e iug noa aan noa epeig faniuw. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Nge Jesus a aeiineo pwe, “Iyo we e geotteopayaei?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Oanongeer rhooawe nge re iura pwe saapw iir, nge Peter a iura pwe, “Soamwoon, regin ssow rhooakka re pwaeniaeniug noa me aetietiy ngaeniug.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Jesus a iura pwe, “Erhai imwu e geotteopayaei, pwe i meyaefi maemaewaei aan toowow me wooai.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Iwe rhooapwut we a giuneei pwe a pwae miniwe efeeori, iwe a noa faaeraeg ngongongoto a itto aerheei tiw me weni mmwaen pirheen Jesus. Weni mmweer rhooanap we iwe niewe a aengaeni faaen minne e geotteopa reen me wunuunun aan iug noa aan noa epeig faniuw oatowe e geotteopa. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Jesus a aengaeni niewe pwe, “Naeyi, oamw niugiuniug minne a aecchipwoag tae. Wonoa noan oapoas.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Nge igiwe Jesus e rhiuwen kekkepas, nge erhai rhooan oarong a noa itto me reen imwaen Jairus nge a aengaeni Jairus pwe, “A mae noa rhooapwut we noawumw, wosoapw rhiuwen angiurhiu no Sinsei na.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Jesus e rongorong miniwe nge a aengaeni Jairus pwe, “Wosoapw mesag; niugiuniug rhag ina nge epwe menaw tae.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Oatowe enoa toorito iimw we, ese tipan pwe aeremas repwe tapweei nong nee iimw pwe aeggaen Peter rhag me John me James iwe me mwaaen we seman me inaen aet we. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Oanongeer aeremas kkewe noan iimw we ra saeng wooan aet we. Jesus a iura pwe, “Oawsoapw saeng; aeteen iye ese mae, pwe aan rhag maiur!”<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Rhooa kkewe ra kekkaei aegini pwe igiwe re giuneei pwe aet we a mae. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Jesus a ammwarhiu tae paiun nge a iura pwe, “Rhimwitae, moawwerh!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Iwe a menaw tae nge a rhiuwei rhimwitae rhag. Iwe Jesus a aengaeniir repwe ngaenneei anan mwongo. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Mwaaen we seman me inaen aet we ra riutae, nge Jesus a ammwir ngaeniir pwe resoapw aengaeni mwo nge erhai meeta e a wen.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aefengaar Noa Rhooawe Seig me Riiurhai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mark 6.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Jesus a faingi fengaenniir rhooawe seig me riiurhai a fang ngaeniir nemaenieer me aar manaman pwe repwe asiiur aniu aenneew me aecchipwaar rhooa semwaai. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Iwe a aefengaar noa pwe repwe noa fenaiuw minna Mweoiun Deus nge re aecchipwaar rhooa semwaai. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>A aengaeniir pwe, “Esooar minne oawpwe pwigi wooan aaemi saei: oawsoapw pwigi yomi, oawsoapw pweipwog aaemi pwetoaw, oawsoapw pweipwog mwongo, oawsoapw pweipwog senaapiy, oawsoapw pwan pweipwog ssiuwenin mengaagiumi. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Ese tiwegin iya re aetiwaegaemi me ee, oawno noan iimw naan toori aaemi oawpwe siu me reen aepinoamw naan; <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>iwe nge pwiuneoi na aeremas rese aetiwaegaemi me ee, nge oawwa siusaengi pwiuneoi we nge oawwa iurhiugi noa ppweoniun me wooan pirhemi pwe eew atapeonneog ngaeniir.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra noa fetaen noan aepinoamw kkewe, ra noa fenaiuw Kkepas Mwamwaai we nge re aecchipwaar aeremesaen oanongaen pwiuneoi.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aaen Erotes Pwurhopwurh Fetaen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mark 6.14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Oatowe Erotes, we soamwoonin Galilee, e rongorong minikkewe a wen a igin pwurhopwurh fetaen, pwe aaemweoi re iura pwe John Baptist a menaw sefaaen. <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Aaemweoi re iura pwe Elijah minne a pwaeto, iwe nge pwan aaemweoi re iura pwe erhai <char style="tl">profeta</char> kkewe mweoiwe minne a menaw sefaaen. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Erotes a iura pwe, “John iwe iya gopiy noa iiuwaen, nge iyo mwaaeneei i rongorong kkepesan?” Iwe a aekkaetemaegini fetaeneei aan epwe noa weri Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Oamwongoor Nimingeras Aeremas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mark 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">John 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Iwe ra sefaaeneto oapostonus kkewe ra itto aengaeni Jesus meeta kkewe ra feeori. A wummwuur, iwe iir rhag ra noa reen eew aepinoamw itan Bethsaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Igiwe pwuwaen aeremas we ra rongorong ra pwan ttapw noa mwirin. Jesus a aewenimmwaar, a fenaiuw ngaeniir wunuunun minna Mweoiun Deus iwe nge e aecchipwaar rhooakka re semwaai.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Noan faefin we nge rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra itto reen nge ra aengaeni pwe, “E igin anug noa igeei nge a pwan pwoong. Aefengaar noa aeremas kaan nee aepinoamw pwe repwene noa sipegin chuwaai aeneer mwongo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Jesus a faer aengaeniir pwe, “Oawfang ngaeniir aeneer.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Nge ra iura pwe, “Niffai rhag fenoawa me riiurhai iig minne eno remaem. Wo mwerhaen pwe aeipwe noa nge aeiya noa chuwaai to aeneer rhooanap een?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>(Repwe nimingeras mwaaen reno igiwe.)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Jesus a aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Oaw aengaeniir pwe repwe mooat tiw nge repwe aenimeig aeremas noan eew me eew pwoatu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Weni mwirin aar rhooan kkayeo kkewe feeori miniwe, <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>nge Jesus a pwigi fenoawa kkewe niffai me iig kkewe riiurhai, a fattae naaeng nge a fang ngaeni Deus aan aerhigerhig. Iwe a giniiy fenoawa kkewe nge a fang ngaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe pwe repwe inetiy wooar aeremas kkewe. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Oanongeer nge ra maegin mwongo iwe ra mat noa. Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra oawuta seig me ruwowu rhiug reen nuseg kkewe.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peter e Iura pwe Jesus Iwe Kristus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mark 8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Igiwe Jesus noa rhag aan noa maeipin, rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra noa itto reen. Iwe a aeiyegiir, “Aeremas re iura pwe ngaang iyo?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Ra paniuwaeni, “Aaemweoi re iura pwe een John Baptist, nge aekkaaemweoi re iura pwe een Elijah, nge pwan aekkaaemweoi re iura pwe een erhai <char style="tl">profeta</char> kkewe mweoiwe nge wa menaw sefaaen.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>A aeiineeor pwe, “Nge aaemi, oaw iura pwe ngaang iyo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Peter a paniuwaeni pwe, “Een Kristus we Naiun Deus.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aepesa Waeiraesin me Maenoan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16.20-28</ref>; Mark 8.30 — 9.1)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Jesus a aetiwenigiy ngaeniir pwe resoapw aengaeni mwo nge erhai minneei. <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Nge a pwan aengaeniir pwe, “Mwaaen na Naiun Aeremas ina epwe gin affayeo nge e serhoawun me neeiir mwaaen kkewe aar me soamwoonin patere me sinsein anniug. Repwene niiy noa nge eoniuraen mwirin nge a menaw sefaaen.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Nge a aengaeniir oanongeer pwe, “Erhai ne e mwerhaen tapweaei, epwe aerheei noa niunniuwaennen wooan oanongan, a aiufera aan kurus oanongaen raaenin, nge a tapweeito mwiriy. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Pwe iyo e mwerhaen ammwarhiu menewan, epwe ppiung saengi. Nge iyo eppiung saengi menewan pwonno ngaang, epwe giuneei menaw. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Epwe yor ipitan igine eyo ngaeniug oanongan noa faeinaengiy nge a soano saengiug menewoamw? Esooar ipitan! <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Aere wosaew aeginiaei me fenai kka aaei, ina nge mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas epwe pwan saew aeginiug igine a noa itto noan nningen me nningen mwaaen na Seman me nningeer angkenus kena re santus. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Ipwe aniugiuniugiuw ngaenigaemi pwe eyor aaemweoi aeremas igeei resoapw mae toori oatona repwe weri minna Mweoiun Deus.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nniuwen Noan Wunuunun Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mark 9.2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Epwe eew noa <char style="tl">week</char> mwirin aan Jesus aepesa minikkeei, nge a pwigiir Peter, John, me James ra ittae maeipin wooan eew rhug. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Oatowe e maeipin, a nniuwen noa wunuunun wooan mesan, nge miniwe mengaagiun a marettin pwerhepwerh noa. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Ese mmwaei mwo nge riiurhai mwaaen ra itto mwaenieniy ngaeni. Iir Moses me Elijah, <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>repwaeto noan nning seramram nge ra itto mwaenieniy ngaeni Jesus reen wunuunun aan epwene pwaeritae aaen Deus koat reen aan epwe mae noa me noan Jerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Peter me rhooawe rhoaniuwan ra igin maiur, nge renoa mmasetae ra weri miniwe seramramaen nningen Jesus me mwaaen kkewe riiurhai iwe re iu oaron. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Igiwe mwaaen kkewe riiurhai ra siunoa, nge Peter a aengaeni Jesus pwe, “Sinsei, a igin gacch pwe sino igeei. Aeipwe aiuwtae enuuw iimw tampwoning, eew imwoamw, eew imwaen Moses, me eew imwaen Elijah.” (Ese metefaaegini faaen minikkiwe e aepesa.)<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Igiwe e rhiuwen kkepas, a itto eew toapw pwaniiur noa faaen niuriun; rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra mesag reen toapw we a itto pwaniiur noa. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Eew mangiungiu a noa ittiw me noan toapw we, “Ieen mwaaen e naeyi, iye iya finitae — oaw aiussaening ngaeni!”<verse eid="LUK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Iwe mangiungiu we a iug noa, iwe a Jesus noa rhag. Rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra anniug aegini noa rhag miniwe, nge esooar mwo erhai ne re aengaeni meeta we ra weri reen oatowe.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aecchipwa Erhai Aetemwaaen Eyor Aniu Aenneew Wooan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mark 9.14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Mmasetaen raaen we eraaen nge Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe eoniurhai ra ittiw me wooan rhug we, nge eew pwuwa temoag ra itto reen Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Erhai mwaaen a aekkepwas me noan pwuwa we, “Sinsei! Faaen pirhemw, itto pipiiy aet e naeyi — ieen rhag naeyi mwaaen! <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Oate aniu aenneew een epwe kkaein tiw wooan, nge e rhiuwen apwas rhag nge a ittiw cchech fetaen, pwuropwur wow noan ewan; e aewwaeiraesi fetaeneei rhag nge esa siusaengi no! <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Iya aeffaenipirhe ngaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe noawumw pwe repwe oatowowuw, nge ese mmwen ngaeniir.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Ifa mwo aaemi se niugiuniug me ruguppin faaen oateei! Epwe ifa ssiunaein aaei ipwe no reemi? Epwe ifa wusun aaei noaneenaei reemi?” Iwe nge a aengaeni mwaaen we pwe, “Pwigito aetemwu noawumw iga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Igiwe aetewe a itto reen nge aniu aenneew we a aerheitiw wooan ppweon a ittiw cchech fetaen. Jesus a aerh ngaeni aniu aenneew we pwe epwe toowow, iwe a aecchipwa aet we, iwe a iseni sefaaeniy ngaeni mwaaen we seman. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Oanongeer rhooawe ra mwaar reen maemaewaen kkemenaen Deus.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Jesus a Pwan Aepesa Wunuunun Aan Maenoa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mark 9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Oanongeer aeremas kkewe nge ra riutae reen meeta kkewe Jesus a feeori nge a aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>“Oawteorh maniuwegini minne ipwe aengaenigaemi! Mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas epwene yonong nee paiiur aeremas.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Iwe nge iir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun rese metefaaegini faaen miniwe mwaenian. Miniwe ekooap saengiir pwonno rete metefaaegini, iwe iir ra mesag pwe repwe aeiyeg.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyo e Oarosaen Taegias?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mark 9.33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Iwe rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra aengiingi fengaen neeiir ngaere iyo e oarosaen taegias. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Jesus a giuneei niunniuwaen kkewe aar, iwe a pwigi erhai wonigaet a aiuw tiw oaron, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>a aengaeniir pwe, “Iyo e aetiwa aeteen faaen itaei, ina e aetiwaeyaei; nge iyo erhai ne e aetiwaeyaei, ina e aetiwa aeremas na efangeto ngaang. Pwe iyo na oarosaen sessoan neeimi nge ina iiy minne oarosaen taegias.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyo na Ese Appaniuwaenigaemi Nge Ina Rhoaniuwaemi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mark 9.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>John a iura pwe, “Sinsei, aeiweri erhai mwaaen e oatowowuw aniu aenneew faaen itoamw, nge aeiya aengaeni pwe epwe iug noa pwe saapw iiy rhoaniuwarh.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Oawsoapw aiugiu noa, pwe iyo na ese appaniuwaenigaemi ina rhoaniuwaemi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eew Aepinoamwon Samaria Ese Aetiwa Jesus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Igiwe a arapeto oaton aaen Jesus noa naaeng, a aettiweginiy nee tipan epwe noa Jerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>A fangenoa rhooan pweipwogin kkepas repwe noa wooan eew aepinoamw me Samaria repwe noa oamoannatae oanongaen meeta me weni mmwan. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Iwe nge aeremesaen pwiuneoi we rese mwerhaen aetiwa pwe igiwe epwae ngaeniir pwe epwene noa Jerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Igiwe James me John ra giuneei miniwe ra aengaeni pwe, “Soamwoon, wo mwerhaen pwe aeipwe tingoar noa aengaet naaeng pwe epwe ittiw figiir noa?”<verse eid="LUK 9:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Jesus a toagun ngaeniir a soong ngaeniir. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Iwe Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra noa wooan eew noa aepinoamw.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rhooan Mwerhaen Tapweei Mwirin Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8.19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Igiwe ra noa erhai mwaaen a aengaeni Jesus, “Ese tiwegin iga wopwe noa ee nge ngaang ipwe tapweog.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “<char style="tl">Fox</char> eyor ngeteer, man aeniaen eyor feseer, iwe nge mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas esooar eew pwiuneoi ne epwe noa wonotiw aseoseo ee.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Jesus a pwan aengaeni erhai mwaaen, “Itto tapweaei.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Iwe mwaaen we a paniuwaeni pwe, “Soamwoon, mmwaen fang mwo ngaang ipwe sefaaen noa nipwaeni noa mwaaen na semaei.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Nigitiir rhooa mae repwe sipegin nipwaeni aar mae. Nge een wa noa arheoiuwa fetaeneei kkepesaen minna Mweoiun Deus.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Pwan erhai mwaaen a iura, “Menap, ipwe tapweog; nge ipwe mmwaen noa mwo oapwongiir aaei famini.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Erhai ne epwe rhaepetae aan engaengaen maat nge e feffan sefaaen nge iiy esoapw firh ngaeni minna Mweoiun Deus.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aefengaar Noa Rhooawe Fisiig me Riiurhai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Mwirin minneen nge Soamwoon a finiir fisiig me riiurhai mwaaen, nge a aefengaar noa e repwe riiurhai me riiurhai, pwe repwe gommw noa noan eew me eew aepinoamw me taeninimw kkewe iiy epwe noa e. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Iya aengaeniir pwe, “A towunap uwaen menaai, nge re fitiman rhag rhooan gin. Oaw maeipin ngaeni soamwoonin maat we pwe epwe fangenoa rhooan engaang pwe repwe giniiy oanongaen uwaen maat we aan. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Oawnoa! Ipwene aefengaegaemi noa pwe oawpwene weei rhag <char style="tl">sheep</char> neeiir <char style="tl">wolves</char>. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Oawsoapw pweipwog aaemi saiff ngaere pwetoaw ngaere nokkaemi; nge oawsoapw iunoa pwe oawpwe koapwong ngaeniir aeremas me wooan ennap. <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Ese tiwegin eew iimw ne wopwe toonong noan nge mesaemmwaen minna wopwe iura ina, ‘Oapoas epwe no reer rhooan imweei.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Ngaere eyor erhai aeremas ne epoas eno iginaan, iwe nge oawwa nigititiw kkepesaen oapoas we aaemi reen; iwe ngaere esooar, ina nge oawwa pwigi sefaaeniy kkepesaen oapoas we aaemi. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Oawpwe no rhag noan iimw we, nge oaw mwongo nge oaw iun ese tiwegin meeta refang ngaenigaemi, pwe rhooan engaang ina epwe toowow paniuweer. Oawsoapw siu me reen eew iimw nge oawnoa me reen eew. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Ngaere igine oawtonong noan eew aepinoamw nge re aetiwagaemi, oaw mwongo meeta refang ngaenigaemi, <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>oaw aecchipwaar rhooa semwaai noan aepinoamw naan, nge oaw aengaeniir aeremas kena reno noan pwe, ‘Mweoiun Deus a arapeto reemi.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Ngaere oaw itinong noan eew aepinoamw nge rese aetiwagaemi, nge oawwa itiwow wooan ennap nge oawwa iura pwe, <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>‘Eew mwo ppweoniun noan aepinoamw e aepinoamwomi iye e mmwarh tae wooan pirhemaem nge iye aeipwene peonitiw reemi. Nge oawwa maengi rhag pwe minna Mweoiun Deus ina a arap ngaenigaemi!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Iya aengaenigaemi pwe noan Raaenin Apwiung nge Deus epwe faayeow re Sodom memmweer aeremesaen aepinoamw naan!<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aepinoamw Kkewe Rese Niugiuniug</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>“Ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi aaemi rhooan Chorazin! Pwan ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi aaemi rhooan Bethsaida! Aere kkeman kka refeeori me wooan igeei minne refeeori me wooan Tyre me Sidon, ina nge a ssiunaei rhag aar mooat tiw, nge ra memmengaag tutu nge re oamworomwor tae fenang wooar, pwe epwe pwae noa aar toagun saengi monofit! <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Noan Raaenin Apwiung nge Deus epwe faayeow re Tyre me re Sidon me mmwaemi. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Nge een Capernaum! Wo tipaeni wopwe tooritae naaeng? Een wopwe ppiungiutiw noan nifierno!”<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>Jesus a aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Iyo e aiussaening ngaeniug e aiussaening ngaeniaei; nge iyo e oapwutaegaemi e oapwutaeyaei, nge iyo e oapwutaeyaei e oapwuta iyo na efangeto ngaang.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rhooawe Fisiig me Riiurhai ra Sefaaeneto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Mwaaen kkewe fisiig me riiurhai ra sefaaeneto noan aar igin kker. Ra iura, “Soamwoon, mwuniaan mwo nge re aiussaening mwaeniaemaem reen kkemenaen minna itoamw!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Iweri Saetan aan ppiungiutiw pwe eweei rhag ffiutiwen weriwer me noan naaeng. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Aiussaening! Iya ngaennegaemi kkaeinemi, pwe epwe mmwen pwe oawpwe faaeraeg wooar sowufaeng me maennipwong, nge oawniiy noa minikkena kkaeinen mwuniaan nge esooar minne oawpwe woas reen.<figure style="fig" alt=". . ." file="BK00058B.tif" size="col" loc=". . ." copy=". . ." ref="10.19"/> <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Iwe nge oawsoapw igin kker reen pwonno iga aniu aenneew re aiussaening ngaenigaemi; pwe oawfaer kker pwe iga itaemi a foatofoat me wooan naaeng.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Kker</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13.16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Reen oatowe nge Jesus a sseog noan kker me reen Espritu Santus nge a iura pwe, “Semaei, Soamwoonin naaeng me soanop, iya ngaenneog oamw aerhigerhig, pwe wa oapanoa minikkeei saengiir rhooa reepiy me metefaaegini, nge wa pwaeri ngaeniir rhooa kkewe reweer wonigaet. Ennet, Semaei, pwe ina minna wo tipaeni epwe wen.<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>“Semaei a ngaenneaei oanongaen meeta. Nge esooar erhai ne e giuneei minna Naiun pwe aeggaen minna Seman rhag, nge esooar ne e giuneei minna Seman pwe aeggaen minna Naiun rhag, iwe me iyo kena minna Naiun a finiir tae pwe epwe pwaeri ngaeniir.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Iwe Jesus a toagun ngaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun nge a iura pwe, “Wenepwu iir maskena ra weri meeta aaemi oawwa weri! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Iya aengaenigaemi pwe ressow <char style="tl">profeta</char> me <char style="tl">king</char> ra mwerhaen weri meeta kka aaemi oawwa weri, nge iir rese weri. Ra pwan mwerhaen rongorong meeta kka aaemi oawwa rongorong, nge iir rese rongorong.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioangon Re Samaria we e Mwamwaai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Erhai sinsein anniug a itto epwe soatoni Jesus. Mwaaen we a iura pwe, “Sinsei, meeta minne ipwe feeori nge epwe yo ngaeniaei menaw na esooar iaenin?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Meeta miniwe Pwapwior we e Santus e iura? Meeta aemmetefan me reemw?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Mwaaen we a iura pwe, “Wopwe aerhaengi Soamwoon na oamw Deus reen oanongaen nee tipoamw, reen oanongaen ngeoniumw, reen oanongaen oamw niunniuwaen, pwan reen oanongaen maemaewoamw, iwe nge wa aerhaengiir rhooan weni oaromw taeppen rhag oamw sipegin aerhaengi oanongoamw.”<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Jesus a iura pwe, “Ennet ngaeniug, wopwe feeori minikkena nge wopwe menaw.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Iwe nge iiy e tipaeni epwe pwaeri noa pwe ennet meeta kkewe e iura, iwe a aeiineow Jesus pwe, “Iyo kena aeremesaen weni oaroi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Eyor erhai mwaaen emwet saengi Jerusalem epwe noa Jericho nge rhooa mwoarho ra torofi, ra pwigi saengi mengaagiun, ra niiy, nge ra nigiti noa nge epwene oaropaen mae. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Enoa wen ngaeni pwe erhai patere epwan taeri rhag ennap we; igiwe eweri mwaaen we nge a toakonoa peigin aan we me epeig. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Epwan ina wunuunun erhai re <char style="tl">Levite</char> epwan itto pwiuneoi we, a weri mwaaen we nge a pwan toakonoa me peigin ennap we. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Iwe nge erhai re Samaria enoa faaeraegto, a pwan itto rhuungi mwaaen we, eweri rhag mwaaen we nge a gin ffaiyeow. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>A noa reen mwaaen we, a noa aepiti minikkewe ginisan ngaeni tiikka me <char style="tl">wine,</char> iwe a tiugiumi noa; a iseni tae mwaaen we wooan manewe naiun nge a pwigi noa noan imwaen waseona, iwe a noa aemmwena me ee. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Mmasetaen raaen we eraaen a pwigi riiufai faifayiun senaapiy a ngaenneei mwaaen we aan iimw we. Iwe a aengaeni pwe, ‘Wa aemmwena aeremas een, nge ese tiwegin meeta paerenoan oamw ammwen, nge ngaang ipwe aesefaaeni ngaeniug oate ipwe sefaaeneto.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>Jesus a soapwei noa, “Noan oamw niunniuwaen nge ifa erhai me neeiir rhooa kkewe eoniurhai ne e ffaiyeow mwaaen we rhooa mwoarho reniiy?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Sinsein anniug we a paniuwaeni pwe, “Aeremas we e aemmwena.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Iwe Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Wonoa nge wa noa feeori taeppen rhag minnaan.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Noa Sengaeriir Martha me Maria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Igiwe Jesus me rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra noa, Jesus a itinong noan eew aepinoamw nge erhai rhooapwut itan Martha a aetiwa nong noan iimw we imwan. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Eno erhai pwiin rhooapwut itan Maria, a itto mooat tiw reen pirheen Soamwoon nge a aiussaening ngaeni fenai kkewe aan. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Martha a tip mworhomworh reen oanongaen engaang kkewe a feeori, iwe a itto reen Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Soamwoon, wose aetenaegiy noa mwo pwe nie pwiiy a nigiti ngaeniaei rhag oanongaen engaang pwe ipwe feeori? Aengaeni pwe epwe itto tipaengiaei!”<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Soamwoon a iura pwe, “Martha, Martha! E towunap minikkena wa aiunaengiy noa rhag nge esa poas no tipoamw reen, <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>pwe aeggaen eew noa rhag minne eyor ipitan. Maria a fini minna egacch, nge esooar erhai ne epwe pwigi saengi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Fenaiuw Wunuunun Maeipin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Eraaen nge Jesus a maeipin eew pwiuneoi. Oatowe enoa moann aan maeipin, erhai me neeiir rhooan kkayeo kkewe a aengaeni pwe, “Soamwoon, fenaiuw ngaenigemaem wunuunun maeipin, taeppen aaen John fenaiuw ngaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Igine oawpwe maeipin, ieen minne oawpwe iura:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Semmaem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">aemwo epwe ssoar minna itoamw ina e santus;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">aemwo Mweoiumw epwe war.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Ngaennegemaem aenemaem mwongo eraaen me eraaen.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Wopwe saeneti noa aemaem monofit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">wunuunun pwan aemaem aeiya saenetiir noa rhooakkena re monofit ngaenigemaem.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Wosoapw oatonongegemaem noan sessoat.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Ngaere igine a nugaenipwoong nge erhai me neeimi a noa reen imwaen erhai maereyaeren nge a iura pwe, ‘Maereyaerei, ipwe tingoareog mwo eoniufai fenoawa. <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>Erhai maereyaerei enaaen wareto rhag me wooan aan saei, nge esooar minne ipwe fang pwe anan me reen imwaei!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Iwe nge ngaere mwaaen we maereyaeremw a noa kkepas wow me nee iimw nge e iura pwe, ‘Wosoapw itto aetipoapwutaeyaei! A fasiun amwarh noa asam nge ngaang me aetekka naeyi aeiya maiur. Isoapw mmwenen rhimwitae pwe ipwe iseis ngaeniug aegiaeg.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe inamwo e iura esoapw rhimwitae pwe epwe ngaenneog fenoawa kena pwe iga oaw maereyaer, nge iiy ina epwe fasiun rhimwitae pwe epwe ngaenneog oanongaen minikkena wo tingoar pwe iga een wose saew reen oamw tingoar noa rhag. <verse eid="LUK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>Ina minne ngaang ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe: oawpwe tittingoar, ina nge epwe yo ngaenigaemi; oawpwe giutta, ina nge oawpwe weri; oawpwe apiungiupiung wooan asam, ina nge epwe sugaeg ngaenigaemi. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Pwe iyo a tittingoar nge epwe yo ngaeni, nge iyo a giutta epwe weri, nge asam epwe sugaeg ngaeni iyo na e apiungiupiung. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Emmwen pwe aaemi saam kena oawpwe ngaenneei naimi sowufaeng igine e tingoar iig? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Me ngaere oawpwe ngaenneei erhai maennipwong aere e tingoar soagun? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Inamwo aaemi aeremas aenneew, nge oawwa giuneei aaemi oawpwe fang ngaeniir naimi minikka e mwamwaai. Epwe ifa mwo nepaen faeregitin aaen minna Semaemi wooai naaeng epwe fang Espritu Santus ngaeniir rhooakkena re tingoar ngaeni!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus me Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mark 3.20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Jesus a oatowowuw erhai aniu aenneew me wooan erhai mwaaen ese mmwenen kkepas; oatowe e oatowowuw aniu aenneew we me wooan mwaaen we, iwe mwaaen we a rhaep aan mmwenen kkepas fetaen. Iwe pwuwaen aeremas we ra mwaar reen miniwe, <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>nge aekkaaemweoi ra iura pwe, “Beelzebul, manewe soamwoonin aniu aenneew, minne efang maemaewan pwe epwe asiiur noa aniu aenneew.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Nge aaemweoi re niunniuwaennei repwe aegina Jesus, iwe ra aengaeni pwe epwe feeori eew kkeman pwe epwe pwaeri noa pwe efin tipaen Deus reen. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Nge Jesus e giuneei niunniuwaen kkewe aar, iwe a aengaeniir pwe, “Aere eew faniuw a ginigin fesaeng nge ra fiiow fengaen wooar, faniuw een esoapw ssiunaei; nge rhooan eew famini ne rese tip eew nge repwe toaroporop. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Iwe ngaere minna mweoiun Saetan epwan ginigin kkit tiw nge re fiffiiow fengaen rhag wooar, epwe ifa wusun rhag nge epwe iutae aan nemenem? Oaw iura pwe i oatowowuw mwuniaan pwe iga Beelzebul efang ngaeniaei maemaewaei. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Ngaere igine e ieei wunuunun aaei asiiur noa, iwe nge e ifa wusun aar rhooa kkomwu rhoaniuwaemi asiiur noa aniu aenneew? Rhooa kkomwu rhoaniuwaemi ra pwaeritae pwe oaw mwaerhei! <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Aapw, ngaang ina i oatowowuw aniu aenneew noan minna kkemenaen Deus, nge ieen minne a pwaeri noa pwe minna Mweoiun Deus a faer toorigaemi.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>“Igine erhai mwaaen mamaaw, a fasiun oamoannatae oanongaen niman, nge e posuw iimw na imwan, ina nge oanongan noa pisaegin nge epwe gofaeg rhag. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Iwe ngaere igine erhai mwaaen e mamaaw saengi a itto fiiow ngaeni nge a niiy, ina nge epwene pwigi noa oanongaen minikkewe niman ikkiwe mwaaen we a aeisetip wooan nge a noa inetiy fetaeneei meeta kkewe e mwoarhow.<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>“Erhai ne ese tapweaei, nge iiy rhooa aenneew ngaeniaei, nge erhai ese tipaengiaei reen ioi, iiy erhai rhooan oammwoatoar.<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sefaaeneton Aniu Aenneew</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>“Igine erhai aniu aenneew epwe toowow me wooan erhai aeremas, nge ina epwene faaeraeg fetaen wooan faniuw paenekka pwe egiut nenien aan aseoseo. Ngaere esooar eew neniy e rhuungi, nge ina epwene aengaeni oanongan pwe, ‘Ipwene sefaaen noa reen imwaei iwe i siusaengi.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Iwe a sefaaen nge a noa rhuungi iimw we pwe a nimegacch noa noan pwe oanongaen aegiaeg nge a wonopaeg noa nenien. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Iwe epwe noa nge a noa paeniir to fiusiuman aniu aenneew kena re igin kkaein aar aenneew saengi, nge ra itto no pwiuneoi we. Iwe igiwe a moann oanongan noa, nge wunuunun aeremas we a faer igin aenneew saengi mmwaen miniwe rhaepetaen.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ennetaen Kker</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Oatowe Jesus e aepesa minikkeei, erhai rhooapwut eno noan pwuwa we a kkepas tae nge a iura pwe, “Ifa mwo nepaen mwamwaaiun tipan rhooapwut na e timenewaeginiug me e attiug!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Iwe Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Epwe faer ifa mwo mwamwaaiun tipeer rhooakkena re rongorong minna oanoon Deus nge re aesirowu!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Re Tittingoar Eew Kkeman</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Oatowe aeremas kkewe ra itto roangei noa Jesus, a kkepas nge e iura pwe, “A ifa mwo aenneeweer aeremesaen mweoi e igina! Re tittingoar eew kkeman, nge esooar eew kkeman ne epwe pwae ngaeniir pwe aeggaen kkeman we rhag Deus efeeori ngaeni Jonah. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Epwe weei rhag wunuunun aaen <char style="tl">profeta</char> Jonah eno pwe eew aeginn ngaeniir re Nineveh, nge mwaaen na Naiun Aeremas epwene no pwe eew aeginn ngaeniir aeremesaen mweoi e igina. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Noan Raaenin Apwiung nge Queen reen Sheba epwe iutae nge a oamonofiti aeremesaen mweoi e igina, pwe iiy a itto saengi faniuwaen taaw noa pwe epwe itto aiussaening ngaeni aaen <char style="tl">king</char> Solomon kkepesaen reepiy; nge ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe erhai e taegias saengi Solomon eno igeei! <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Noan Raaenin Apwiung re Nineveh repwe iutae nge ra oamonofiti aeremesaen mweoi e igina, pwe iga iir re toagun saengi monofitiir oatowe re rongorong fenai kkewe aaen Jonah; nge ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe erhai e taegias saengi Jonah eno igeei!<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minna Seremaen Oanong</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6.22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>“Esooar erhai epwe figi eew oappwun nge a oapanoa ngaere iseni nong faaen saepiy; pwe ina epwe faer iseni tae wooan nenien oappwun, pwe aeremas repwe weri sereman igine repwe toonong. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Minikkena mesoamw ikkina eweei pwe oappwunon oanongoamw. Igine epwe ffat mesoamw, ina nge minna oanongoamw epwe seram; nge igine ese ffat mesoamw, ina nge minna oanongoamw epwe rorhappiung. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Iseni tipoamw pwe seram na nee tipoamw ete no pwe rorhappiung. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Ngaere igine oanongoamw e seram, nge esooar mwo egius me reen ne eno noan rorhappiung, ina nge oanongoamw epwe seram taeppen rhag aaen eew oappwun aesseremoag.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Pwaeritae Tereer Pharisee me Sinsein Anniug Kkewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mark 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Iwe oatowe Jesus enoa moannon kkepas, erhai Pharisee a aerigirig iiy pwe epwe noa mwongo reen; iwe a noa mooat tiw reen pwe ra mwongo. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Pharisee we e riutae oatowe eweri Jesus pwe ese nniuwa paiun weni mmwaen aan epwe mwongo. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Iwe Soamwoon a aengaeni pwe, “Iwe igina, aaemi Pharisee oawgaen nniuwa niugiun aaemi kkap me saepiy, nge nee tipaemi e sseogiun rhegoaw me feoffeeor aenneew. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Oawpwurh! Saapw Deus minne efeeori minna niugiun me pwan minna noan? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Oawfang ngaeniir rhooa affayeo oawton kkap me saepiy kena aaemi, ina nge oanongan aegiaeg epwe nim me reemi.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>“Ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi aaemi Pharisee! Oaw ngaenneei Deus eew me reen giniginin seig me reen <char style="tl">mint</char> me <char style="tl">dill</char> me <char style="tl">cumin</char> me oanongaen waningas, iwe nge oaw oatoranoa ikkina efin me aaemi ffayeo ngaeni Deus. Ikkeei anniug kka oawpwe pomwoni, nge oawsoapw nigiti noa ikkina aekkaew.<verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>“Ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi aaemi Pharisee! Oaw aerhaengi rhag oawpwe mooat wooan neniy kkena nenieer rhooa taegias me noan wutteer Jews, nge re aerhaengi aar aeremas repwe aewenimmwaar me aesirowuur me noan imwaen chuwaai. <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi! Oawwa weei paeyi kkewe esooar aeginn wooan ikkiwe aeremas re faaeraeg fetaen wooan nge rese giuneei.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Iwe nge erhai me neeiir sinsein anniug kkewe a aengaeni pwe, “Sinsei, wopwan igin aessaewaegemaem reen meeta kkomwu wo iura!”<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Epwe pwan ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi aaemi sinsein anniug kena! Pwe oawwa iseis tae mini cchoaw wooar aeremas, nge aaemi mwo nge oawse aeitiwow egatt aiuttiumi pwe oawpwe tipaengiir. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi! Oawfeeori paeyieer rhooawe <char style="tl">profeta</char> pwe epwe gacch, pwe ina iir rhooa kkewe rhaepeto kkewe aaemi reniiy maaer noa. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Aaemi wooan oanongaemi oawwa aepwaeri noa pwe oaw tipieew ngaeni meeta kkewe rhaepeto kkewe aaemi refeeori; reniiy maaer noa <char style="tl">profeta</char> kkewe, nge aaemi oawwa feeori paeyieer. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Iwe reen minneei nge minna Repiaen Deus e iura pwe, ‘Ipwe fangetiw <char style="tl">profeta</char> me rhooan akkiuneo reer; nge iir repwe niiy maaer noa aekkaaemweoi nge re aewwaeiraesiir aekkaaemweoi.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Iwe aeremesaen faaen mweoiu repwene aegaeregaer pwe faan ngaeniir <char style="tl">profeta</char> kkewe reniiy maaer noa saengi oatowe ffeeor taen faeinaengiy, <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>saengi oatowe reniiy maei noa Abel noa ngaeni oatowe reniiy maei noa Zechariah, iwe reniiy tiw me nepetaen antar me Pwiuneoi we epin. Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe aeremesaen faaen mweoiu nge repwe aegaeregaer pwe faan ngaeniir <char style="tl">profeta</char> kkewe reniiy maaer noa.<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>“Ifa mwo aenneewan ngaenigaemi aaemi sinsein anniug! Oaw ammwarhiu <char style="tl">key</char> we epwe sugi ngaeni asam we aesemaen reepiy; aaemi mwo nge oawsoapw pwan toonong, nge oawpwan aiugiiur iyo kena repwe mwerhaen toonong!”<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Oatowe Jesus a siusaengi pwiuneoi we, nge sinsein anniug kkewe me <char style="tl">Pharisee</char> kkewe ra rhaep aar aepesa aenneewa nge re kkepas aeiyeg ngaeni reen mesemesaen aegiaeg, <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>minni pwe repwe oatupwu pwe repwe pipiiy ngaere epwe rugunoa aan kkepas.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Eew Atapeonneog Reen Riugiuriug</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mat 10.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Iga sengeras aeremas repwe pwuwa fengaen, nge ra pwuu tae rhag wooan pirheen erhai, Jesus a aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Oaw aefaennigaemi reen <char style="tl">yeast</char> kkewe aar <char style="tl">Pharisees</char> — wewen minneei nge aar riugiuriug. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Oanongaen meeta na epwe mwoan nge epwe pwaetae, nge oanongaen meeta ewop nge epwene pwae noa. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Iwe ina ese tiwegin minne oaw aepesa me ne roorh nge ina epwene rong noa noan seram, nge ese tiwegin minne oawpwe ngiuniungiuniuw me nee iimw nge ina aeremas repwene aekkepwas aegini fetaeneei me wooan wungaen iimw.<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyo na Sipwe Mesagiu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>“Ipwe aengaenigaemi, weni maereyaerei, oawsoapw mesagiiur rhooamwu regaen niiy noa oanongaemi, pwe epwe noa weni mwirin nge esooar no eew min aenneew ne repwe rhiuwen mmwenen feeori. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Ipwene pwaeri ngaenigaemi iyo na oawpwe mesagiu: oawpwe mesagiu Deus, pwe iiy minne eyor maemaewan pwe epwe oatoragaemi nong noan nifierno weni mwirin aan niiy gaemi noa. Niugiuniug ngaeniaei, pwe iiy minne oawpwe mesagiu!<verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>“Pwe meeta, saapw riiufai checcha nge paniuwaenin nimman nicchok? Iwe nge esooar mwo erhai neeiir ne Deus e maniuwegi noa. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Oanongaen aennirhimwemi mwo nge Deus e paengi. Ina oawsoapw mesag, pwe aaemi ina eyor ipitaemi memmweer towunepeer nicchok!<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pwuwafaai me Oasoarhoawuna Kristus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mat 10.32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12.32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10.19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>“Ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe ese tiwegin iyo kkena re aepesa pwe iir naeyi me neeiir aeremas, nge epwe pwan ina wunuunun aaen mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas epwe feeori ngaeniir me weni mmweer angkenus kkena naiun Deus. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Nge iyo kena resaep saengiaei me neeiir aeremas, nge epwe pwan ina wunuunun aaen mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas feeori ngaeniir me weni mmweer angkenus kkena naiun Deus.<verse eid="LUK 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>“Ese tiwegin iyo na e kkepas aenneewa mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas nge epwe mmwenen mwusunoa; nge iyo na e kkepas aenneewa Espritu Santus esoapw mmwenen saenetaeg.<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>“Igine repwe pwigiug noa pwe wopwe noa apwiung noan wutteer Jews aere weni mmweer <char style="tl">governor</char> ngaere soamwoonin faniuw, nge oawsoapw pireiir reen wunuunun meeta kena oawpwe feeori me aepesa. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Espritu Santus epwe kapwiungiu ngaenigaemi meeta kena oawpwe aepesa.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioangon Awewen Erhai Mwaaen Naiwiis we Epwurh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Erhai mwaaen me noan pwuwa we a aengaeni Jesus pwe, “Sinsei, aengaeni maan na pwiiy pwe epwe aemegena woamaem minikkena pisaegimaem ina mwaaen na semmaem e nigiti ngaenigemaem.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Maereyaerei, iyo efang ngaeniaei maemaewaei pwe ipwe aettiwegini ngaere ipwe aemegena pisaeg kena woami?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>A aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw neogiuw tipaemi nge oaw aefaennigaemi reen mesemesaen rhegoaw, pwe wenewenen oamw menaw ina ese ffeeorto me reen minikkena oamw, inamwo ifa nepaen oamw naiwiis.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Iwe nge Jesus a aeni ngaeniir fioangon awewe een: “Eno erhai mwaaen ne e naiwiis nge e towunap uwaen mwongoon minikkena pwugusan. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>A niunniuwaennei nong rhag wooan oanongan; ‘Esooar no iga ipwe iseni noa e uwaen minikka fetaen ee. Meeta ipwe feeori?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>A aepesa pwe, ‘Ieen minne ipwene feeori. Ipwene fereei tiw soko e aaei nge iya feeori sefaaeniy aekkaew min tettemoag, pwe ipwene iseni oanongaen uwaen minikka fetaen me minikka pisaegiy noan. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Nge ina ipwene gaen iura pwe, mwaaen wenepwu! A yo ngaeniug oanongaen minikkewe e mwamwaai pwe ammwenemw reen fitowu mwo raeg. Wonoa amaniuwa noa, wopwe mwongo, iun, nge wo apwapwa fetaen.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Nge Deus a aengaeni pwe, ‘Wopwurh! Noan pwongin eei rhag nge wopwene fangetae oamw nngas; iwe nge iyo na epwene pwigi oanongaen minikka wa iseni rhag pwe ammwenemw?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>Jesus a soapwei noa, “Egaen ieei wusun minne egaen wen ngaeniir rhooakka regaen oacchongatae rhag naiwiiseer, nge rese naiwiis faaen mesaen Deus.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Niugiuniug Ngaeni Deus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Iwe ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe oawsoapw aiunaeng reen mwongo kkomwu oawpwe menaw reen, ngaere reen mengaagiun oanongaemi. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Menaw ina e igin yor rhaengin mmwaen mwongo, nge oanong ina eyor rhaengin me mmwaen mengaag. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Pipiir mwiiy kenaan: rese foat faiun waniwan ngaere gin uwaen waniwan; esooar aar soko; nge Deus e oamwongoor! Aaemi e igin yor ipitaemi memmweer man aeniaen! <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Eyor neeimi epwe mmwenen enaenaei noa egius menewan reen aan aiunaeng?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aere: Eyor erhai me neeimi ne epwe mmwen aenaenaeinoa egius taegiasan oanongan reen aan aiunaeng? </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Ngaere igine ese mmwen ngaenigaemi minikka e paerhigerhig, pwan minin meeta aaemi pireiir reen ikka aekkaew? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>Pipiiy wunuunun aaen peeon waniwan menawtae: rese engaang nge rese pwan ffeeor mengaagiiur. Nge ngaang ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe igiwe mwo <char style="tl">king</char> Solomon e menaw iwe erhai man ssow wiinan nge esooar mengaagiun ne enning noa me mmwaen peeon waniwan kaan. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Pwe Deus minne aememmengaagiur fetinen neeiin waniwan — fetin kka eyor igina, nge resoapw nonoa naiu, pwe ra figaeg noa newumw. Pwe meeta, Deus esoapw mmwenen aememmengaagiugaemi? Me gaen mwittiginen aaemi niugiuniug!<verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>“Iwe oawsoapw igin aenneewa tipaemi, oawsoapw tip mwaramwar reen meeta kena oawpwe mwongo me iun. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>(Pwe re Gentiles me noan faeinaengiy nge retip mwaramwar reen oanongaen minikka.) Minna na Semaemi e giuneei pwe oawpwe ammweneni minikkeei. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Nge ina rhag, oawpwe pwan giutta minna Mweoiun Deus, nge ina nge iiy epwe fang ngaenigaemi meeta kenaan.<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wenepwu Kena Wooai Naaeng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>“Oawsoapw mesag, aaemi ikkina fitiman, pwe minna Semaemi ina e mwamwaai tipan epwe ngaennegaemi minna Mweoiun. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Chuwaiuw noa oanongaen pisaegimi nge oawfang senaapian ngaeniir rhooa mwaenene. Oaw pweipwog aaemi pwetoaw kkewe ese mmwenen ffeir, nge oawwa iseis nong wenepwuwaemi me wooai naaeng noan, ina esoapw mmwenen gitigit tiw pwe esooar maan mwoarho ne epwe mwoarhow, nge esooar manepwur ne epwe mmwenen fereei. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Pwe pwunnomi epwe no rhag iga wenepwuwaemi eno ee.<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rhooan Akkiuneo Kkewe re Anneogiuneog</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>“Oawpwe neogiuw tipaemi reen minikka epwe ikkitto, oawwa pwigi aaemi oappwun nge oawwa figi, <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>pwe epwe weer rhag rhooan akkiuneo kkewe re wewweti maasta we aar aan epwe sefaaen to me reen gupwunon appwiuniupai we. Oatona epwe noa sefaaen nge epwe apiungiupiung rhag asam we, nge ra sugi. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Ifa mwo aar kker rhooan akkiuneo kka maasta we aar epwe noa itto nge e rhuungiir pwe re rhiuwen mmas pwe re wewweti noa rhag! Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe maasta we epwe noa itto nge a pwiniti mengaagiun, a amooattiweer, nge iiy minne epwene ffeeor ngaeniir aeneer. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Ifa mwo aar kker igine maasta we e itto rhuungiir nge re oamoannatae, inamwo igine enoa itto nugaenipwoong ngaere weni mmwaei raaen! <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Nge oawpwe metaf pwe ngaere soaw iimw we e giuneei oaton aaen maan mwoarho we epwe itto, iwe nge iiy esoapw fang ngaeni rhooa mwoarho we epwe fereeinong iimw we imwan. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Nge pwan aaemi nge oawpwan oamoannatae, pwe mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas epwe noa itto reen eew oat ina aaemi oawsoapw tapeonneog reen.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rhooan Akkiuneo we e Wenewen me Iwe Ese Wenewen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24.45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Peter a iura pwe, “Soamwoon, nge aemaem rhag minne wo niuwaennei ngaenigemaem fioangon awewe een, ngaere oanongeer aeremas?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Soamwoon a iura pwe, “Ina nge iyo rhooan akkiuneo na e wenewen nge e reepiy? Iiy minne maasta we a fang ngaeni pwe epwe nemaeniir rhooan akkiuneo kkewe nge e ngaenneer mwongo noan oaton efin. <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Ifa mwo wenepwuwaen rhooan akkiuneo we, aere maasta we aan e itto giuneei aan feeori minikkeei igiwe ewar! <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe maasta we epwe ngaenneei rhooan akkiuneo we pwe epwe nemaeni oanongaen minikkewe pisaegin. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Nge ngaere igine rhooan akkiuneo we e niuwaennei pwe maasta we aan epwe mmwaei aan sefaaeneto, nge a rhaepetae aan wirhiir rhooan akkiuneo kkewe rhinan, mwaaen fengaen me rhooapwut, nge e mwongo nge e iun e pwunaas noa, <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>ina nge maasta we epwe sefaaeneto noan raaenin we rhooan akkiuneo we ese niuwaennei, me eew oaton esoapw giuneei. Iwe maasta we epwene fena kititiw nge efang noa neeiir rhooawe rhooa misimis.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>“Rhooan akkiuneo na e giuneei minna maasta we aan e mwerhaen pwe epwe feeori, nge ese oamoannatae pwe epwe feeori, ina nge epwe igin temoag aegaeregaer na repwe feeori ngaeni. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Iwe nge rhooan akkiuneo na ese giuneei minna maasta na aan e tipaeni, nge efaer feeori minne epwe woawwoaw reen, ina nge epwe ppaen woawwoaw na repwe fang ngaeni. Aere Deus efang towunepaen aegiaeg ngaeni erhai aeremas, ina nge aeremas we a pwan igin towunap noa meeta epwe feeori, ina nge Deus a pwan igin towunap meeta epwe aeiineow.<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus Minne e Pwigito Aengimaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>“Iya itto ipwe ffooanaetae eew aengaet wooan faeinaengiy, nge e ifa mwo aaei aeniaen ngaere a fasiun giu! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Eyor eew paptismus ipwe paptismus reen, nge e ifa mwo nepaen waeiraes noan tipaei igina toori aan epwe moanno noa! <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Oaw niuwaennei pwe i itto pwe ipwe pwigito oapoas noan faeinaengiy? Aapw, saapw oapoas, pwe aeyimweoi. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Saengi igina a noa eew iimw ne re nimman aeremesaen ina repwene aeyimweoi, eoniurhai repwene aengimaaw ngaeniir ikkina riiurhai nge riiurhai repwene aengimaaw ngaeniir ikkina eoniurhai. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Semeer repwene aengimaaw ngaeniir mwaaen kkena naiiur, nge mwaaen kkena naiiur repwene aengimaaw ngaeniir mwaaen kkena semeer; iin repwene aengimaaw ngaeniir naiiur rhooapwut nge naiiur rhooapwut repwene aengimaaw ngaeniir ineer; inaen pwiuniuweer repwene aengimaaw ngaeniir pwiuniuwaen naiiur nge pwiuniuwaen naiiur repwene aengimaaw ngaeniir inaen pwiuniuweer.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Metefaaeginin Faei Oat Kkeei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Jesus a pwan aengaeniir aeremas kkewe pwe, “Oate oawweri eew toapw e ittae me netow, oawwa iura rhag pwe epwe piung worhow — iwe a piung. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Nge oawpwe meyaefi aaen aaeng peopeoto me eor, nge oawwa iura pwe epwene pwerhikkar — ina nge epwene pwerhikkar. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Maan oatupwutupw! Oawmmwenen woo ngaeni faeinaeng me noan naaeng nge oawwa mmwenen iura wunuunun mesaei raaen; ina nge meeta faan oawse giuneei mmwenen minikka ewen oatokkeei reen?<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oapoasson Nee Finarh me Rhooan Kkoapwutorh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5.25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>“Meeta ese mmwen ngaenigaemi pwe aaemi rhag oawpwe aettiwegini minne efin oawpwe feeori reen? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Ngaere erhai e pwigiug noa noan nenien apwiung pwe wopwe apwiung, een wopwe oarhorho wopwe oapoassa nepetaemi weni mmwaen wopwe gona nenien apwiung. Ngaere wose feeori ina nge een wopwene noa weni mmwaen soaw apwiung nge iiy a aefengoag noa nee paiiur <char style="tl">police</char>, nge iir ra noa kanepwusoag noa. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Ipwe aengaeniug pwe iginaan iga wopwe noa no e toori oamw piungtiw oanongaen paniuwaen monofitimw.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Toagun Saengi Monofitimi pwe Oawte Mae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Noan eew oat aekkaerhai aeremas re fioangei ngaeni Jesus mmweneer re Galilee kkewe Pilate eniir noa reen oatowe refang aar maenigaech ngaeni Deus. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Reen iga e ina wusun aar mae noa iir re Galilee kkena, nge aaemi oaw niuwaennei pwe remae pwe ekkaein monofitiir memmweer oanongeer noa re Galilee kaan? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Aapw saapw ina! Ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe ngaere igine oawse toagun saengi monofitimi, nge aaemi oawpwe pwan maegin mae noa. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Nge aeremas kkewe seig me waniman ikkiwe remae noa oatowe e ppiungiutiw iimw taegias we Siloam wooar? Oaw niuwaennei pwe remae pwe ekkaein monofitiir memmweer oanongeer aeremas kena reno noan Jerusalem? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Aapw saapw ina! Ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe ngaere igine oawse toagun saengi monofitimi, nge aaemi oawpwe pwan maegin mae noa.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioang Awewen Eew <char style="tl">Fig</char> Iwe Ese Uwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeniir fioangon awewe een: “Eno erhai mwaaen ne e menaw tae eew <char style="tl">fig</char> me noan menaai na aan. Egiut uwaen <char style="tl">fig</char> we nge esooar minne e rhuungi. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Iwe a aengaeni rhooan menaai we naiun pwe, ‘Een pipiiy, a enuuw raeg aaei itto giut uwaan <char style="tl">fig</char> eei, nge esooar minne i rhuungi me wooan. Een gopiy tiw! Meeta ipitaen aan itto foat wooan ppweon eei?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Nge rhooan engaengaen menaai we a aengaeni pwe, ‘Soawumwaer, nigiti mwo reen eew raeg pwe ipwe genengi pwaeniaeniy fetaeneei mwo nge iya iseis nong koyasiun. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Nge ngaere enoa raeg iiy nge a yor uwaan ina nge a mwamwaai; ngaere esooar, ina nge wonaaen gopiy tiw.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aecchipwa Aaen Semwaai Erhai Rhooapwut Wooan Sabbath</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Wooan Sabbath nge Jesus a fenai noan eew wutteer Jews. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Erhai rhooapwuton pwiuneoi we a seig me wanuuw raeg aan semwaai pwe eno erhai aniu aenneew wooan; eppwoar sagiuriun nge ese mmwenen iutae. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Oatowe Jesus enoa weri nge a faingiwow, “Rhooapwut mwuun, wopwene saenetaeg me reen oamw semwaai!” <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>A iseni tae paiun wooan niewe, nge noan oaton we rhag nge a uwen tae nge a aepingepinga Deus.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Soamwoonin wutteer Jews we a soong wooan Jesus pwe igiwe e aecchipwa rhooapwut we wooan Sabbath, a kkepas tae nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Wonowu raaen raaenin aarh sipwe engaang; iwe ina epwe noa itto raaen kenaan nge oawwa itto aecchipwaar rhooa semwaai, nge saapw wooan Sabbath!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Soamwoon a paniuwaeni pwe, “Maan oatupwutupw! Aaemi oawmmwenen pwaeisi naimi wakke ngaere <char style="tl">donkey</char> me noan gurur nge oawwa paeniir noa oawpwe noa aiuniiur rhan wooan Sabbath. <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Igina ina eno erhai rhooan aeinang we aaen Abraham ina a seig me wanuuw raeg aaen Saetan geoni; sisoapw saeneti nieen wooan Sabbath?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Aessefaaenin kkepas we aan a aessaewaar noa rhooa kkewe rhooan kkoapwuton, nge aeremas towunap ra faer igin pwapwa reen oanongaen min mwamwaai kkewe efeeori.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioang Awewen Faiun <char style="tl">Mustard</char> we</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mark 4.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Jesus a aeiyeg pwe, “E ifa wusun minna Mweoiun Deus? Meeta minne ipwe awewe ngaeni? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>E ieen wusun. Erhai mwaaen a pwigi efai faiun <char style="tl">mustard</char> nge a noa foatogi noan menaai we aan. A pwaech miniwe faiun nge a temoag noa pwe efoarh waniwan, nge man aeniaen ra itto ffeeor feseer wooan raaen.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioang Awewen Eew <char style="tl">Yeast</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13.33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Jesus a pwan aeiineo, “Meeta minne ipwe awewe ngaeni minna Mweoiun Deus? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>E ieen wusun. Erhai rhooapwut e pwigi egius <char style="tl">yeast</char> nge a nofiti fengaenniy me enuuw pwaecchin fenoawa emas toori aan pwo tae fenoawa we.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Asam we e Rheogit</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7.13-14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Jesus a toonong noan aepinoamw kkewe me pwugos kkewe, nge a fenai fetaen aeremas igiwe e nennoa ngaeni Jerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Erhai a aeiineow pwe, “Soawumwaer mwuun, aekkaerhai rhag minne repwe menaw?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>“Oarhorho pwe wopwe faer nong noan asam na e rheogit; pwe iga re towunap aeremas repwe aeginaar nong nge resoapw takkenong. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Miniwe soamwoonin iimw we epwene iutae nge a ttiy noa asam we; iwe oawpwene iu nasam pwe oawpwene apiungiupiung nong wooan asam nge oawwa iura pwe, ‘Soawumwaer, sugi mwo asam!’ nge iiy epwe paniuwaeni gaemi pwe, ‘Ise giuneei igine aaemi oaw itto me ee!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Nge aaemi oawpwene paniuwaeni pwe, ‘Aemaem aei mwongo me iun me reemw; een wo fenaiuw noan miniwe aepinoamwomaem!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>Nge iiy epwene pwan iura sefaaeniy pwe, ‘Ngaang ise giuneei igine aaemi oaw itto me ee. Oawsiu noa me oaroi, oanongaemi rhooa wegitaeg aenneew!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>Ifa mwo aaemi pwe sessaeng me akkaarengi, igine oawpwene weriir Abraham, Isaac, Jacob, me oanongeer <char style="tl">profeta</char> kkewe me noan miniwe Mweoiun Deus, nge aaemi oawwa faer aekkaerh noa! <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Aeremas repwene maegeto me eotiw me netow, eor me efaeng, iwe ra itto mooat tiw noan gupwunnap na noan Mweoiun Deus. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Iwe aaemweoi re amwirimwir repwene gommw, nge aaemweoi regommw repwene amwirimwir.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aaen Jesus Aerhaengerhaeng Ngaeni Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Noan oatowe rhag nge aekkaaemweoi <char style="tl">Pharisee</char> ra itto reen Jesus ra aengaeni pwe, “Wopwene siu me igeei wa noa eew pwiuneoi, pwe Erotes a mwerhaen epwene niug noa.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Oawnoa oawwa noa aengaeni maan oatupwutupw na pwe: ‘Ipwe oatowowuw mwuniaan nge i arhiuwa aar semwaai aeremas igina me naiu, nge wooan ayeoniuraenin raaen nge a moann aaei engaang.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Inamwo nge ngaang ipwene noa raaeneei, naiu, me raaennenaan; pwe ese ffin pwe erhai <char style="tl">profeta</char> epwe noa mae me eew pwiuneoi pwe noan rhag Jerusalem.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>“Jerusalem, Jerusalem! Wa niir noa <char style="tl">profeta</char> kkewe, nge wo teraar rhooan pweipwogin kkepas kkewe Deus efangeto reemw! A faaen fiteig aaei mwerhaen pwe ipwe ioni fengaenniy noawumw aeremas, taeppen maniug a ioni fengaenniy naiun faaen paiun, nge een wose mwerhaen pwe ipwe feeori! <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Iwe <char style="tl">Temple</char> we oamw ina aeremas repwe siusaengi iwe peonoa. Ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe aaemi oawsoapw weriaei no toori oatona oawpwe iura pwe, ‘Deus epwe aewenepwuwa aeremas na epwe itto faaen itaen Soamwoon.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aecchipwa Aaen Erhai Mwaaen Semwaai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Eew Sabbath Jesus enoa epwe noa mwongo reen imwaen erhai soamwoonin <char style="tl">Pharisee</char>; nge aeremas regaen igin pipiiy firhiy. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Erhai mwaaen epwo pirheen me paiun a noa itto reen Jesus, <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>iwe nge Jesus a kepastae nge a aengaeniir sinsein anniug kkewe me <char style="tl">Pharisees</char> kkewe pwe, “Meeta Anniug we aarh e iura sipwe aecchipwaar aeremas wooan Sabbath ngaere aapw?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Nge iir rese paniuwaeni. Iwe Jesus a paeni mwaaen we, a aecchipwa, nge a aengaeni pwe epwene noa. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Iwe a aengaeniir rhooawe pwe, “Ngaere igine erhai me neeimi eyor naiun wonigaet ngaere wakke nge eppiung nong noan eew rhanniunim wooan Sabbath, oawsoapw taiuw mwetekkaeiwow inamwo raaenin Sabbath miniwe?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Nge erhai mwo me neeiir nge ese mmwen ngaeni epwe paniuwaeni.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mesoanosoan me Ttiumwiun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Jesus eweriir aaemweoi me neeiir waseona kkewe re fini pwiuneoi kkewe e igin mwamwaai pwe repwe mooat ee, iwe a fioangei ngaeniir fioangon awewe een. <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>“Igine erhai epwe aerigirig wopwe noa tapweei eew gupwunon appwiuniupai, wosoapw noa mooat pwiuneoi na e oarosaen mwamwaai. Pwe ina maeni epwe yor erhai ina eyor ipitan me mmwoamw ina epwe noa itto, <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>nge iyo we e faingigaemi epwe noa itto nge epwene aengaeniug pwe, ‘Merenoa pwe mwaaen een epwe mooat igina.’ Iwe ina een wopwene saew nge wopwene noa mooat tiw pwiuneoi na e oarosaen sessoan. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Ieen minne oawpwe feeori, igine repwe aerigirig, wopwe noa wa noa mooat igina oarosaen sessoan ee, ina nge iyo we e faingiug epwe noa itto reemw nge epwene aengaeniug pwe, ‘Moawwerh maereyaerei, itto mooat iga e mwamwaai e.’ Ieen minne epwene aetaegisoag tae me neeiir aeremas kkena reno pwe een erhai aeremas eyor ipitoamw. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Pwe iyo na e aetaegiasa tae epwe sessoanotiw, nge iyo na epwe oasossonaetiw epwe taegias tae.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeni iyo we e faingito pwe, “Igine wopwe gaen ffeeor oamw mwongoon oanowas ngaere mwongoon faaef, wosoapw faingiir maereyaeremw ngaere pwiimw ngaere perhaengioamw ngaere iyo kkena aeremesaen weni oaromw igina re naiwiis — pwe ina repwe pwan faingi sefaaeniug pwe wopwe pwan noa tapweer reen gupwun pwe repwe paniuwaeni ngaeniug meeta we wofeeori ngaeniir. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Igine wopwe gaen ffeeor oamw gupwun, faingiir rhooakkena re mwaenene, rhooakkena e mwaetete oanongeer, rhooa mae pirheer, me rhooa parh; <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>ina nge wopwe wenepwu, pwe iga iir rese mmwen repwe paniuwaeni meeta we wofeeori ngaeniir. Deus epwe paniuwaeni oamw feoffeeor noan raaenin na oanongeer aeremas kena re mwamwaai repwene menaw tae me reen mae.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Awewen Gupwun Igin Temoag we</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Oatowe erhai me neeiir waseona kkewe remooat reen <char style="tl">table</char> we e rongorong minikkewe, nge a aengaeni Jesus pwe, “Ifa mwo aar kker rhooakka repwe tapweei gupwun na noan minna Mweoiun Deus!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Eno erhai mwaaen efeeori eew gupwun igin temoag nge e igin towunap aeremas kka e faingiir. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Igiwe a toori oaton gupwun we nge a fang noa erhai naiun rhooan akkiuneo epwe noa faingiir waseona kkewe, ‘Oaw itto pwe oanongaen meeta nge a oamoannatae!’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Iwe nge erhai me erhai neeiir a ffeeor fetaen mwarhneokkiur. Manewe egommw a aengaeni rhooan akkiuneo we pwe, ‘Ngaang iya chuwaiuw eew maat nge ipwe noa mwo sengaeri; faaen pirhemw nge isoapw mmwenen tapweog.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Nge iwe erhai a iura pwe, ‘Ngaang inaaen chuwaiur seig wakke nge iye ipwene noa aegina aaei aengaengaar; faaen pirhemw nge isoapw mmwenen tapweog.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Nge iwe erhai a iura pwe, ‘Ngaang iye inaaen appwiuniupai noa rhag, nge ina faaen minne isoapw mmwenen toowow reen.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>Iwe rhooan akkiuneo we a sefaaen nge a noa aengaeni maasta we aan oanongaen minikkewe re iura. Maasta we a igin soong nge a aengaeni rhooan akkiuneo we pwe, ‘Mwetekkaei wow wooan aan temoag kena me aan mwittig kkomwu ne aepinoamw, nge wa pwigiir to rhooa mwaenene, rhooa mwaetete oanongeer, rhooa parh, me rhooa pirhemae.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Ese mmwaei mwo nge rhooan akkiuneo we a itto iura pwe, ‘Iya moann aaei feeori meeta kkewe wo iura, nge e rhiuwen nenieer aeremas.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Iwe maasta we a aengaeni rhooan akkiuneo we naiun pwe, ‘Wonoa itiwow noan ennap me aan paecchig kena enoa niugiun aepinoamw pwe wopwe noa faingiir to aeremas, pwe epwe sseog noa noan iimw we imwaei. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe esooar erhai me neeiir rhooawe si mmwaen faingiir ne epwe nnaeri egius me reen mwongoon gupwun e aaei.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wunuunun Aaen Erhai Epwe No pwe Rhooan Kkayeo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10.37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Eew oat igiwe e igin towunap aeremas re tettapwei Jesus, a wegitaeg nge a aengaeniir pwe, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>“Iyo kka re itto reei resoapw mmwenen no pwe naeyi rhooan kkayeo igine rese aerhaengiaei noa memmweer semeer me ineer, rhooan ngaenneer me naiiur, pwiir me mwengeyeer, me iir wooan oanongeer. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Iyo kena rese aiufera aar kurus nge ra itto tapweaei resoapw mmwenen no pwe naeyi rhooan kkayeo. <verse eid="LUK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>Ngaere igine erhai me neeimi e niunniuwaennei pwe epwe feeori eew iimw taegias, mesaemmwaen minne wopwe feeori ina wopwe mooat tiw wa aeperha paniuwaen, pwe wopwe giuneei ngaere epwe toaw ngaeniug paniuwaen aan moann ngaeniug engaang na oamw. <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Ngaere wose feeori minneei, nge ina esoapw mmwenen moann ngaeniug iimw taegias eei mwirin oamw feeori noa poasopoason; nge oanongeer rhooakkena reweri meeta ewen repwene kekkaei aeginiug. <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>Nge repwene iura pwe, ‘A rhaepetae oamw kaiu nge ese mmwenen moann ngaeniug oamw engaang!’ <verse eid="LUK 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>Ngaere erhai <char style="tl">king</char> e pwigiir seig sengeras sonotaw repwe noa moawun ngaeni pwan erhai <char style="tl">king</char> e pwigiir riiuweig sengeras sonotaw, mesaemmwaen ina epwe mooat tiw a niunniuwaennei mwo ngaere epwe mmwenen niir rhooan peig na epeig. <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Ngaere esoapw mmwen, iwe epwene fangenoa naiun rhooan akkiuneo reen <char style="tl">king</char> na erhai iga e rhiuwen taaw pwe repwe feeori fengaenniy oapoas nepeteer. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Epwe ieei rhag wusun pwe esooar neeimi ne epwe mmwenen no pwe naeyi rhooan kkayeo igine ese oatoranoa oanongaen aegiaeg.”<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aesiig we Ese Saaet</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mark 9.50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>“Aesiig ina e mwamwaai, iwe ngaere esa saaet no, sisoapw mmwenen aesaaeti sefaaeniy. <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Ese gacch ngaeni ppweon ngaere koiyas; re aekkaerh noa. Iyo eyor saeningan, epwe rongorong!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s">
    <char style="tl">Sheep</char> we e Mwaenirh Noa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Eew raaen nge ra noa ssow to rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> me rhooa monofit ra itto aiussaening ngaeni Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Nge Pharisees me sinsein anniug kkewe a rhaepetae aar mwangiuniungiun pwe, “Mwaaeneei e aetiwaar rhooa monofit nge epwan mmwenen mwongo reer!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Jesus a aeni ngaeniir fioangon awewe we:<verse eid="LUK 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>“Aere igine erhai neeimi eyor epwiugiuw naiun <char style="tl">sheep</char> iwe nge erhai me neeiir e mwaenirh noa — meeta wopwene feeori? Wopwene nigitiir noa <char style="tl">sheep</char> kkewe tiweig me tiweman nge wa noa giutta fetaeneei manewe e mwaenirh noa ssiaaenin oamw noa rhuungi.<figure style="fig" alt=". . ." file="BK00005B.tif" size="span" loc=". . ." copy=". . ." ref="15.4"/> <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Igine wonoa rhuungi nge wopwene igin kker, nge wopwene ngaettae wooan eferoamw <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>nge wa pwigi noa nee iimw. Wopwene faingiir to weni maereyaeremw me rhooan no oaromw, wopwene aengaeniir pwe, ‘Iya igin kker pwe iya rhuungi <char style="tl">sheep</char> we naeyi iwe e mwaenirh noa. Sipwene oagupwuna!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Iwe, ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe epwe pwan igin temoag kkeren weei naaeng wooan erhai man monofit e toagun saengi monofitin mmweer rhooawe tiweig me tiweman ikkiwe rese toagun saengi monofitiir.<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faiun Senaapiy we Eppiung Noa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>“Aere igine eyor erhai rhooapwut eyor seig naiun faiun senaapiy nge efai eppiung noa — meeta niewe epwene feeori? Epwe figi eew oappwun, a peoni noan iimw we imwan, nge a aetemaeginiy aan giutta toori aan noa weri. <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Oatona epwe noa weri nge epwene faingiir maereyaeren me rhooakkena reno oaron nge epwene aengaeniir pwe, ‘Iya igin kker pwe iya weri faiun senaapiy we eppiung saengiaei. Sia oagupwuna.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Ipwe aengaenigaemi pwan ieen rhag taeppen aar kker angkenus kkewe naiun Deus igine erhai maan monofit a toagun saengi monofitin.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aetemwaaen we e Mwaenirh Noa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Jesus a soapwei noa nge a iura pwe, “Eyor erhai mwaaen reno riiurhai naiun aetemwaaen. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Aetewe egit a aengaeni pwe, ‘Semaei, ngoatto inetiiy me reen minikkomwu oamw.’ Iwe mwaaen we a giniiy minikkewe aan wooar aet riiurhai kkewe naiun. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Enoa mwirin fitowu raaen nge aetewe egit a chuwaiuw noa minikkewe aan nge a pwigi senaapian nge a siusaengi miniwe pwugusan. A noa wooan eew faniuw taaw noa, iwe a noa oasonopa noa senaapiy kkewe naiun reen wegitaeg kkewe e aenneew. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Iwe a noa oarosa noa senaapiy kkewe naiun. Nge enoa weni mwirin a noa itto eew naengeta ngaeni faniuw we, iwe a noa mwaenene noa aetewe. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Iwe a noa engaang ngaeni erhai aeremesaen faniuw we, aan engaang ina rhooan oamwongon sino. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Aetewe a gaen aeniaen pwe epwe mwongo minikkewe anan sino pwe igiwe esooar ne egaen ngaenneei anan. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Amwiucchiunoan igiwe aetemwaaen we enoa metaf noa wooan nge a iura pwe, ‘Oanongeer rhooan engaang kkewe naiun mwaaen we semaei nge e igin towunap aeneer nge ngaang iye ipwene oaropaen maen pecchai noa! <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Ipwene iutae igina nge ipwene noa reen mwaaen we semaei nge iya aengaeni pwe, “Semaei, iya monofit ngaeni Deus nge iya pwan monofit ngaeniug. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Esa ferhanno ipwe ffai pwe ngaang noawumw; aeffitaegiaei noa rhag me rhooan engaang kkena noawumw.” ’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Iwe a iutae a sefaaen noa reen mwaaen we seman.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Aetewe e rhiuwen taaw saengi iimw we imwan nge mwaaen we seman a weri; a igin ffaiyeow, iwe a fattapw ngaeni, a roamito aetewe naiun nge a faeisongei. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Nge aetewe a iura pwe, ‘Semaei, iya monofit ngaeni Deus nge iya pwan monofit ngaeniug. Isa ferhanno ipwe ffai pwe ngaang noawumw.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Nge faer mwaaen we seman a faingiir rhooan akkiuneo kkewe naiun, ‘Oaw mwetekkaei! Oawnoa pwigito mengaag na oarosaen mwamwaai oawpwe aememmengaagiu ngaeni. Nge oawwa iseni tae efai <char style="tl">ring</char> wooan aiuttiun nge oaw iseni tae nokkaan wooan pirheen. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Iwe nge oawwa noa oawpwe noa pwigito wakke na oarosaen soopwun oawwa itto niiy pwe oaw sipwene feeori eew gupwun faeregit pwe aan! <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Pwe aetewe naeyi iwe a mae, igina a menaw; e mwaenirh noa nge igina iya weri.’ Iwe ra feeori gupwun we aar.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>“Noan oatowe nge aetewe e tugufaeyi eno noan maat. Nge a noa sefaaeneto reen iimw we imweer nge a rongorong pwe ra pwai me wur. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>A faingi erhai rhooan akkiuneo kkewe a aeiineow pwe, ‘Meeta a wen?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Rhooan akkiuneo we a iura pwe, ‘Aet we pwiimw a sefaaeneto nee iimw, nge mwaaen we semoamw a aengaeniir repwe niiy noa wakke we oarosaen soopwun pwe igiwe enoa sefaaeneto nge esooar minne ewen ngaeni.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>Aet we e tugufaeyi a soong esa mwerhaen toonong no nee iimw; iwe mwaaen we seman a teeowow aeffaenipirhe ngaeni epwe toonong. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Nge iiy a appaniuwaeni mwaaen we seman, ‘Pipiiy, fiteig raeg aaei engaang ngaeniug taeppen aaen engaang erhai <char style="tl">slave</char>, nge esaaen yor mwo faaen eew ne i tipowwen ngaeniug. Nge meeta minne wo ngaenneaei? Erhai mwo <char style="tl">goat</char> nge wose ngaenneaei pwe aeipwe gupwun wooan me rhooakka maereyaerei! <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Nge aete noawumw iye e oasonopa noa senaapiaen minikkewe wofang ngaeni wooar rhooapwutoi chuwaai, nge enoa rhag itto nge wa niiy ngaeni wakke we oarosaen soopwun pwe aan mwongoon gupwun!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Mwaaen we seman a iura pwe, ‘Moawwerh naeyi, een wo nonno rhag oaroi, nge oanongaen minikka aaei nge eno pwe oamw. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Nge sipwe apwapwa pwe sa kker, pwe aetewe pwiimw iwe a mae nge igina a menaw sefaaen; e mwaenirh noa nge igina iya weri.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Soamwoonin Engaang we e Riugiuriug</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Jesus a aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Eno erhai mwaaen naiwiis eno erhai naiun rhooan akkiuneo e nemaeni minikkewe pisaegin. Ra aengaeni mwaaen we pwe rhooan akkiuneo we a oasonopa senaapiy kkewe naiun, <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>iwe a faingito a aengaeni pwe, ‘Meeta minne iya rongorong pwe fioangomw? Foatogitiw pwapwioron minikka pisaegiy, pwe iga een wosoapw nono pwe rhooan nemenemaen minikka aaei.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Rhooan akkiuneo we a kkepastiw rhag wooan nge a iura pwe, ‘Maasta e aaei epwene arhiuwaeyaei me reen engaang e aaei. Meeta ipwene feeori? Ngaang ise mamaaw pwe ipwe noa no pwe rhooan kkenin maat, iwe nge ngaang isaew pwe ipwe noa tingoar fetaen. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Iya giuneei meeta ipwene feeori! Oatona epwe noa sooar noa engaang e aaei, epwene yor maereyaerei ikka repwene aewenimmwaeyaei nong noan imweer.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>Iwe a faingiir nong rhooa kkewe eyor monofitiir ngaeni maasta we aan. A aeiineow iwe egommw pwe, ‘Fiteig monofitimw ngaeni maasta e aaei?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Mwaaen we a paniuwaeni pwe, ‘Epwiugiuw pwaerinaen tiikkaen <char style="tl">olive</char>.’ Rhooan akkiuneo we a iura pwe, ‘Ieen pwapwioron monofitimw; itto mooat tiw nge wa foatogi pwe nimeig.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>A pwan aeiineow iwe erhai pwe, ‘Nge een — fiteig monofitimw?’ Mwaaen we a paniuwaeni pwe, ‘Sengeras tutuun <char style="tl">wheat</char>.’ Nge a pwan aengaeni pwe, ‘Ieen pwapwioron monofitimw, foatogi pwe wanepwiugiuw.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Pwonno reen meeta we a feeori, maasta we a aepingepinga rhooan akkiuneo we naiun iwe e riugiuriug, pwe ieei faaen minne aeremesaen soanop re igin tipaecchem reen feeoriun minikka ammweneer wooan oanongeer memmweer rhooakkena reno noan seram.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Iwe Jesus a pwan iura pwe, “Ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe, oawgiut maereyaeremi nge oawpwe nainai meeta wiinaemi me soanop, pwe oawpwe noa mae noa nge repwe mmwenen aewenimmwoag nong noan iimw na esooar iaenin. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Iyo na e wenecchar menewan noan minikka e mwittig nge epwe pwan wenecchar menewan noan minikka e tettemoag; nge iyo na e oatupwutupw noan minikka e mwittig nge epwe pwan oatupwutupw noan ikka e tettemoag. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Pwe ngaere ese wenecchar menewoamw noan minikka pisaegin wooan soanop, nge epwe ifa wusun nge epwe niugiug reen pisaeg kka ennet? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Pwe ngaere ese wenecchar oamw engaang ngaeni pisaegin erhai, nge iyo epwe mwerhaen fang ngaeniug ikkina pisaegimw?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>“Esooar erhai rhooan akkiuneo epwe engaang ngaeniir riiurhai maasta. Ina epwe oapwuta erhai, nge aerhaengi iwe erhai, me ngaere epwe mwamwaai ngaeni erhai, nge a aenneew ngaeni erhai. Ese mmwen oawpwe engaangappag ngaeni Deus me senaapiy.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aekkaew Kkepas Kkewe Aaen Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mark 10.11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Igiwe Pharisees kkewe ra rongorong minneei ra aeni fetaeneei aegekkaei Jesus, pwe igiwe iir re aerhaengi senaapiy. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Aaemi rhooa kkewe regaen feeori mwamwaaiuw wunuunuur me noan meseer aeremas, nge Deus e giuneei noan tipaemi. Pwe minikka egaen yor ipitaen me noan tipeer aeremas nge esooar ipitan me noan tipaen Deus.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>“Oasoapwosoapw kkewe aaen Moses me ikkiwe foatogieer profeta kkewe e enoa toorito oaton John Baptist; mwirin a itto Kkepas Mwamwaai we reen Mweoiun Deus, iwe oanongeer aeremas ra aetietiy nong repwe toonong. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Iwe nge e mererhaeg egius aaen naaeng me soanop repwe nurh noa me mmwaen aeppaerhigin oasoapwosoapw kkeei epwe nurh noa.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>“Erhai mwaaen epwe mweoi saengi pwiuniuwan nge a noa pwiuniuwaeni erhai, nge iiy a feeori eew feoffeeor aenneew; nge erhai ne e pwiuniuwaeni erhai rhooapwut ne a siusaengi pwiuniuwan nge iiy a feeori monofit.<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaaen we e Naiwiis me Lazarus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>“Eno erhai mwaaen naiwiis e memmengaag rhag mengaag cchoaw paniuwan nge egin mwamwaai aan nonno oanongaen raaenin. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Epwan no erhai mwaaen affayeo itan Lazarus, erupw wooan oanongan, epwan gaen ikkitto reen aesemaen imwaen mwaaen naiwiis we, <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>egaen aeniaen pwe epwe mwongo peipeyin mwongo kena egaen ppiungtiw me wooan <char style="tl">table</char> we aaen mwaaen naiwiis we. Nge gonaag mwo nge re itto tumwuri minikkewe rupwun. <verse eid="LUK 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>Iwe mwaaen affayeo we a maenoa nge angkenus ra itto pwigi epwe noa mooat oaron Abraham me noan gupwun we weei naaeng. Iwe nge mwaaen naiwiis we a pwan mae ra noa nipwaeni, <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>nge noan nifierno wonowe a igin metaeg, a noa fattae a noa weri Abraham me itaaw noa, a noa weri Lazarus pwe eno oaron. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Wonowe a faingi, ‘Semaei Abraham, faayeowaei, wa fangenoa mwo Lazarus epwe rhiri aiuttiun noan eew rhaan pwe epwe itto aepetapeta minne rheon iiuwaei pwe ngaang iya igin metaeg noan aengaeteei!’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>Abraham a iura pwe, ‘Wo maengiy rhag naeyi, pwe noan oatowe wo menaw nge oanongaen mini mwamwaai nge itto reemw, nge Lazarus iwe oanongaen mini aenneew nge enoa reen. Igina iya no noan kker nge een wa no noan waeiraes. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Nge soapw pwan ina rhag, pwe eew niipw gin nennoan eno nepetarh, manekka re mwerhaen faaeraeg wow me igaan nge resoapw mmwenen toowow, nge iyo kena re mwerhaen faaeraegto me igina nge resoapw pwan mmwen.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Mwaaen naiwiis we a iura pwe, ‘Iya tingoar aeffaenipirhe ngaeniug semaei Abraham wopwe fangenoa Lazarus reen imwaen mwaaen we semaei, <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>igiwe reno rhooa nimman pwiiy ee. Aengaeni epwe noa a noa atapeonneogiiur pwe rete itto noan pwiuneoi e nenien waeiraes.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>Abraham a iura pwe, ‘Mwaaen kkewe pwiimw ra fasiun tapeonneog reen Moses me profeta kkewe; repwe aiussaening ngaeni meeta repwe iura.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Mwaaen naiwiis we a paniuwaeni pwe, ‘Ese nnaaf minna, semaei Abraham! Pwe ngaere erhai e menaw sefaaen tae me reen mae a noa reer nge repwe toagun saengi monofitiir.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Abraham a iura pwe, ‘Aere rese aiussaening ngaeniir Moses me profeta kkewe, nge iir resoapw niugiuniug, inamwo me igine erhai e menaw sefaaen tae me reen mae noa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s">Meeta Kka e Oamonofitiir Aeremas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18.6-7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mark 9.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Jesus a aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe pwe, “Minikka e feoffeeori pwe aeremas repwe monofit ina epwe wewwen rhag, nge ifa mwo aenneewan ngaeni aeremas na efeeori minikkeei pwe epwe wen! <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Efaer gacch ngaeni igine aere e geeogeeo tae efai fai temoag rhaepin iiuwan a aegekkaerh noa nee set me mmwaen aan feeori pwe erhai aet mwittig kaan epwe monofit. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Iwe oaw emwaeri meeta kkomwu oawgaen feeori!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Aere igine erhai pwiimw e monofit, soong ngaeni, aere e toagun saengi aan monofit, saeneti noa. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Aere igine e monofit ngaeniug faaen fisuuw noan eraaen, nge a gaen itto aengaeniug pwe, ‘ngaang iya toagun saengi monofitiy,’ wopwe pwan saeneti noa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Niugiuniug</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Oapostonus kkewe ra aengaeni Soamwoon pwe, “Oatomoga noa aemaem niugiuniug.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Soamwoon a paniuwaeni pwe, “Aere aaemi niugiuniug eweei nepaen faiun <char style="tl">mustard</char> een, emmwen oawpwe aengaeni waniwan temoag een pwe, ‘Wisaegtae me waeroamw wa noa foat noa nee set!’ ina epwe rongorong ngaeniug.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aaen Erhai Rhooan Akkiuneo Engaang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>“Aere erhai noawumw rhooan akkiuneo engaang fetaen noan maat aere e aefaenniy noawumw <char style="tl">sheep</char>, iwe nge enoa itto me noan maat, wopwe mmwenen aengaeni pwe aemwetekkaeiyiug pwe epwene mwongo? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Aapw aere! Wopwe faer aengaeni pwe, ‘Wonoa feeori aenaei mwongo, nge wa ngaettae mengaagiun oamw engaang nge wa itto ngoatto aenaei pwe ipwe mwongo nge i iun; inoa moann nge een wonaaen mwongo.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Rhooan akkiuneo we mwo nge wosoapw ngaenneei aan aerhigerhig pwe iga e tapweei oamw akkiuneo, aere meeta? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Epwan ina rhag wusumi; oatona oawpwe oamoanna meeta oawpwe feeori, nge oawwa iura pwe, ‘Aemaem rhag rhooan akkiuneo; aeifeeori rhag engaang kka aemaem.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aecchipwa Seig Mwaaen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Igiwe Jesus a nennoa ngaeni Jerusalem, e faaeraeg wooan ayiuweyiuwen nepetaen Samaria me Galilee. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Oatowe a toonong noan eew pwugos, a rhuungiir seig mwaaen kaenepaai. Re iu rhag me itaaw, <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>nge ra aekkepwas, “Jesus! Soamwoon! Faayeogemaem!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Jesus a weriir nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawnoa aengaeniir patere pwe repwe worigaemi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Igiwe ra feffaaeraeg noa nge a rhiuw noa minikkewe kaenepaiiur. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Oatowe erhai me neeiir a weri pwe a cchipw noa miniwe ginin, iwe a sefaaen, nge a gaen igin oatomogatae aan aepingepinga Deus. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>A itto aerheitiw oanongan reen pirheen Jesus a itto fang aan aerhigerhig. Mwaaen we nge erhai re Samaria. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Jesus a kkepas nge a iura pwe, “Nge aetae iwe seig rhooa kkewe e mwamwaai noa giniir; nge ifa ikkiwe tiweman? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Meeta faaen minne waseona een rhag minne e sefaaeneto pwe e itto fang aaen Deus aerhigerhig reen?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Nge Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Iutae wa noa; pwe oamw niugiuniug a aetekkoagtae.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Itton Minna Mweoiun Deus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24.23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Aekkaerhai Pharisees re aeiineow Jesus ineeta epwe itto minna Mweoiun Deus. Nge a paniuwaeni pwe, “Minna Mweoiun Deus ina esoapw itto nge noan taeppen we sipwe rhuungi. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Esooar ne epwe iura pwe, ‘Oaw pipiiy pwe ieei iiy!’ aere ‘Inaan iiy!’; pwe minna Mweoiun Deus ina a no neeimi.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Iwe aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Eyor oatokka oaw aeneaeneei pwe oawpwe weri eew minikkena raaenin mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas, nge oawsoapw weri. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Eyor manekka repwe aengaenigaemi pwe, ‘Fannoa iginaan!’ aere, ‘Fatto igaan!’ Nge aaemi oawsoapw toowow noa giutta fetaeneei. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Pwe igine epwene weriwer noan naaeng nge e aesserema noa noan naaeng, ina epwe pwan ina wusun mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas noan minna raaenin. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Nge mmwan, ina epwe igin affayeo me serhoawun me reer aeremesaen raaennekkeei. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Epwe pwan taeppen miniwe ewen mweoiun Noah, ina epwe pwan wen noan raaenin mini Naiun Aeremas. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Oanongeer aeremas re rhiuwen mwommwongo me kukkupwun, nge mwaaen me rhooapwut re pwiuppwiuniuw toori raaenin we Noah a teeotae rhiun pwoot we waan, iwe e itto rhag noataer we niir noa oanongeer. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Epwe pwan taeppen weni mweoiun Lot. Oanongeer aeremas nge re mwongo noa rhag me kkupwun noa rhag, nge re chuwaai fetaen, foato fetaen, me kaiu fetaen iimw. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Noan raaenin we Lot a nigiti Sodom, aengaet me <char style="tl">sulfur</char> a piungtiw me noan naaeng a ittiw niir noa oanongeer. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Epwe pwan ina wusun minne epwe wen noan raaenin na epwe pwaeto mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas.<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>“Noan raaenin naan nge iyo eno wooan wungaen iimw, esoapw teeotiw no nee iimw epwe pweipwog pisaegin; pwan ina rhag wusun iyo eno noan maat pwe esoapw pwan sefaaen noa nee iimw. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Oaw maengiy rhag niewe pwiuniuwaei Lot! <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Iyo na e mwerhaen epwe ammwarhiu menewan ina epwe ppiung saengi; nge iyo na eppiung saengi menewan, ina epwe menaw. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Ipwe aengaenigaemi, pwe noan pwongin naan riiurhai aeremas re maiur wooan eew pooa; erhai repwe pwigi noa nge erhai epwe notiw. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Riiurhai rhooapwut repwe ammaat mwongo; erhai repwe pwigi noa nge erhai epwe notiw. <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>[Igine riiurhai mwaaen repwe engaang noan maat nge erhai ra pwigi noa nge erhai a notiw.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Petenan eei nge e soano noan aekkaew petenan kka e foatofoat noan kkepesaen Greek.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Rhooan akkiuneo kkewe naiun ra aeiineow pwe, “Iya, Soamwoon?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Ese tiwegin igine epwe yor erhai manimae ee, nge witiyas repwe mweoiuto reen.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s">Fioang Awewen Erhai Rhooapwut Mae Pwiuniuwan me Erhai Soaw Kapwiung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Iwe Jesus a fioangei ngaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun eew fioangon awewe pwe repwe memmaeipin noa rhag oanongaen oat nge resoapw mwetekkaein fangetae. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>“Eno erhai soaw apwiung noan eew aepinoamw nge ese mesagiu Deus nge ese pwan aesirowuur aeremas. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Noan aepinoamw we nge epwan no erhai rhooapwut a mae pwiuniuwan, nge esooaw ikkitto rhag reen pwe epwe tipaengi nge a aengaeni pwe, ‘Tipaengiaei me reer rhooan appaniuwaen ngaeniaei.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>A ssiunaei aaen soaw apwiung we ese mwerhaen tipaengi rhooapwut we, nge enoa mwirin nge a maengiy nong rhag noan tipan pwe, ‘Inamwo ikka ise mesagiu Deus aere aesirowu aeremas, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>iwe nge iga rhooapwut een a soaw ikkitto rhag angiurhiuwaei, iwe ipwene feeori ngaeni meeta na e tipaeni. Ngaere ise feeori ngaeni nge ina epwe ikkitto rhag angiurhiuwaei toori aaei sipegin aerhigerhig noa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Iwe Soamwoon a pwan iura pwe, “Oaw aiussaening ngaeni meeta soaw apwiung aenneew we a iura. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Iwe Deus esoapw faer ppaeniir aeremas kkena a finiir iga ra sessaeng ngaeni rhag nee pwoong me nee raaen pwe epwe tipaengiir? Oaw niuwaennei nge epwe mmwaei aan tipaengiir? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe Deus epwe mwetekkaei aan oayoow ngaeniir minikkena iir re tipaeni. Iwe oaw niuwaennei pwe mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas epwe weri tiwegin me wooan soanop reen oatonoa epwe sefaaeneto?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioang Awewen Erhai Pharisee me Erhai Rhooan Iyoiyon <char style="tl">Tax</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Jesus a pwan fioangei awewe een ngaeniir aeremas kka re maengiy pwe iir regacch noa memmweer aaemweoi iwe nge oanongeer aeremas re sessoan tiw faer. <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>“Nonno noa wooar riiurhai mwaaen renoa noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we pwe repwe noa maeipin; erhai Pharisee nge erhai rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char>. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Pharisee we a noa imweoi noa pwe a maeipin nge a iura pwe, ‘Wa aerhigerhig Deus pwe ngaang ise rhegoaw, ise oatupwutupw, me maiur ngaeni pwiuniuwaen erhai, taeppeer aeremas kka aaemweoi. Wa aerhigerhig pwe ngaang ise taeppen rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> na eno iginaan. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Ngaang ise mwongo noan riiuraaen noan eew <char style="tl">week</char>, nge iya fang ngaeniug giniginin eew me reen seig me reen oanongan noa meeta paniuwaei.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>Nge rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> we e iu me itaaw noa nge ese mmwen mwo nge epwe fattae weei naaeng, a gaen tugutuguw ne aiungan nge a gaen iura pwe, ‘Deus, faayeowaei, ngaang erhai man monofit!’ ” <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Jesus a iura pwe, “Ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> naan nge saapw Pharisee naan minne enoa nee iimw nge e mwamwaai me noan sapweoiniun Deus. Pwe iyo na e aetaegiasa tae epwe sessoanotiw, nge iyo na epwe oasossonaetiw epwe taegias tae.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Maeipinaar Wonigaet Mwittig</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mark 10.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Aaemweoi aeremas re pwigito naiiur wonigaet mwittig pwe Jesus epwe iseni tae paiun wooar. Rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun ra weriir nge ra soong ngaeniir reen miniwe refeeori, <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>nge Jesus a faingiir aetekkewe nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Fangeto aetekkena reei, nge oawsoapw aiugiiur, pwe minna Mweoiun Deus ina aar aeremas kka reweer wonigaet. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe iyo na ese aetiwa Mweoiun Deus taeppen erhai wonigaet, nge esoapw toonong noan.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Erhai Mwaaen Naiwiis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mark 10.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Erhai soamwooniir Jews a aeiineow Jesus pwe, “Sinsei mwamwaai, meeta ipwe feeori nge epwe yo ngaeniaei menaw na esooar iaenin?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Meeta wo iura pwe i mwamwaai reen?” Esooar erhai ne e mwamwaai pwe aeggaen Deus rhag. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Wo giuneei anniug kkewe: wosoapw ffeeor manetemwaai, wosoapw nni aeremas, wosoapw mwoarho, wosoapw oatupwutupw tae kkepas wooan erhai, aesirowuur semoamw me inoamw.<verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Mwaaen we a paniuwaeni pwe, “Saengi rhag nee nipwaen wonigaeteei nge ngaang i tapweei oanongaen oasoapwosoapw kkeei.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Igiwe Jesus a rongorong miniwe nge a aengaeni pwe, “E rhiuwen no eew minne wopwe feeori. Wonoa ameow noa oanongaen pisaegimw nge wa fang senaapian ngaeniir rhooa affayeo, ina nge epwe yor wiinoamw me wooai naaeng. Iwe wa itto wopwe itto tapweaei.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Igiwe mwaaen we a rongorong miniwe a igin aenneew tipan, pwe igiwe iiy erhai man naiwiis.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Jesus a weri pwe a aenneew tipan nge a iura pwe, “Ifa mwo waeiraesin aar rhooakka re pisaegisaeg repwe toonong noan minna Mweoiun Deus! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Egin mererhaeg aaen erhai <char style="tl">camel</char> epwe toonong noan ngetaen efoarh oaguwa, me mmwaen aaen erhai mwaaen pisaegisaeg epwe toonong noan minna Mweoiun Deus.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Rhooa kkewe re rongorong miniwe ra aeiineo pwe, “Iwe, iyo rhag epwe mmwenen menaw?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Jesus a paniuwaeni pwe, “Minikkena ese mmwen ngaeniir aeremas nge emmwen ngaeni Deus.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Peter a iura pwe, “Pipiiy! Aemaem aeiya nigiti pwugusaemmaem nge aeiya itto tapweog.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe aere erhai e siusaengi imwan, aere pwiuniuwan, aere pwiin, aere seman aere inan, aere naiun pwe faaen itaen minna Mweoiun Deus, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>ina epwe gin temoag minne epwe pwigi reen oate igina, nge noan oatona epwe itto epwe pwan pwigi menaw na esooar iaenin.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aeinuwaen Aaen Jesus Aepesa Aan Maenoa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mark 10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Jesus a paeniir noa rhooan akkiuneo kkewe seig me riiurhai a aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw aiussaening! Sipwene noa Jerusalem nge oanongaen meeta kkewe profeta kkewe re iura pwe wunuunun mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas ina epwene nnetaen wen. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Repwene iseni nong nee paiiur Gentiles, ina repwene aeni aegekkaei, me aessaewa, nge re oattuffa. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Repwene wirhiy nge reniiy noa, mwirin enuuw raaen nge a menaw sefaaen tae.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Nge rhooan akkiuneo kkewe naiun nge rese metefaaegini minikkewe; pwe faan kkepas kkewe nge emwoan saengiir, iwe rese metefaaegini meeta kkewe Jesus e aepesa.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aeffetanoa Mesaen Erhai Mwaaen Parh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mark 10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Jesus a aekkaerepa to Jericho, igiwe erhai mwaaen parh e mooaton wenepeigin aan nge e tittingoar noa rhag. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Igiwe a rongorong aar rhooanap we itto faaeraeg noa me oaron, nge a aeiineeor pwe, “Meeta eei?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Ra aengaeni pwe, “Jesus re Nazareth iye epwe faaeraeg na me igeei.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Mwaaen we aekkepwas noa, “Jesus, Naiun David, faayeowaei!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Aeremas kkewe reno mmwan ra soong ngaeni pwe epwe anniug noa. Nge egius mwo nge oatomoga noa aan iyaekkepwas, “Naiun David, faayeowaei!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Jesus a iug noa nge a akkiuneo pwe repwe pwigito man masparh we reen. Igiwe a arapeto nge Jesus a aeiineow pwe, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>“Meeta wa tipaeni pwe ipwe feeori ngaeniug?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Nge a paniuwaeni pwe, “Soawumwaer! Ngaang i mwerhaen ipwe weriwer sefaaen.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Iwe fanoa pwe wopwe weriwer! Oamw niugiuniug a aecchipwoag.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Iwe rhag nge wonowe a ffatenoa mesan, iwe a tapweei Jesus iwe a itto fang aaen Deus aerhigerhig. Igiwe rhooanap we ra weri miniwe ra aepingepinga Deus.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus me Zacchaeus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Jesus a itto noan Jericho iwe ra feffaaeraeg noa. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Eyor erhai soamwoonin rhooan iyoiyon <char style="tl">tax</char> itan Zacchaeus, erhai man naiwiis. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Iiy e aekkaegina epwe weri Jesus nge igiwe iiy erhai mwaaen mwittig ese weri Jesus me noan pwuwa we. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Iwe a fattapw noa me mmwaen pwuwa we a noa teeotae wooan efoarh waniwan pwe epwe weri Jesus aan faaeraeg noa me igiwe. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Oatowe Jesus enoa itto pwiuneoi we, enoa fattae a weri Zacchaeus iwe a aengaeni pwe, “Mwetekkaeitiw Zacchaeus pwe ipwe no noan iimw we imwoamw raaeneei.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Zacchaeus a teeo mwetekkaeitiw a itto aewenimmwa Jesus noan aan kker. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Oanongeer aeremas kkewe ra weri minikkewe a rhaepetae aar mwangiuniungiun pwe, “Mwaaen een epwene noa no noan imwaen erhai man monofit!”<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Zacchaeus a iutae nge a aengaeni Soamwoon pwe, “Soawumwaer! Ngaang ipwene fang esoapw pisaegiy ngaeniir man affayeo, nge ngaere eyor mane i riugiuriug ngaeni nge ipwe aesefaaeni paniuwaen minikkena aan faaen faawu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Menaw a toori imweei raaeneei, pwe pwan mwaaeneei nge pwan iiy teoteeon Abraham. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Manewe Naiun Aeremas e itto giut nge e itto aemenewaar rhooa mwaenirh noa.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioangon Faiun <char style="tl">Gold</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25.14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Nugunupaen aar aeremas aiussaening minikkeei nge Jesus a soapwei noa aan kkepas nge a fioangei ngaeniir eew fioangon awewe. Igina nge a aekkaerepa noa Jerusalem, nge rhooawe ra niuwaennei pwe miniwe Mweoiun Deus epwene oaropaen pwaeto. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>A iura pwe, “Eno erhai mwaaen taegias epwene noa wooan eew faniuw taaw noa epwene noa no pwe <char style="tl">king</char>, nge mwirin a sefaaeneto nee pwugusan. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Weni mmwaen aan epwe noa a faingi fengaenniir rhooan akkiuneo kkewe naiun iwe seig, nge a ngaenneer eew tutuun <char style="tl">gold</char> nge a aengaeniir pwe, ‘Oaw giutta ngaere eyor minne oawpwe aemenewa ngaeni minneen igine ipwene noa.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Iwe nge aeremas kkewe naiun nge re oapwuta, iwe ra fangenoa rhooan pweipwogin mwaenieer wooan faniuw we eew pwe, ‘Aemaem aeise tipaeni mwaaen een pwe epwe no pwe aemaem <char style="tl">king</char>.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>“Ra oatonongei mwaaen we pwe <char style="tl">king</char> nge a noa sefaaeneto. Iwe rhag nge a akkiuneo rhooan engaang kkewe naiun pwe repwe itto reen pwe epwe pipiiy a ifa nepaen minne ra aemenewa ngaeni senaapiy kkewe. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Iwe egommw a iura pwe, ‘Menap, a seig aan paer noa faiun <char style="tl">gold</char> minne iya aemenewa ngaeni iwe efai iwe wo ngaenneaei.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Mwaaen we a iura pwe, ‘Wo igin mwamwaai. Een erhai rhooan akkiuneo we wo igin mwamwaai! Pwonno iga min paerhigerhig mwo nge wo aniugiuniug noan, een wopwene nemaeni seig aepinoamw.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Rhooan akkiuneo we ariiurhaiun a noa itto a iura pwe, ‘Menap, a nimowu aan paer noa faiun <char style="tl">gold</char> minne iya aemenewa ngaeni iwe wo ngaenneaei.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Iwe mwaaen we a iura pwe, ‘Een wopwene nemaeni nimowu aepinoamw.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>Iwe erhai a noa itto nge a iura pwe, ‘Menap, ieen faiun <char style="tl">gold</char> we noawumw i oapa noan eew mengaag. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>I mesagiug pwe iga een erhai mwaaen sosoong. Wo pwigi minikka saapw oamw nge wo giniiy minikka saapw foatogiyoamw.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Mwaaen we a aengaeni pwe, ‘Een erhai rhooan akkiuneo e aenneew! Minikkomwu mwaenioamw nge ipwene oamonofitiug wooan! Wo giuneei pwe ngaang erhai man sosoong, i pwigi mwo nge minikkena saapw aaei nge i giniiy uwaen irae kena ise foatogi. <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Iwe meeta rhag wose ngoannong senaapiy we naeyi noan <char style="tl">bank</char> reen? Ina nge ipwe pwigi nge epwene yor menewan iga iya sefaaeneto.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>A aengaeniir rhooa kkewe re iu pwe, ‘Pwigi saengi mwaaen mwuun faiun <char style="tl">gold</char> na nge oawwa ngaenneei mwaaen we seig naiun faiun <char style="tl">gold</char>.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Nge ra aengaeni pwe, ‘Menap, a fasiun seig naiun <char style="tl">gold</char>!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>A iura pwe, ‘Ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe, iyo a yor meeta aan nge repwe pwan fang ngaeni, nge iyo ese yor meeta aan nge repwe pwigi saengi mwo nge iwe egius iwe eyor reen. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Igina, nge rhooa kkewe rhooan kkoapwutoi ikkiwe rese tipaeni pwe ipwe no pwe aar <char style="tl">king</char>, oaw pwigiir to igeei, iwe oawwa itto niir tiw me weni mmwaei!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Toonongon Jesus Noan Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mark 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">John 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Mwirin aaen Jesus aepesa minneei, nge a gommw noa weni mmweer ra noa ngaeni Jerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Igiwe a aerepato Bethphage me Bethany me reen miniwe rhugun <char style="tl">Olives</char> nge a akkiuneeor noa riiurhai rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>nge a aengaeniir pwe: “Oawnoa noan pwugos mwu mmwaemi; nge oatona oawpwe toonong nge oawpwe weri erhai <char style="tl">donkey</char> mwittig e feotaeg ina esaaen yor mwo erhai ne e waawa. Oaw pwaeisi oawwa pwigito igeei. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Ngaere igine aeremas e aeiineogaemi aere meeta oaw saeneti reen, oawwa aengaeni pwe Soamwoon e mwerhaen waawa.”<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Ra noa nge oanongaen min kkewe Jesus e aengaeniir nge ewen ngaeni. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Igiwe ra pweppwaeisi ooas mwittig we nge manewe naiun a mwaenieniy ngaeniir, “Meeta oawwa pwaeisi noa reen?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Maasta e mwerhaen waawa”, <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>iwe ra pwigi noa <char style="tl">donkey</char> we reen Jesus. Ra iseni tae minikkewe mengaagiiur wooan, iwe ra iseni tae Jesus wooan. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Igiwe Jesus a faaeraeg nge aeremas ra mmeraeg tiw mengaagiiur wooan ennap we.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Igiwe a aerepato Jerusalem, pwiuneoi we ennap we e ittiw me reen rhugun <char style="tl">Olives</char>, rhooa towunap kkewe naiun rhooan kkayeo ra rhaepetae aar fang aan Deus aerhigerhig, nge re aekkepwas temoag tae reen aar aepingepinga Deus reen oanongaen manaman kkena ra weri. <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>Ra iura pwe, “Deus epwe aewenepwuwa <char style="tl">king</char> na e itto faaen itaen Soamwoon! Oapoas me wooai naaeng me nning ngaeni Deus na oarosaen taegias!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Aaemweoi Pharisees reno noa pwuwa we ra aengaeni Jesus pwe, “Sinsei, mwaenieniy ngaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkomwu noawumw pwe resoapw oacchorong!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir, “Ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe, aere igine repwe anniug, ina nge fai kaan minne repwe aekkepwas.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Saengiti Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Igiwe Jesus a aerepato aepinoamw we, nge oatowe eweri nge a saengiti, <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>nge a iura pwe, “Aetaemwo wogaen giuneei raaeneei meeta minne epwe pwigito oapoas! Nge igina een wosoapw mmwenen weri! <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Eew oat epwe noa itto rhooan kkoapwutomw repwene roangeog noa, nge re aetippoag, nge ra pineyi saengiug oanongaen pwiuneoi. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Repwene oatoaropoag noa een me aeremas kkomwu noan minimwu neniemw; esooar efai faai kaan ne epwe notiw nenien, pwe iga een ese pwae ngaeniug oatowe Deus e itto pwe epwe aemenewoag!”<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Noa Noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mark 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">John 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Jesus a noa noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we nge a rhaepetae aan asiiur wow rhooan ameomeo kkewe reno noan, <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>a aengaeniir pwe, “E foatofoat noan Pwapwior we e Santus pwe Deus e aepesa pwe, ‘<char style="tl">Temple</char> e aaei nge imwaen maeipin.’ Nge aaemi oawwa ssiuweniy pwe nenien wopoor rhooa mwoarho!”<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Oanongaen raaen nge Jesus e fenai noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we. Soamwoonin patere me sinsein anniug me soamwooniir aeremas kkewe ra mwerhaen niiy noa, <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>nge ina rhag esooar eew meeta ne re giuneei pwe repwe feeori ngaeni, pwe igiwe oanongeer aeremas kkewe nge re tipaeni repwe aiussaening ngaeni minikkewe petenaen mwaenian.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s">Kkepas Aeiineon Nemaeniaen Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mark 11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Eraaen igiwe Jesus e fenai ngaeniir aeremas me noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, e fenaiuw Kkepas Mwamwaai we, nge soamwooniir patere, me sinsein anniug me fengaen me rhooa kkewe ra tugufaeyi ra noa itto <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>nge ra aengaeni pwe, “Meeta nemaenioamw pwe wopwe feeori minikkeei? Iyo a ngaenneog oamw nemenem?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Ipwe aeiineogaemi eew kkepas aeiineo. Oaw aengaeniaei, <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>iya e itto aaen John nemenem pwe epwe paptismus fetaen: saengi Deus aere saengi aeremas?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Ra rhaepetae aar aengimaw fengaen wooar, “Meeta sipwe iura? Aere sipwe iura pwe, ‘Saengi Deus,’ nge iiy epwe aeiineogirh pwe, ‘Nge meeta rhag oawse niugiuniug ngaeni John reen?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Nge aere sipwe iura pwe, ‘Saengi aeremas,’ ina nge pwuwaen aeremas eei nge repwene teragirh, pwe iga re niugiuniug pwe John nge erhai profeta.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Aeise giuneei iga e itto me ee.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Iwe nge Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Ina nge ngaang isoapw pwan aengaenigaemi iya iga i pwigi me ee nemaeniaei pwe ipwe feeori minikkeei.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fioangon Awewen Rhooan Aemmwenen Maat we</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mark 12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Iwe Jesus a aeni eew fioang awewe ngaeniir aeremas kkewe. “Eno erhai mwaaen a foatogi eew maetaen <char style="tl">grape</char>, nge a ngaenneer aaemweoi rhooan maat pwe repwe aefaenniy. Iwe rhag nge a saei taaw noa. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Enoa itto oatowe repwe giniiy uwaen waniwan kkewe, a fangenoa erhai rhooan akkiuneo pwe epwe noa pwigi wiwiin me reen uwaen maat kkewe. Nge rhooan maat kkewe ra wirhiy nge ra aesefaaeni noa nge esooar meeta e pwigi. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Iwe a pwan fangenoa erhai rhooan akkiuneo; rhooan maat kkewe ra pwan noa wirhiy nge ra feeori ngaeni aekkaew wegitaeg aessaew nge re aesefaaeni noa nge esooar meeta e pwigi. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>A pwan fangenoa aeiniurhaiun rhooan akkiuneo kkewe; rhooan maat kkewe ra pwan oawoasu nge re aerheiwow niugiun maat we. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Manewe aan maat we a iura pwe, ‘Meeta minne ipwene feeori? Maeni ipwene fangenoa aeterhaeng e naeyi; e tiwegin nge repwe aesirowu!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Nge igiwe rhooan maat we ra weri, ra pwiungiuw fengaenniy wooar pwe, ‘Ieei mwaaen we naiun mwaaen we aan maat eei iwe epwe pwugusaeni minneei. Oaw itto sipwe niiy noa, pwe sipwe pwigi minne pwugusaen pwe pwugusarh!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Iwe ra oatorawow niugiun maat we nge ra niiy noa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Jesus a aeiineeor pwe, “Meeta manewe aan maat we epwe feeori ngaeniir rhooan maenemaen kkewe? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Epwe itto a itto niir noa mwaaen kkewe, nge a ngaenneer aaemweoi maat we.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Igiwe aeremas ra rongorong minneei nge ra iura pwe, “Aapw saapw ina!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Jesus a wegitaeg ngaeniir nge a aeiineeor pwe, “Iwe ina nge meeta awewen miniwe noan Pwapwior we e Santus?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Fai we rhooan kaiu iimw re aerheei noa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">nge faer ina fai we egin yor ipitan me mmwaen oanongan.’<verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Oanongeer rhooakka repwe ppiungiutiw wooan faai een nge repwe mwetoarotoar noa; nge aere faai een epwe ppiungiutiw wooan erhai, epwe aepettatiw.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kkepas Aeiineon <char style="tl">Tax</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mark 12.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Sinsein anniug me soamwoonin patere kkewe ra mwerhaen repwe torofi Jesus, pwe igiwe re giuneei pwe fioangoor miniwe a aengaeniir; nge igiwe re mesagiiur aeremas kkewe. <verse eid="LUK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Iwe ra weti ngaeni eew oat ne repwe mmwenen torofi. Ra fang ngaeniir aaemweoi mwaaen senaapiy pwe repwe noa feeoriir noa pwe iir aaemweoi mwaaen wenewen, iwe ra fangenoa iir pwe repwe noa oatupwu Jesus pwe repwe torofi reen aan kkepas pwe epwe mmwen pwe repwe fangenoa iiy reen <char style="tl">Governor</char> reen Rome ina eyor maemaewan. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Iwe aeremas kkewe ra aengaeni Jesus pwe, “Sinsei, aei giuneei pwe minikkomwu wo aepesa nge e wenewen. Aei giuneei pwe een wose aefaenniy wunuunun erhai me erhai, nge wa fenaiuw wenewenen nee tipaen Deus ngaeniir aeremas. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Aengaenigemaem, e mwamwaai aarh sipwe fang <char style="tl">tax</char> ngaeni Soamwoonin Rome, aere aapw?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Jesus e metefaaegini oatupwutupw we aar nge a aengaeniir pwe, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>“Pwaerito efai senaapiy <char style="tl">silver</char>. Mesaen iyo me itaen iyo imwu eno wooan?”<figure style="fig" alt=". . ." file="HK00166B.tif" size="col" loc=". . ." copy=". . ." ref="20.24"/></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Soamwoonin Rome.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Jesus a iura pwe, “Iwe ina nge oaw ngaenneei Soamwoonin Rome meeta aaen Soamwoonin Rome, nge oaw ngaenneei Deus meeta aaen Deus.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Iwe esooar meeta ne emmwen pwe repwe torofi Jesus reen petenaen kkepas kkewe e paniuwaeni ngaeniir me weni mmweer rhooa towunap we, iwe ra anniug noa rhag pwe ra mwaar reen sefaaenin kkepas kkewe aan.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kkepas Aeiineon Menaw Sefaaen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mark 12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Aaemweoi Sadducees, iwe re iura pwe esooar menaw sefaaen me reen mae, ra itto aengaeni Jesus pwe, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>“Sinsei, Moses minne e foatogi anniug eei pwe aemaem: ‘Aere erhai mwaaen a mae nge esooar naiun wooan rhooapwut we pwiuniuwan, ina nge mwaaen we pwiin epwe pwiuniuwaeni rhooapwut we pwe epwe yor naiun pwe epwe ffai pwe naiun mwaaen we a mae.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Reno fiusiuman pwipwi; mwaaen we e tugufaeyi a pwiuniuwaeni nge emae noa nge esooar naiun. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Iwe ariiurhaiun a pwan pwiuniuwaeni rhooapwut we, <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>pwan ina rhag iwe aeiniurhaiun. Oanongeer me fiusiuman nge ina rhag miniwe ewen ngaeniir. Remae noa nge esooar naiiur. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Mwirin noan, nge rhooapwut we a maenoa. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Iwe igina, wooan raaenin na manimae repwene menaw sefaaen, iyo me neeiir epwe pwiuniuwaeni rhooapwut we? Pwe igiwe rhooawe fiusiuman nge re pwiuniuwaeni niewe.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Jesus a paniuwaeniir pwe, “Mwaaen me rhooapwuton faaen mweoiuw nge re rhooan ngaenne, <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>iwe nge mwaaen me rhooapwut kena ra ffin tae pwe repwe menaw sefaaen iwe nge ra no noan mweoi na epwe noa itto nge ina resoapw rhiuwen pwiuppwiuniuw. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Iir repwene weei rhag angkenus pwe resoapw mmwenen mae. Ra no pwe naiun Deus pwe ra menaw sefaaen me reen maenoa. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Moses a aeffeta noa pwe manimae nge re menaw sefaaen tae. Me reen petenaen fioangon waniwan we e ppwunuwow aengaet me reen iwe e aepesa kkepesaen Soamwoon pwe, ‘aaen Abraham Deus, aaen Isaac Deus, me aaen Jacob Deus.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Pwe iiy minne aar Deus rhooakka re menaw nge soapw rhooakka ra mae, pwe me reen nge oanongeer aeremas nge re menaw me reen.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Aekkaaemweoi me neeiir sinsein anniug we ra mwaenieniy tae, “Sinsei, e igin gacch aessefaaenin kkepas we oamw!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Pwe iir ra mesag pwe repwe aeiineo mwo nge eew kkepas aeiineo.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kkepas Aeiineon Iyo na Kristus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mark 12.35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Jesus a aeiineeor pwe, “Meeta emmwen pwe re iura pwe Kristus nge teoteeon David reen? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>Pwe David wooan oanongan nge e iura me noan pwapwior we Psalms,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Soamwoon a aengaeniaei Soamwoon:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">Mooat tiw peig mwaaeneei<verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>toori aaei ipwe iseniir tiw rhooan oapwutoag faaen pirhemw</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:43">pwe repwe no pwe nenien pirhemw.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>David e faingi pwe iiy ‘Soamwoon’; iwe nge e ifa wusun nge Kristus epwe no pwe teoteeon David?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Atapeonneogiiur Reen Sinsein Anniug Kkewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mark 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Igiwe aeremas re aiussaening ngaeni nge Jesus a aengaeniir rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>“Oaw aefaennigaemi reen sinsein anniug kkewe, re aerhaengi aar faaeraeg fetaen faaen mengaagiiur min enaenaei, nge re aerhaengi aar aeremas repwe aewenimmwaar me aesirowuur me noan imwaen chuwaai, nge re fini rhag neniy kkena nenieer rhooa taegias me noan wutteer Jews me pwiuneoi mwamwaai me noan gupwun. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Re oapwurhaar rhooapwut kkewe ra mae pwiuniuweer, nge ra pirifa saengiir pwuguseer, nge ra oangona ngaeniir aeremas aar maeipin enaei! Iwe nge aegaeregaeriir ina epwene igin waeiraes!”<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s">Maenigaech we Aaen Rhooapwut we a Mae Pwiuniuwan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mark 12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Jesus a fan fetaen nge a weriir rhooa naiwiis pwe ra iseis nong aar maenigaech noan nenien maenigaech me noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>iwe nge a pwan weri erhai rhooapwut mwaenene a maenoa pwiuniuwan a iseis nong riiufai manfaifai pwe aan maenigaech. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Nge a iura pwe, “Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe maenigaech na rhooapwut mwaenene we efang ina e temoag saengi aar oanongeer aeremas towunap kkewe. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Pwe oanongeer nge re iseni nong nusegin wiineer; nge rhooapwut een inamwo iga e igin affayeo nge efang oanongaen minikkena eno reen.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aepesa Toaroponoan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mark 13.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Aaemweoi me neeiir rhooan kkayeo kkewe re fiffioangei <char style="tl">Temple</char> we reen nningen faai kkewe eno wooan me niffang kkewe aar aeremas ngaeni Deus. Nge Jesus a iura pwe, <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>“Oanongaen minikka oawwa weri, ina eyor eew oat ina epwe noa itto nge esooar efai faai kaan ne epwe notiw nenien; oanongan noa nge repwene toaropotiw.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Affayeo me Aewwaeiraes</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mark 13.3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Ra aeiineow pwe, “Sinsei, ineeta epwe wen minneei? Meeta na epwe wen nge epwe pwaeri ngaenigemaem pwe minikkeei nge epwene wen?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Jesus a iura pwe, “Oaw aefaennigaemi; oawteorh tupw. Towunepeer aeremas repwene itto faaen itaei nge repwene aepesa pwe, ‘Ngaang minne iiy! A ieei oatowe!’ Nge oawsoapw tapweer. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Oawsoapw mesag igine oawpwe rongorong kkepesaen moawun me fitigogon weni faniuw; ikkeei minikka epwe mmwaen wen, iwe nge saapw reen a arapeto ne soapwonoan.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>A pwan soapwei noa a pwan iura pwe, “Faniuw me faniuw nge repwene fiiow fengaen, eew mweoi me eew mweoi repwene moawun fengaen. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Epwene yor fanemwar tettemoag, me naengeta, me semwaai temoag me oanongaen pwiuneoi; epwene yor mini ariuriu me aemmesag ittiw me weei naaeng. <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Ina rhag nge weni mmwaen minikkeei epwene wen, ina repwene torofigaemi nge ra aewwaeiraesigaemi; ra pwigigaemi noa noan wutteer Jews pwe oawpwene noa apwiung iwe nge oawnoa kanepwus; repwene pwigigaemi weni mmweer <char style="tl">king</char> me soamwoon pwe faaen itaei. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Nge a ieei oaton aaemi oawpwe aepesa Kkepas Mwamwaai we. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Oawpwe fasiun oamoannatae nee tipaemi pwe oawsoapw aiunaengiy aaemi noa saenetigaemi, <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>pwe ngaang ipwe ngaennegaemi mwaeniaemi me repiaemi nge esooar erhai rhooan kkoapwutomi epwe mmwen epwe appaniuwaeni aere paniuwaeni mwaeniaemi. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Aaemi ina inaemi me semaemi, pwiimi, perhaengiyaemi, me maereyaeremi, minne repwe fangenoa aaemi. Nge aaemweoi aaemi ina repwene nigaemi noa. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Oanongeer aeremas nge repwene oapwutaegaemi noa pwe faaen itaei. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Ina rhag ina eyaen mwo aennirhimwemi nge esoapw ppiung noa. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Oaw oarhorho, nge ina nge oawpwe menaw.<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Aepesa Wunuunun Ffeir Noan Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mark 13.14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>“Igine oawpwe weriir sonotaw aar pwaeniaeniy noa Jerusalem, ina nge oawwa giuneei pwe a arap oaton aan epwene ffeir noa. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Iwe rhooawe reno Judea repwe fattapwetae weei rhug; rhooawe reno nee aepinoamw repwe siusaengi, rhooawe reno neman nge resoapw ittiw no nee aepinoamw. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Pwe ikkinaan raaenin kena raaenin aegaeregaer, nge minikkeei epwe pwaeritae minikkiwe mwaeniaen Pwapwior we e Santus e aepesa. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Epwe ifa mwo aar affayeo rhooapwut pwoopwo me ikka re nayigit noan oaton naan! Temoagon aewwaeiraes epwene itto weni faniuw, nge aaen Deus aegaeregaer epwene itto wooar aeremas kaan. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Aaemweoi repwene mae wooan saeitan nge aaemweoi repwene pwigiir noa wooan aekkaaemweoi faniuw; nge re Gentiles ina repwene itto pwuraegraeg wooan Jerusalem toori aan moanno noa minna oatoor.<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Itton Mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mark 13.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>“Epwene yor eew aeginn epwene wen ngaeni aenet me meram me fiiu. Nge wooan soanop nge towunepaen faniuw repwene maegin no noan aewwaeiraes, repwene mesagiu piungpiungiun noa me pwuurtaen saaet. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Aeremas repwene niyoarorhrorh reen aar mesag noan aar wetiwet ngaeni meeta epwe wen ngaeni faeinaengiy, pwe minikkena maemaewaen noan naaeng repwene mwagiut saengi nenieer. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Noan oatonaan nge miniwe Naiun Aeremas epwene pwaeto me noan naengemaan reen maemaewan me nningen. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Oatona epwe wen minikkeei, nge oawwa iutae nge oawwa saeregi tae rhimwemi, pwe menewaemi ina a arapeto.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fenaiun Waniwan e <char style="tl">Fig</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mark 13.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Jesus a aengaeniir fioangon awewe een: “Oaw maengiy efoarh waniwan <char style="tl">fig</char> me oanongaen waniwan kkewe aaemweoi. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Nge oawpwe weri minikkena rheon pwe a pwiugiuw wow, oawwa giuneei pwe a arapeto neraeg. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Epwan ieei rhag taeppen, igine oawweri minikkeei pwe a wen, ina nge oawwa giuneei pwe arapeto minna Mweoiun Deus.<verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>“Ennetaen, ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe oanongaen minikkeei nge epwe wen weni mmwaen iga aeremesaen igina repwe maenoa. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Naaeng me soanop repwe soapwonoa, nge aaei kkepas esoapw soapwonoa.<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oaw Aefaennigaemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>“Oaw aefaennigaemi pwe oawte igin gupwun me oappwunaas me aaemi aiunaengiy menaen menaw eei, nge epwe tooto raaenin naan nge epwe rhiuwen torofigaemi rhag <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>taeppen iga oawyo noan taefirh. Pwe minneei ina epwe wen ngaeniir oanongeer aeremesaen noan faeinaengiy. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Ina oawpwe aefaennigaemi nge oaw maeipin noa rhag pwe epwe yor maemaewaemi noan oatonaan epwe wenewen minikkeei iwe me aaemi noa iutae me weni mmwaen mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Jesus aeni raaenin kkeei reen aan fenai noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, nge enoa nee oatofaaef, nge a noa wooan rhugun <char style="tl">Olives</char>. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Nee oatosor moawugowug nge oanongeer aeremas ra maegeto noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we pwe repwe aiussaening ngaeni aan fenai.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s">Aar Rhiu Aenneewa Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mark 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">John 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>A arapeto oaton gupwunon fenoawa we esooar <char style="tl">yeast</char> reen, iwe regaen iura pwe <char style="tl">Passover</char>. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Soamwoonin patere me sinsein anniug kkewe re mesagiiur aeremas iwe ra kiukkiutta eew oat ne repwe niiy noa Jesus noan mwoanomwoan.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Judas a Tipaeni Epwe Fangenoa Tinnimaen Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mark 14.10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Saetan a itinong nee tipaen Judas, pwan itan Iscariot, iwe erhai me neeiir rhooan kkayeo kkewe seig me riiurhai. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Judas a noa mwaenieniy ngaeniir soamwoonin patere kkewe me soamwooniir poosun <char style="tl">Temple</char> we reen wunuunun aan epwe fang ngaeniir Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>A gacch nee tipeer rhooawe iwe ra iura pwe repwene fang senaapiy reen miniwe epwene feeori. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Judas a tipieew ngaeni miniwe iwe a rhaepetae aan kiukkiutta eew oaton ne egacch pwe epwe fangenoa menewaen Jesus nge aeremas resoapw giuneei.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus Oamoannatae pwe Epwe Mwongo Mwongoon <char style="tl">Passover</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mark 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">John 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>A itto raaenin gupwunon fenoawa we esooar <char style="tl">yeast</char> reen, igiwe regaen ninni <char style="tl">sheep</char> pwe mwongoon <char style="tl">Passover</char>. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Jesus a fangenoa Peter me John a aengaeniir pwe, “Oawnoa oamoannatae mwongoon <char style="tl">Passover</char> we aarh.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Ra aeiineow pwe, “Iya iga wo mwerhaen pwe aeipwe noa oamoannatae me ee?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>A paniuwaeniir pwe, “Oaw itinong nee aepinoamw, nge erhai mwaaen na epwe pweipwog ruumen rhaan ina epwe itto rhuungigaemi. Oawwa tapweei noa noan iimw na epwe noa toonong noan, <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>nge oawwa aengaeni mwaaen na imwan iimw naan pwe: ‘Sinsei e aeiineo ngaeniug pwe, Ifa sengkin na rhooan kkayeo kena naeyi me ngaang aeipwe mwongoon <char style="tl">Passover</char> me ee?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Ina epwene pwaeri ngaenigaemi eew sengkin faeregit ina wooan tae, ina e fasiun moannotae noan, nge ina igina oawpwene noa oamoannatae me ee.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Ra noa rhooawe ra noa weri pwe oanongaen minikkewe Jesus e aengaeniir nge ewen ngaeni, iwe ra noa oamoannatae mwongoon <char style="tl">Passover</char> me ee.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aaen Soamwoon Mwongoon Faaef</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mark 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Cor 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Enoa toori oatowe nge Jesus a mooat tiw reen <char style="tl">table</char> we reer oapostonus kkewe naiun. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>A aengaeniir pwe, “A igin noa tipaei pwe sipwe aeni fengaenniy mwongoon <char style="tl">Passover</char> eei weni mmwaen aaei ipwe toonong noan aaei aewwaeiraes! <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Pwe ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe, isoapw rhiuwen mwongonoa mwongo eei toori oatona epwe pwae noa oanongaen minna faan minna mwongoon <char style="tl">Passover</char> me noan minna Mweoiun Deus.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Iwe Jesus a pwigi eew kkap, a fang aan aerhigerhig ngaeni Deus, nge a iura pwe, “Oaw pwigi minneen pwe oawpwe amakkiu fengaenniy woami. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe saengi igina a noa nge isoapw iun no <char style="tl">wine</char> een toori tooton minna Mweoiun Deus.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Iwe a pwigi fenoawa we a fang aan maeipinen aerhigerhig, iwe a giniiy nge a ngaenneer nge a iura pwe, “Ieen minne oanongaei, iye ipwene fangenoa pwe aegin aaemi. Oawpwe feeori minneen pwe ipwe gaen memmaeng ngaenigaemi.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Pwan taeppen rhag miniwe efeeori igiwe a noa moanno noa mwongo we nge pwigi kkap we nge a iura pwe, “Ieen miniwe kkepaen ppwon ffeo we aaen Deus iye reen minne cchaei, iye epwene nipinoa pwe aegin aaemi.<verse eid="LUK 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>“Iwe nge oaw pipiiy! Pwe mwaaen we epwe fangenoa tinnimaei iye eno reei oaron <char style="tl">table</char> eei! <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas ina epwene mae noa noan aaen affeeor Deus, iwe nge ifa mwo aenneewan ngaeni mwaaen na e fangenoa tinnimaen!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Iwe rhag nge ra maegetae aeiineo fengaen wooar iyo erhai neeiir na epwe mmwenen feeori minneei.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aengiingin Iyo na e Taegias</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Rhooa kkayeo kkewe ra itto aengiingi fengaen wooar iyo na oarosaen taegias. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “<char style="tl">King</char> kena soamwooniir re Gentiles ina eyor maemaeweer wooar, iwe nge iir soamwoon kaan nge iir minne re iura pwe ‘iir maereyaereer aeremas.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Nge aaemi esoapw ieei wusumi; oawpwe faer feeori pwe iyo na oarosaen taegias epwe faer weer rhag maan wonigaet, nge soamwoon repwe weer rhag rhooan akkiuneo. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Iyo na oarosaen taegias, manna emooat tiw pwe epwe mwongo aere manna e inet mwongo? Manewe emooat tiw minna e taegias. Ngaang iye ino neeimi nge ngaang minne i inet mwongo.<verse eid="LUK 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>“Oawwa nonno reei noan oanongaen aaei waeiraes; <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>nge eweei rhag igiwe manewe Semaei a ngaenneaei maemaewaei pwe ipwe nemenem, nge ngaang ipwe pwan ngaennegaemi iiy maemaewaei. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>Aaemi oawpwe mwongo me iun me reen <char style="tl">table</char> e aeinoa minna Mweoiuy, iwe nge aaemi oawpwe mooat wooan minikkena nenieer soamwoon oawpwe nemaeniir aeinang kkewe seig me ruwowu ikkiwe aaen Israel.<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus e Aepesa Aaen Peter Iura pwe Ese Giuneei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mark 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">John 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>“Simon, Simon! Aiussaening! A fasiun saenetaeg pwe Saetan epwe soatonigaemi, pwe epwe aeyimweoiuw noa rhooa mwamwaai me rhooa aenneew, taeppen rhag iga rhooan maat regaen aeyimweoiuw noa <char style="tl">wheat</char> saengi peeon. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Nge ngaang i maeipinoag een Simon, pwe oamw niugiuniug esoapw ppiung noa. Nge oatonoa wopwe noa toagun ngaeniaei nge wa aemaewaar rhooa kkomwu pwiimw.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Peter a paniuwaeni pwe, “Soamwoon, ngaang iya oamoannatae ipwe tapweog reen kanepwus me oamw mae!”<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Jesus a iura pwe, “I aengaeniug Peter, pwe esoapw keokkeok maniug nee pwongiy toori oatona wopwe iura faaen enuuw pwe wose giuneaei.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pwetoaw, Tutu, me Saeitan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Jesus a aeiineeor rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun pwe, “Oatowe i aefengaegaemi noa nge esooar aaemi pwetoaw, tutu me nokka, nge eyor minne esooar reemi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Esooar mwo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Jesus a iura pwe, “Nge igina, iyo eyor aan pwetoaw aere tutu nge epwe pwigi; nge iyo esooar naiun saeitan, epwe chuwaiuw noa mengaagiun pwe epwe meoni efoarh saeitan. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Pwe ipwe aengaenigaemi pwe Pwapwior we e Santus e iura pwe, ‘Iiy ina a pwan aeffitaeg ngaeniir rhag rhooakkena re aenneew,’ ina epwe nnetaen wen ngaeniaei, pwe iga minikka kkepesaei ikka e foatofoat nge ikka a pwae noa pwe ennet.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra iura pwe, “Emwaeri! Soamwoon, riiufoarh saeitan ikka!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Nge iya iura pwe, “A toaw!”<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Maeipin Wooan Rhugun <char style="tl">Olives</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mark 14.32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Jesus a nigiti aepinoamw we nge a noa ngaeni miniwe rhugun <char style="tl">Olives</char>, igiwe e fasiun gaen noa e, nge rhooan kkayeo kkewe ra pwan tapweei noa. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Igiwe ra toori pwiuneoi we, nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw maeipin pwe oawte ppiungiunong noan sessoat.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>A nigitiir iwe a sooar mwet taaw saengiir egius, a noa foatotiw pwe a maeipin. <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>A iura pwe, “Semaei, aere wo mwerhaen nge wa arhiuwa saengiaei kkepaen waeiraes ee. Nge soapw minne tipaei, pwe minna tipoamw minna epwe mmwen.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Erhai angkenus naaeng a itto reen a itto aemaemaewa tae. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Noan aan igin waeiraes egius mwo nge e aetemaegin reen aan maeipin, moaniyoanon e ssopwetiw nee ppweon nge a weei rhag sossopwun ccha.<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Enoa iutae me reen maeipin, a sefaaen noa reer rhooan kkayeo kkewe naiun nge a noa weriir pwe ra maiur, ra gin mmaniuniu reen aar nee tip cchoaw. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>A aengaeniir pwe, “Meeta oawwa maiur reen? Oaw rhimwitae oawwa maeipin pwe oawte ppiungiunong noan sessoat.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aar Torofi Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mark 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">John 18.3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Jesus e rhiuwen mwaenieniy nge a noa itto eew pwuwaen aeremas, Judas minne e mmweer, iwe erhai me neeiir rhooawe seig me riiurhai a war. A itto reen Jesus a itto faeisongei. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Nge Jesus a iura pwe, “Judas, faeisong mwu oamw minimwu wopwene fangenoa tinnimaen Naiun Aeremas reen?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Oatowe rhooan kkayeo kkewe reno reen Jesus ra giuneei miniwe epwene wen, nge ra aeiineow pwe, “Soamwoon, aeipwe mmwenen nainai saeitan kka naimaem?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Erhai me neeiir e pwigi fena rhooan akkiuneo we naiun Soamwoonin Patere iwe gopiy noa peig mwaaenen saeningan.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Iwe nge Jesus a iura pwe, “Iug noa, a gacch nepaen!” A geotteopa saeningaen mwaaen we iwe a gacch noa.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Jesus a aengaeniir rhooawe soamwoonin patere me soamwooniir poosun <char style="tl">Temple</char> we me mwaaen tugufaeyi kkewe re itto pwe repwe itto torofi, “Meeta oawnoa itto faaen saeitan me soapwon irae reen, pwe iga aetae ngaang erhai man mwoarho? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>I nonno reemi oanongaen raaen noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we, nge esooar aaemi torofiaei. Iwe nge igina minne a oatomi, pwe iga maemaewaen pwoong roorh a nemenem.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peter a Iura pwe Ese Giuneei Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mat 26.57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mark 14.53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">John 18.12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Ra torofi Jesus ra pwigi noa noan iimw we imwaen Soamwoonin Patere; nge Peter epwan tettapweer to me itaaw. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Effooan eew aengaet noan wororaen iimw we, nge Peter a itto mooat tiw oaroor rhooawe re feroangoroangei noa aengaet we. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Igiwe erhai rhooapwut rhooan engaang a weri pwe emooat oaron aengaet we, a fan wenewen ngaeni nge a iura pwe, “Pwan mwaaen een nge rhoaniuwaen Jesus!”<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Nge Peter e iura pwe, “Rhooapwut mwuun, ngaang ise giuneei mwaaen na!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Ese mmwaei mwo nge erhai mwaaen a pwan weri Peter nge a pwan iura pwe, “Pwan een erhai rhoaniuwan!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Nge Peter a iura pwe, “Mwaaen mwuun, soapw ngaang!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Epwe eew awa me mwirin nge erhai mwaaen a pwan kkepas ngaeni pwe, “Ennetaen pwe mwaaen een rhoaniuwaen Jesus, pwe iga iiy pwan erhai re Galilee!”<verse eid="LUK 22:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Peter a paniuwaeni pwe, “Mwaaen mwuun, ise giuneei meeta mwu wo iyaekkepesa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Iwe rhag nge igiwe e rhiuwen mwaenieniy nge a keokkeok noa maniug we. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Soamwoon a wegitaeg a fan wenewenei Peter, iwe nge Peter a maengiy meeta we Soamwoon e aengaeni, “Weni mmwaen epwe keokkeok maniug nee pwongiy, nge een wopwe aepesa faaen enuuw pwe wose giuneaei.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Peter a toowow a igin noa saeng.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ra Aeni Aegekkaei Jesus Nge re Wirhiy</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26.67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mark 14.65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Mwaaen kkewe re posuw Jesus ra aeni fetaeneei aegekkaei nge re wirhiy. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Ra pwaniuw noa mesan nge ra aeiineow pwe, “Aegina! Iyo we e wirhiug?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Egin towunap kkepas aenneew kka repwan aengaeni.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Noa Weni Mmwaen <char style="tl">Council</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mark 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">John 18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Enoa itto raaenin we, nge tugufaeyi me soamwoonin patere me sinsein anniug ra mwiirh fengaen, nge ra pwigito Jesus me weni mmweer. <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Ra aengaeni pwe, “Aengaenigemaem, een minne Kristus?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">A paniuwaeni, “Aere i aengaenigaemi nge oawsoapw niugiuniug ngaeniaei; <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>iwe aere i aeiineogaemi eew kkepas aeiyeg, oawsoapw paniuwaeni. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Iwe nge saengi igina a noa, miniwe Naiun Aeremas epwene mooat peig mwaaenen Deus na oarosaen maemaew.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Ra maegin iura pwe, “Ina nge een minne Naiun Deus?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Nge a paniuwaeniir, “Aaemi minimwu oaw iura pwe ngaang.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Ra iura pwe, “Esooar no ne si rhiuwen weti pwe epwe itto pwaeritae aenneewan! Giirh wooan oanongarh nge sia rongorong miniwe e iura!”<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s">Jesus me Weni Mmwaen Pilate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mark 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">John 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Rhooa towunap we ra maegin iutae ra paeninoa Jesus weni mmwaen Pilate, <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>iwe a rhaepetae aar oaturu Jesus me ee: “Aemaem aeiweri mwaaen een pwe e oatupwuur aeremas, egaen iura pwe resoapw fang <char style="tl">tax</char> ngaeni Soamwoonin Rome, nge epwan iura pwe iiy miniwe Kristus, iwe erhai <char style="tl">king</char>.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Pilate a aeiineow pwe, “Een minne aar <char style="tl">king</char> re Jews?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Jesus a paniuwaeni, “Een minimwu wo aepesa.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Pilate a aengaeniir soamwoonin patere kkewe me aeremas kkewe pwe, “Esooar meeta minne i giuneei pwe teren mwaaen een.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Nge ra egius mwo nge re aengimaaw tae, “Reen aan fenai minne a rhaepiy tae fiiow nepeteer aeremas me wooan oanongaen Judea. Erhaepetae me Galilee iwe nge igina a toorito igeei.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus Weni Mmwaen Erotes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Igiwe Pilate a rongorong minneei, nge a aeiyeg pwe, “re Galilee mwaaen een?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Igiwe a pwae ngaeni pwe Jesus e itto me pwiuneoi we Erotes e nemaeni, iwe a fangenoa Jesus reen Erotes, iwe iiy epwan no Jerusalem reen oatowe. <verse eid="LUK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Erotes a igin kker igiwe a weri Jesus, pwe igiwe a fasiun rongorong kkepesaen Jesus nge e tipaeni pwe epwe weri rhag me mweoiuwe. E tipaeni pwe epwe weri aaen Jesus feeori aekkaew kkeman. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Iwe Erotes a aeiyegiy Jesus aekkaew kkepas aeiyeg, nge Jesus ese paniuwaeni. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Soamwoonin patere kkewe me sinsein anniug kkewe ra toonong nge ra aetemaeginiy pwe repwe oamonofitiy Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Erotes me sonotaw kkewe naiun ra aeni aegekkaei Jesus iwe nge refeeori ngaeni aekkaew min aenneew; iwe ra iseni tae eew mengaag nning wooan iwe nge ra fang sefaaen noa reen Pilate. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Noan raaenin we rhag nge Erotes me Pilate ra maereyaer noa; nge igiwe mmwan nge re aenneew fengaen.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ra Aettiweginiy Aaen Jesus Mae Noa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mark 15.6-15</ref>; John 18.39 — 19.16)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Pilate a faingi fengaenniir soamwoonin patere, me mwaaen kkewe me rhooa towunap we, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Oaw pwigito mwaaen een reei nge oaw iura pwe e oatupwuur aeremas. Igina iya pipiiy gacchiuw me igeei nge esooar minne iweri pwe oawpwe oamonofitiy wooan. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Erotes mwo nge esooar minne e oamonofitiy ngaeni, iwe a aesefaaenito reerh. Esooar meeta ne mwaaen een efeeori nge epwe mae reen. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Iwe ipwene aengaeniir pwe repwene wirhiy nge ra saeneti noa.” [<verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Noan oanongaen gupwunon <char style="tl">Passover</char> nge Pilate egaen saeneti noa erhai rhooan kanepwus ngaeniir aeremas.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Petenan eei nge e soano noan aekkaew petenan kka e foatofoat noan kkepesaen Greek.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Rhooanap we ra aekkepwas rhag pwe, “Niiy noa! Saeneti ngaenigemaem Barabbas!” (<verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Barabbas e kanepwus reen aan aeffiiowuur aeremas noan aepinoamw we me aan nni menaw aeremas.)<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Pilate e mwerhaen epwe saeneti noa Jesus iwe a pwan tingoar sefaaen ngaeniir pwuwa we. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Nge iir ra faer aekkepwas sefaaen pwe, “Kurusuw noa! Kurusuw noa!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Aeinuwaen aaen Pilate kkepas ngaeniir a iura pwe, “Meeta monofit na efeeori? Ngaang esooar minne iweri pwe efeeori ne sipwe niiy noa reen! Ipwene aengaeniir pwe repwe wirhiy nge ra saeneti noa.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Nge iir egius mwo nge re aekkepwas temoag tae pwe repwe kurusuw noa Jesus, enoa oarosan noa nge ina miniwe ra feeori. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Iwe Pilate a feeori ngaeni Jesus meeta we aar aeremas tingoar. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Pilate a saeneti noa mwaaen we re tipaeni, iwe re kanepwusa pwe e aeffiiow aeremas me nni menaw aeremas, nge Jesus a iseni ngaeniir pwe repwe feeori ngaeni minna re tipaeni.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ra Kurusuw Noa Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mark 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">John 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Sonotaw kkewe ra paeninoa Jesus, igiwe ra feffaaeraeg noa, ra rhuungi erhai re Cyrene itan Simon iwe e itto saengi eew soapw. Ra torofi iwe ra ngaettae kurus we wooan, nge ra feeori pwe epwe aiufera kurus we me mwirin Jesus.<verse eid="LUK 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Eew pwuwaen aeremas towunap ra tettapwei noa mwirin; aekkaerhai rhooapwut reno neeiir ra saengiti. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Jesus a wegitaeg ngaeniir nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Rhooapwuton Jerusalem! Oawsoapw saengitiaei, pwe oawfaer saengiti gaemi me aetekkomwu naimi. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>A ikkitto raaennekena aeremas repwene iura pwe, ‘Ra wenepwu rhooapwut kkena esooar naiiur, esaaen yor mwo aar nainai, nge esaaen yor mwo aar atiut!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Ina oatona aeremas repwene aengaeni rhug pwe, ‘Piungtiw woamaem!’ nge re aengaeni taeiit pwe, ‘Oapaegemaem!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Pwe ngaere minikkeei a wenewen iga e rhiuwen arawaraw waniwan, nge epwe ifa wusun igine a ppwass?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Riiurhai mwaaen, rhooan kanepwus, ra pwan paeniir wow repwe noa niir noa me reen Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Renoa itto reen pwiuneoi we regaen iura pwe “Peopeoi Rhimw”, ra itto kurusuw noa Jesus me ee, fengaen me rhooan kanepwus kkewe riiurhai, erhai me peig mwaaenin nge erhai me peig rhooapwuton. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Jesus a iura pwe, “Semaei, oamwusaar noa! Rese metaf reen minikka refeeori.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Re aekkaerh <char style="tl">dice</char> pwe repwe inetiy minikkewe mengaagiun wooar. <verse eid="LUK 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Aeremas ra iun oawruru soamwooniir Jews kkewe ra gaen aeni fetaeneei aegekkaei: “A aemenewaar aaemweoi; iwe nigiti ngaeni epwe aemenewa oanongan ngaere ennetaen pwe iiy Kristus we Deus e fini!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Sonotaw kkewe ra pwan aeni fetaeneei aegekkaei: ra itto reen ra ngaenneei <char style="tl">wine</char> kkewe emwaenn, <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>nge ra iura pwe, “Aemenewa oanongoamw ngaere ennetaen pwe een soamwooniir Jews!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Wooan tae rhimwen nge effoat pwe: “Ieen minne Kingaen Jews.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Erhai me neeiir rhooan kanepwus kkewe e kurus a gaen aessaewa pwe: “Saapw een miniwe Kristus? Aemenewoag nge wa pwan aemenewaegemaem!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Nge mwaaen we erhai a soong ngaeni a iura pwe, “Wose mesagiu Deus? Oamw mae epwan aeffitaeg ngaeni rhag aan. <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Iwe nge giirh ina efin pwe sipwe kurus pwe paniuwaen aenneew kena giirh sifeeori; nge iiy esooar min aenneew ne efeeori.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Iwe nge a aengaeni Jesus pwe, “Maengiaei, Jesus, igine wopwene noa itto noan nemenem na oamw!”<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Jesus a aengaeni pwe, “Iya ppwoneei ngaeniug raaeneei pwe een wopwe no reei noan Paradise.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maenoan Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mark 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">John 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44-45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44-45"/>Saengi nugunupaen oanowas nge aenet esa ttin no nge a rorhappiung noa faniuw we enoa gona enuuw konook; iwe nge mengaag we e tteoraeg noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we mwo nge a taeringatiw faaen ruwowu.<figure style="fig" alt=". . ." file="LB00265B.tif" size="col" loc=". . ." copy=". . ." ref="23.45"/> <verse eid="LUK 23:44-45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Jesus a aekkepwas noa nge a iura pwe, “Semaei! Iya iseni nong minne ngeoniuy noan poawumw!” E iura rhag minneei nge a nurh noa aan ngasangas.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Soamwoonin sonotaw we eweri miniwe a wen, iwe a aepingepinga Deus, nge iwe a iura pwe, “Ennet pwe erhai aeremas mwamwaai mwaaen we!”<verse eid="LUK 23:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Igiwe aeremas kkewe re maegeto pwe rhooan oawruru miniwe a wen, igiwe ra weri, ra sefaaen noa nee iimw, nge ra tugutuguw aiungeer reen aenneewaen tipeer. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Oanongeer rhooa kkewe re giuneei Jesus, fengaen me rhooapwut kkewe re tapweeito me Galilee, renoa iun oawruruto me itaaw.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paeyinoan Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mark 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">John 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51"/>Eno erhai mwaaen itan Joseph iwe re Arimathea, eew aepinoamw me noan Judea. Iiy erhai mwaaen mwamwaai nge essoar, e wewweti rhag itton minna Mweoiun Deus. Inamwo igiwe iiy erhai rhooan <char style="tl">Council</char> we, nge ese tipieew ngaeni niunniuwaen we aar me miniwe ra feeori. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>A noa reen Pilate nge a noa tingoar miniwe oanongaen Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>A noa pwinititiw miniwe oanongaen nge a tiugiumi noa noan mengaag pwerh we, nge a oawnanong noan paeyi we iwe ekken wow neeiin faai, iwe esaaen yor mwo manimae ne etonong noan. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Wooan Aenimowu miniwe, a gin egius rhag nge epwene itto Sabbath.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Rhooapwut kkewe re tapweei mwirin Jesus me Galilee ra tapweei noa Joseph ra noa weri paeyi we me wunuunun aaen miniwe oanongaen Jesus won noan. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Ra sefaaen noa nee iimw ra noa oamoannatae aar waningas me neoningas pwe repwe noa aepiti miniwe oanongaen Jesus.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Wooan Sabbath ra aseoseo, pwe ina miniwe e foatofoat noan Anniug we.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s">Aaen Jesus Menaw Sefaaen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mark 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">John 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Sunday nee oatosor moawugowug nge rhooapwut kkewe ra mwet noa reen paeyi we, nge re pweipwog noa neoningas kkewe re oamoannatae. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Ra noa weri fai we pwe a mwagiut saengi aesemaen paeyi we, <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>iwe ra toonong noan paeyi we; nge rese rhuungi miniwe oanongaen Soamwoon Jesus. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Ra riu reen meeta we a wen, iwe rhag nge riiurhai mwaaen igin marettin mengaagiiur ra iu me oaroor. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Reen aar igin mesag, rhooapwut kkewe ra foatotiw nee ppweon, nge mwaaen kkewe ra aengaeniir pwe, “Meeta faan aaemi giutta mwaaen e menaw me neeiir rhooa mae reen? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Esa nono igeei; a menaw sefaaen tae. Oaw maengiy meeta we e aengaenigaemi igiwe eno noan Galilee: <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>‘Mwaaen we Naiun Aeremas ina epwene toonong nee paiiur rhooa monofit, repwe kurusuw noa, nge mwirin enuuw raaen epwe menaw sefaaen tae.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Iwe nge ra maengiy noa meeta kkewe Jesus e aepesa, <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>ra sefaaen saengi paeyi we, ra noa fioangei ngaeniir rhooawe seig me erhai rhooan kkayeo me pwan oanongeer rhooawe aaemweoi. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Rhooapwut kkewe iwe Maria Magdalene, Joanna, me Maria we inaen James; iir me rhooapwut kkewe aaemweoi ra aengaeniir oapostonus kkewe minikkewe a wen. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Nge oapostonus kkewe ra maengiy pwe meeta we rhooapwut kkewe re aepesa nge min ffeeoretae rhag, iwe rese niugiuniug ngaeniir. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Nge Peter a iutae rhag nge a fattapw noa reen paeyi we; a pwoarotiw nge a weri pwe a mengaag kkewe rhag. Iwe a mwet sefaaen noa nee iimw nge a mwaar reen meeta we a wen.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faaeraeg Ngaeni Emmaus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Noan raaenin we rhag nge riiurhai mwaaen kkewe rhoaniuwaen Jesus ra faaeraeg ngaeni eew soapw itan Emmaus, iwe epwe fisuuw <char style="tl">miles</char> saengi Jerusalem, <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>iwe nge regaen mwaenieniy fengaen wooar reen oanongaen meeta kkewe a wen. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Igiwe re kekkepas me fioangei minikkewe, nge Jesus a noa arapeto reer iwe a itto faaeraeg eew noa meyiir; <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>nge ra weri nge rese giuneei pwe Jesus miniwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “Meeta mwu oaw iyaepesa fengaenniy, wooan aaemi feffaaeraeg noa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Iwe ra iunoa, ra mas affayeo noa. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Erhai me neeiir, itan Cleopas, a aeiineow pwe, “Een rhag me neeiir waseona wooan Jerusalem minne wose giuneei meeta kka a wewwen noan raaenin kkewe a noa?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>“Meeta kena?” a aeiyeg.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Ra paniuwaeni pwe, “Minikkewe ewen ngaeni Jesus re Nazareth we. Mwaaeneei nge erhai profeta, iwe Deus me oanongeer aeremas nge re giuneei pwe eyor maemaewan noan oanongaen meeta kka e iura me feeori. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Soamwoonin patere me mwaaen kkewe aarh ra fangenoa pwe repwe noa niiy noa, iwe me kurusuw noa. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Nge aeiya iseni aemaem aepiniugiuniug wooan pwe iiy minne epwene saeneti noa Israel me noan aenneew! Nge soapw ina rhag, pwe a enuuw raaen mwirin aan wen minikkewe. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Aaemweoi rhooapwut kkewe rhoaniuwarh minne re ariugemaem; renoa reen paeyi we nee oatosor moawugowug, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>nge rese weri miniwe oanongan. Ra sefaaeneto nge ra iura pwe aaemweoi angkenus repwae ngaeniir nge ra aengaeniir pwe iiy a menaw sefaaen tae. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Aaemweoi aemaem ra noa reen paeyi we nge ra noa weri pwe oanongaen meeta kkewe rhooapwut kkewe re aepesa nge ennet, pwe rese weri minna oanongan.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Iwe Jesus a aengaeniir pwe, “A ifa mwo pwurhomi, me mmwaeyin aaemi niugiuniug ngaeni oanongaen meeta profeta kkewe re iura! <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Pwe esoapw faer ieei wusun aaen Kristus waeiraes reen minikkeei weni mmwaen aan noa toonong noan minna nningen?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Iwe Jesus a aemmetefa ngaeniir meeta kkewe kkepesan me noan oanongaen Pwapwior we e Santus, rhaepetae me noan mini pwapwioron Moses me oanongaen minikkewe foatogieer profeta kkewe.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Igiwe ra arapeto reen soapw we re faaeraeg ngaeni, Jesus a feeori pwetae epwe faaeraeg saengiir; <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>nge iir ra ammwarhiu sefaaeniy, ra iura pwe, “Notiw remaem, epwene oaropaen pwoong nge iye a rorhappiung noa.” Iwe a toonong pwe epwene notiw reer. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Iwe a mooat tiw pwe epwene mwongo reer, a pwigi fenoawa we, nge a maeipina; a giniiy fenoawa we nge a ngaenneer. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Iwe egius mwo nge eppwun noa meseer nge ra giuneei pwe iiy, iwe rhag nge e soano saengiir. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Ra iura fengaenniy pwe, “Meeta ese weei rhag ppwunon aengaet me noan tiparh, igiwe e mwaenieniy ngaenigirh me wooan ennap reen aan aemmetefa ngaenigirh meeta we e foatofoat noan Pwapwior we e Santus?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Ra iutae rhag ra noa Jerusalem, ra noa rhuungi rhooan kkayeo kkewe seig me erhai me rhooawe aaemweoi, <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>ra iura pwe, “A menaw sefaaen Soamwoon! A pwae ngaeni Simon!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Rhooawe riiurhai ra itto fioangei ngaeniir miniwe ewen me wooan ennap, me wunuunun aar giuneei pwe iiy Soamwoon igiwe a giniiy fenoawa we.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Pwae Ngaeniir Rhooan Kkayeo Kkewe Naiun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mark 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">John 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Feof 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Oatowe rhooa kkewe riiurhai re rhiuwen mwaenieniy, nge Soamwoon e rhiuwen iunoa rhag me neeiir nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Oapoas epwe no reemi.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Ra igin mesag pwe ra maengiy pwe ra weri erhai aniu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Meeta oawwa aiuraeg reen? Meeta oawtip mwaramwar fetaen reen? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Oaw pipiiy paeyi me pirheei, pwe oawpwe weri pwe ngaang minneen. Oaw geotteopayaei, pwe oawpwe giuneei, pwe esooar aniu ne egaen yor fitigon me rhiun, nge oawpwe weri pwe eyor wooai.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Igiwe e aepesa minneei nge a pwaeri ngaeniir paiun me pirheen. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Nge iir resaaen niugiuniug rhag, reen aar igin kker me tip mwaramwar; iwe a aeiineeor pwe, “Eyor minne sipwe mwongo me igeei?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Iwe ra ngaenneei egiufet iig appwerh, <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>iwe e pwigi nge a aengi me weni mmweer aeremas kkewe.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Iwe a aengaeniir pwe, “Ikkeei minikkewe i fasiun aengaenigaemi oatowe i rhiuwen no reemi: oanongaen minikkewe effoat pwe wunuunuy noan Oasoapwosoapw we aaen Moses, me minikkewe foatogieer profeta kkewe, iwe me noan pwapwioron Psalms nge epwe nnet.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Nge a sugi noa aar niunniuwaen pwe repwe metefaaegini oawton Pwapwior we e Santus, <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>nge a aengaeniir pwe, “Ieen miniwe effoat: Kristus epwe affayeo nge a menaw sefaaen mwirin eoniuraen, <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>nge noan minna itan nge kkepas we kkepesaen toagun saengi monofit iwe me sessaenin monofit epwe fenaiuw ngaeniir oanongaen faniuw, epwe rhaepetae me Jerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Aaemi rhooan pwaeritae oanongaen minikkeei. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Iwe nge ngaang ipwene aefengatiw woami meeta we mwaaen we Semaei e ppwoneei. Nge aaemi oawpwe no rhag nee aepinoamw toori aan ittiw woami maemaew na wooai naaeng.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jesus a Noa Naaeng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mark 16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Feof 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>A pwigiir wow me noan aepinoamw we toori noa Bethany, igiwe a aeititae paiun nge a aepiniir noa. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Nugunupaen aan aepiniir nge a nigitiir pwe a noa weei naaeng. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Iir ra oassoara iiy nge ra sefaaen noa Jerusalem, reen aar igin kker, <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>nge ra no rhag noan <char style="tl">Temple</char> we reen aar fang ngaeni Deus aan aerhigerhig.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
